<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Buyu traduction</book>
  <para style="h">LOKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Loka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lok</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lok</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mwanɔ Kosɔka kwa Yɛso Kilishito <optbreak /> Byekɔlilɛ Loka</para>
  <para style="mt1">LOKA</para>
  <para style="imt">EKINGELELƆ</para>
  <para style="ip">Loka nǎ minɛ kwekɔlilɛ ê etabɔ. Kwebɛlɛ N'kilahi, eyaka kushibɛlɛ N'yola. Kwekɔlilɛ ê etabɔ yolo kosambelɛ bashi Bayola Mwanɔ Kosɔka kwa bohɔnya ohetela Yɛso Kilishito. Eyaka kɛ nǎ minɛ kwekɔlilɛ etabɔ ya Bikɔkɔ bya Bakikiwa. Kɛ Loka kushimɔninɛ Yɛso, ela kweɛbilɛ wɛ̌nɛ komanɛ yolo ya Yɛso o baya bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ oshama nǎkɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Loka kohomɔnya kɛte Yɛso Kilishito nǎ Mwǎna kwa N'to minɛ kwechǔlɛ oɛba na ohɔnya bato bebachiminɛ (Loka 19.10). Eyaka kohomɔnya kɛte Yɛso kwebɛlɛ na kɛnɛ o bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ ba ɛchiwɛ nɛhɛ biya: bambuchu, na bǎchana, na bǎna. Loka kohotɔkɔma yolo ya n'kelɔ kwa N'tema Kohaha m'biya byɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ oeta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Etabɔ ya Loka nǎ yebaba elǎhu oheta bitabɔ byɔsɛ bya Alakɔ Ahya. Wa otolá ê etabɔ, Loka kohotɔkɔma bǐngi yolo ya oboswa wa Yɛso ( Loka 1-2), kohotɔkɔma eyaka yolo ya lobotɔ lwa Yɛso (Loka 3.23-38). Eyaka kohotɔkɔma yolo ya lochunjɔ lwa Yɛso (Loka 3.21), nǎ otɔndiwa wakɛ na Ehengele (Loka 4.1-13), na n'kelɔ kwakɛ (Loka 4-21), na obewa wakɛ on'salaba (Loka 22-23), okuka wakɛ (Loka 24). Ohwa, Loka kwamɔnya byɛnɛ Yɛso kwelemɔnyinyɛ eyaka o balɔmbwɛ bakɛ nyɛndɔ chǐngi o nyuma wa okuka wakɛ. Kwebabangya o n'kelɔ wa otɔkɔma Mwanɔ Kosɔka o bato. O isula, Loka kohotɔkɔma byɛnɛ Abɛcha kwehɛchichɛ Yɛso hakolo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Botangi bwa binywa bya Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />N'nyɛmiwa Tɛɔfilɔ, we bato bɛ̌ngi beotɔnda okɔla yolo ya binywa byɔsɛ byeheteyɛ hawǐngi hɛto. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bekɔlilɛ nɛhɛ byatwesambelwɛ na baya bemɔninɛ biya bito na mɛ̌sɔ mabɔ habotangi, na baya betɔkɔmɛ́ koya mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nɛnɛ lwanyi, nelɔlilɛ bibɛnju n'kelɔ kwa Yɛso tango habotangi nǎ ohiya lênɔ. Bîya nǎ byɛnɛ byapîla naokɔlɛlɛ n'nyɛmiwa Tɛɔfilɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Naokɔlɛla yolo nehobɛnja omanɛ chikelwɛ binywa byawesɔminywɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alakɔ aoboswa wa Yɔana N'chunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Ɛlɔlɛ kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya ebalɔ ya Yulɛa, webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Sakalia. Koya Sakaliya kwebɛlɛ komwɛ hawǐngi ha bibole* bya eoto ya Abiya. M'achiakɛ kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Ɛlisabɛti, kɛ lwakɛ kwebɛlɛ kwa m'ɔka kwa Alɔni. Koya Alɔni nǎ kwebɛlɛ ebole* ya etangi m' Ishilaɛli.<verse eid="LUK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Sakaliya na Ɛlisabɛti Bɔsɛ babele bebɛlɛ bato ba chikelwɛ hambɛlɛ ha Abɛcha. Bebɛlɛ oshama m'olama ndɔ*na mibenda chɔsɛ cha Ɔlɔ Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ela bashibɛlɛ ná mwǎna, yolo Ɛlisabɛti kwebɛlɛ ekomba. Na bɔsɛ babele besebɛlɛ baongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Sakalia kwekělɛ oeta n'kelɔ kwakɛ kwa boebole n'Lobonga*, ebalɔ m'eoto yabɔ, lobɛlɛ lwɛndɔ lwakɛ lwa oeta n'kelɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Obiya, olamana na kɔlɔbɛchi cha bibolé*, Sakalia nǎ kwesɔbɔlwɛ wa bosɔbɔchi, yolo kokingelɛ n'Lobonga* na ochikya aswɛngɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Uhuma 30.7-8</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />M'maya mɛngɔ, Sakaliya hakebɛlɛ ochikya aswɛngɛ, eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ hamboka m'osaba Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ohwa, n'kɛnji* kwa Abɛcha kwen'tɔbɔɛlɛ Sakaliya n'ya n'Lobonga*. Koya n'kɛnji kwekimanɛ lǒbe lwa olomɛ lwa masabao* lwa ochikya aswɛngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakalia hakem'mɔninɛ, kwetulumuɛ, na ohambwa wɛ̌nɛ na bɔ̌ba.<verse eid="LUK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ela koya n'kɛnji* kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «Sakalia, ushibɛ na bɔ̌ba, yolo Abɛcha kwaholecha losabɔ lɔbɛ. M'achiɔbɛ Ɛlisabɛti kweobotela mwǎna kwa n'lomyana, na we n'kinyia chǐna lya Yɔana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Na kɔkwɛ wêba na sasɔ leolo, na bato bɛ̌ngi besɛ̌lɛla yolo ya oboswa wakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Koya mwana kweba n'to m'ɔsɔbu hambɛlɛ ha Ɔlɔ Abɛcha. Obibyɔ, kushibaonywa livai wala malwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Kebalelɔ 6.3</char></note>. N'tema Kohaha kwen'kilocha tango n'ta mwan'akɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />«Koya mwǎna kwekalola bato bɛ̌ngi ba elɔngɔ ya Ishilaɛli wa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwǎbɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Malaki 2.6</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Kwechwa nɛhɛ atomangwa a Abɛcha, eyaka kwêba na n'tema na boɔmɛ nɛhɛ n'languchi* Ɛlia. Kweeta bibushi bilonganɛ na bǎna babɔ. Kwekalola mitema kya baya bashionyɛmya Abɛcha,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Malaki 3.23-24</char></note>yolo babɛ na boɔmɛ́ bwa omana binywa nɛhɛ bato babɛnju hambɛlɛ ha Abɛcha. Obibyɔ, kwebangecha Ɔlɔ bato waom'pɔkɛla.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Ela Sakalia kwem'buchichɛ koya n'kɛnji kɛte: «I eto naé yembɔnya okana biya binywa byawǎtɔkɔma ibya kěnɛ? Lɔlaka, nɛnɛ na m'achianyi twesele baongo.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />N'kɛnji* kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Nɛnɛ nǎ Gabiliɛli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Lanyɛlɛ 8.16; Loka 1.26</char></note>, nɛnɛ nǎ nebakimana hambɛlɛ ha Abɛcha. Kwapila wa wele, yolo naosambelɛ konɔ mwanɔ kosɔka. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Bibi binywa byéetea m'mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Abɛcha kwekaninɛ byewelelɛ. Obibyɔ, yolo ya ushiowasha ɔbɛ biya binywa, wêba amɛmɛ. Na ushiɔsha otɔkɔma m'paka hɛnɛ bibi binywa byewelela.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />M'maya mɛngɔ, bato bebɛlɛ ohɛmba Sakalia haya hamboka, bekakelwɛ yolo ya osenga wakɛ n'Lobonga*. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Haketɔbɔɛ hamboka, kushiɔshishɛ eyaka otɔkɔma. Kwetolilɛ otɔkɔma na bato wa minywɛ, ebalɔ kwesebɛlɛ amɛmɛ. Obîya, baya bato belangilɛ kɛte kwamɔna mamwɛ malangɔ n'Lobonga*.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Sakalia hakehulɛ mɛngɔ makɛ ma n'kelɔ n'Lobonga*, kwesuelɛ o sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ohwa masuku elakɛ, m'achiakɛ Ɛlisabɛti kweswalilɛ kumɔ. Kwelebisilɛ n'ta mwa sɛsɛ myɛchi ketanɔ. Kwebɛlɛ otɔkɔma bînɔ: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Mɔnakwɛ misa kyangetela Abɛcha! Kwapunya abolɛ a bokomba andebɛlɛ naɔ hambɛlɛ ha bato.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alakɔ aoboswa wa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ komɔ lya Ɛlisabɛti lyehǐlɛ myɛ̌chi n'toba, Abɛcha kwehililɛ n'kɛnji* Gabiliɛli okya omboka kya Nasalɛti, m'ebalɔ ya Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />o amwɛ aseha eobochiwa Malia. Aya aseha ebɛlɛ okɔnjwa na komwɛ m'mwalobaka kweubuchiwa Yosofo, kwa m'mɔka kwa ɔlɔ Laole. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Koya n'kɛnji* kwehǐlɛ haya hebɛlɛ Malia na on'tanya okana: «Mɔyɔ Maliya! Obɛ na samba yolo Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwaoha mwandɔ kǒlo, nǎ kwe hamwɛchi nɔ̌bɛ.»  <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Malia hakeholechɛ biya binywa, lwɛ̌nyi lwakɛ lwehobekanɛ wɛnɛ. Kwetolilɛ olebocha kɛte: «Konɔ mwanɔ kwa n'kɛnji* kohobɛnja okaná ě?» <figure style="fig" alt="L'ange dit à Marie qu'elle va engendrer Jésus" file="DN00401b.tif" size="span" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="1.29">N'kɛnji kwan'sambela Maliya kéte wêbota yɛso</figure> <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ela n'kɛnji* kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «Holechaka Malia, ushibɛ na bɔ̌ba, yolo Abɛcha kwaoha mwandɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Weswala kumɔ, na webota mwǎna kwa n'lomyana, na wě n'kinyia chǐna lyakɛ Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Kweba m'hɛla na kweba obuchiwa: ‹Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha kwe hakolo.› Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwem'ha ete ya boɔlɔ bwa sakɛ olo Laole. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kweshama milombo o boɔlɔ bwa Ishilaɛli, na boɔlɔ bwakɛ bushîba na esula.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia kwem'bochichɛ n'kɛnji* kɛte: «Bibyɔ binywa byéétea wé, nǎ nɛnɛ nishinamǎná balomyana?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />N'kɛnji* kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «N'tema Kohaha kwěosalela, na boɔmɛ bwa Abɛcha kwe hakolo bwechwa wawele na oubuila nɛhɛ echulichuli. Yolo ya bîya, mwana kweboswa kwêbá M'haha, na kwebochiwa Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Holechaka: Ɛlisabɛti kwa m'mɔka kɔbɛ, kɛ lwakɛ kwe na kumɔ lya myɛchi n'toba, lya mwǎna kwa n'lomyana, mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kwesele m'ongo eyǎka ekomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Yolo ushi ishinaetea wa Abɛcha.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Nǎ Malia kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Nɛnɛ nee n'kichi kwa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha. Abecha kongetelɛ byawǎtɔkɔma.» Ohwa, koya n'kɛnji* kwekělɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malia kwǎkya oɛnɛna Ɛlisabɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ohwa masuku manɛ, Malia kwehuminɛ abelɔ okya m'paka o kemwɛ mboka kya toɔnɔ twa ebalɔ ya Yolɛa. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Hakehǐlɛ obɔ, kwekingelɛ n'sɛsɛ kya Sakalia na on'tanya Ɛlisabɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ɛlisabɛti hakeholechɛ otanya wa Malia, m'mɔka maya mɛngɔ, mwǎna kwebɛlɛ n'ta kumɔ lya Ɛlisabɛti kweletekechɛ. Na Ɛlisabɛti kwekilochwɛ na N'tema Kohaha. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Kwetɔkɔmɛ wa lete leolo okana: «Abɛcha kwaohalela oheta bǎchana bɔsɛ, na mwǎna kwawebota, kɛlwakɛ kwem'halelwɛ! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nɛnɛ n'nanyi wa n'nakɛ kwa Ɔlɔ lyanyi kochwɛ okɛnɛna? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Naosambela, m'mɔka maya mɛngɔ mandaholecha otanya ɔbɛ, mwǎna kwe n'ta kumɔ lyanyi kwaletekecha wɛ̌nɛ eyaka wa sasɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Komba kɔkwɛ, yolo wewashishɛ okana biya byɛnɛ byeokaninɛ Ɔlɔ Abɛcha byewelela ka.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwěmbɔ lwa Maliya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Obibyɔ, Malia kwekaninɛ kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«N'tema kwanyi kohotɔna Ɔlɔ Abɛcha wɛ̌nɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />eyǎka kwékokilulɛ na sasɔ wěnɛ yolo ya Ɔlɔ Abɛcha M'hɔnya kwǎnyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Yolo kwandɔla nɛnɛ n'kichi kwǎkɛ minɛ nishi eto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Kěnɛ, otola lênɔ, bato bɔ̂sɛ́ bebahombocha n'to kwa komba,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />yolo Abɛcha kwa Oɔma kwangetela bikɔkɔ biolo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Chǐna lyakɛ i lehaha kěnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Mɛngɔ mɔsɛ, kweba homɔnya misa kyakɛ obaya beban'nyɛmya.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Kwaeta bikɔkɔ biolo ohetela obɔ̂ wakɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Kwahɔmbɔlɔla bato bɛnɛ bebabá na n'tema kwa anɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Bɛnɛ be m'boɔlɔ, kwabasacha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">na bebalesachɛ, kwabahɛcha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Ayubu 5.11; 12.19</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Beholechɛ ndala, kwabakalola bambɔna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">Ela bambɔna, kwabasuecha mabɔ̂ hɔlɔmbwɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kwechǔlɛ owasha elɔngɔ yakɛ Ishilaɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">kwasaebelela omɔnya misa kyǎkɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nɛhɛ byakelakilɛ ba sɛto olo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">Ibulaimu nǎ lobotɔ lwakɛ milombo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia kweshaminɛ wa Ɛlisabɛti olanga mɛngɔ ma myɛchi ketato. Ohwa bîya kwesuelɛ wabɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oboswa wa Yɔana N'chunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Hamehǐlɛ mɛngɔ ma Ɛlisabɛti obota, kwebutilɛ mwǎna kwa n'lomyana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Babinji nakɛ na bashiwabɔ habeholechɛ mwanɔ okana Abɛcha kwam'ɔnɛna kɛnɛ chɛ̌nɛ, besɛ̌lɛlɛ hamwɛchi nakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwǎna hakehǐchɛ masuku enana ma oboswa, bekělɛ nakɛ o kombe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Balawi 12.3</char></note> Bebɛnjichɛ on'kinyia chîna lya sakɛ Sakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ela, n'nakɛ kwa mwǎna kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Nǎngo, kwekinyiwa chǐna lya Yɔana.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bɔ ben'sambelɛ kɛte: «N'ta lobotɔ lwɛnyu ushi n'to kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwee na lelyɔ chǐna!»<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Obibyɔ, bebuchichɛ sakɛ kwa mwǎna wa minywɛ kɛte: «China nake weobɛnja tokinyiɛ mwǎna?» <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakalia kwebasabilɛ ieba ya lobaɔ, na okɔla hakolo hakɛ kɛte: «Chǐna lya mwǎna i Yɔana.» Bɔsɛ bekakelwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Hɔka haya, lulimi lwa Sakalia lwesuliyɛ eyǎka, kwetolilɛ otɔkɔma eyaka na otɔna Abɛcha wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Babinji nakɛ bɔsɛ bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba. Koya mwanɔ kwehǐlɛ ngobe chɔsɛ n'toya toɔnɔ twa ebalɔ ya Yolɛa.<verse eid="LUK 1:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bato bɔsɛ habeholechɛ koya mwanɔ, bebɛlɛ olebosha m'mitema kyabɔ okana: «Koko mwǎna minɛ kwaboswa kweba n'to kwa wé?» I kěnɛ, boɔmɛ́ bwa Abɛcha bwebɛlɛ hamwɛ̂chi nakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwěmbɔ lwa Sakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakalia, sakɛ kwa mwǎna, kwekilochwɛ na N'tema Kohaha, kwetolilɛ olangola bînɔ:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Kotɔnywɛ Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwa Ishilaɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">yolo kwǎchwa owasha na ohɔnya bato bakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Kwatohilila m'hɔnya minɛ kwe na oɔma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">minɛ kwahumina n'lobotɔ lwa n'kichi kwakɛ Laole.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Biya byeholamana na byakekaninɛ ala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">ohetela ŋanguchi* chakɛ chihaha okana<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kwetohilila koya minɛ kwetohɔnya ohumá m'mabɔ̂ ma tomango twɛto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">na m'mabɔ̂ ma baya bɛnɛ bebatoɔnywa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Kwemɔnyinyɛ kɛnɛ chakɛ o basɛto olo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">eyaka kwasakebelela alaki* akɛ ahaha.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Kweitilɛ biya olamana na byakelahilɛ sɛto olo Ibulaimu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />okana kwetohɔnya m'mabɔ̂ ma tomango twɛto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">ebalɔ tom'etelɛ n'kelɔ bila bɔ̌ba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />n'ta bohaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">eyǎka m'oeta bya chikelwɛ hambɛlɛ hakɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">Masuku mɔsɛ n'ta mwɛkɔ kwɛto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.75 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ mwanzɔ 22.16-17</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na kɔkwɛ mwanânyi, wêba obuchiwa n'languchi* kwa Abɛcha kwe hakolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">ebalɔ kɔkwɛ nǎ wěhiya hambɛlɛ ha Ɔlɔ ohiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">yolo on'lɔngɛchɛlɛ ndela.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Eyaka kɔkwɛ nǎ kwesambela bato bakɛ okana wǎchwa obahɔnya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">m'olɛ̌lɛla bobé bwabɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Olamana na byebabá Abɛcha kwɛ̌to na kɛnɛ chingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">kwetohilila yɛngɛ ya hakolo nɛhɛ chǒba lya ham'ɛshi, lyɛnɛ lyetolamia.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Kwelamia bɛnɛ be n'ta n'tɔ, na bɛnɛ bem'echulichuli ya lubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">yolo kotowashɛ olama ndela kya talala.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Koya mwǎna kweɔminɛ, na kwekelelelɛ oba n'to kwa m'ɔmɛ. Kwekělɛ oshama n'ta longo* nabyehǐlɛ lusuku lwa kelemɔnyinyɛ o elɔngɔ ya Ishilaɛli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Oboswa wa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />M'maya masuku, ɔlɔ Aisaliya Agushitɔ kwa Lɔma kwehunyinyɛ m'benda okana machǐna ma bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ olɔliwa na ebalɔ ya baloma babaliwɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oya okɔla machǐna ma bato i yolo ya n'to kɛkɛsɛ kobɛ uhunya n'lambo wa ɔlɔ minɛ kwebɛlɛ Lɔma</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Okɔla wa lwɛndɔ lwa lotangi wêteyɛ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Kulɛniɔ kwebɛlɛ m'hɛla kwa ebalɔ ya Suliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bato bɔsɛ bekelɛ okɔliwa kwabâlwa m'ebalɔ yakɛ ya oboswa, yolo chǐna lyakɛ lyekɔliwɛ oya. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosofo lwakɛ kwehuminɛ m'ebalɔ ya Galilaya m'mboka kya Nasalɛti. Kwekělɛ ebalɔ ya Yolɛa m'mboka kyebusilwɛ ɔlɔ Laole kyehobochiwa Bɛtɛlɛ̌mu. Kwekělɛ oya ebalɔ kwebɛlɛ kwa m'ɔka kwa Laole. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />A hokya obalwa, kwekělɛ hamwɛchi na m'achiǎkɛ Maliya minɛ kwebɛlɛ na kumɔ hɔka na obota. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Habebɛlɛ Bɛtelɛ̌mu, nǎ lusuku lwakɛ lwa obota lwehǐlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Kwebutilɛ mwanakɛ kwan'tangi kwa n'lomyana. Kwem'builɛ ngobɔ cha bolɛla na kwem'bichichɛ m'elɛkɔ ya oleshesha nyama, yolo bashibamɔnɛ ibu n'sɛsɛ kya bakɛnyi<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">n'kɛnji kwasambela baumbi mwanɔ kwa oboswa wa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />M'eya ebalɔ mwebɛlɛ baumbi. Baya baumbi bebɛlɛ oshama obitola m'ǒmba bisukanywa byabɔ busuku. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />N'kɛnji* kwa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwebatɔbɔɛlɛ ekaka, na lwɛ̌ngɛ lwa okɛngɛta lwa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha lwebakɛngɛtɛlɛ ngobe chɔsɛ, bemɔninɛ bɔ̌ba bwɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ela n'kɛnji* kwebasambelɛ binɔ: «Mushibɛ na bɔ̌ba, yolo nan'chula na mwanɔ kosɔka kwa sasɔ leolo lyɛnɛ lyeba o bato bɔsɛ: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />lenɔ M'hɔnya kwɛnyu kwaboswa m'mboka kya Laule minɛ kohobuchiwa Kilishito* eyaka Ɔlɔ lyɛnyu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Yem'ɔnya nakɛ nǎ kɛnyikɛ nǎ enɔ: mwem'banga mwǎna kwa alɛlá kwen'chuiwɛ ngobɔ cha bolɛlá kwem'bichiwɛ m'elɛkɔ ya olesha nyama.» <figure style="fig" alt="Les bergers reçoivent la nouvelle de la naissance de Jésus" file="WA03803b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="2.12">Baumbi bahɛwa mwanɔ kwa oboswa wa Yɛso</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Hɔka haya koya n'kɛnji* kwemɔne nǎ eoto eolo ya bangɛ bakɛnji uhuma hakolo m'otɔna Abɛcha kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Abɛcha kotɔnwɛ hakolo na bato bakebabɛnja m'ebalɔ babe na talala!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baumbi bakya omɔna mwana Bɛtɛlɛ̌mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ohwa bîya, bakɛnji belɛanɛ na baumbi na besowela hakolo, haya baumbi betolilɛ osambelana kɛte: «Binɔ tobɛkewa Bɛtɛlɛ̌mu, tokyɛ omɔna biya byɛnɛ byetosambelɛ Ɔlɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bekělɛ oya abelɔ, bebangilɛ Maliya na Yosofo na koya mwǎna kwa alɛla kwabichiwa m'elɛkɔ yebalela nyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Baumbi habehulɛ omɔna mwǎna, bekělɛ okana mwanɔ kwɛnɛ n'kɛnji* kwebasambelɛ yolo ya koya mwǎna. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ beholechɛ binywa bya baumbi, bekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ela Maliya kwebǐlɛ biya binywa n'ta n'tema kwakɛ na obilanga wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Nǎ baya baumbi besuelɛ. Bebɛlɛ okya m'on'tɔna Abɛcha na on'kembela yolo ya binywa byɔsɛ byabeholechɛ na omɔna. Ebalɔ bebangilɛ binywa byɔsɛ byebasambelɛ n'kɛnji.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwǎna kwakinyiwa chǐna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mwǎna hakehilɛ masuku enana ma oboswa, bem'hichichɛ o kombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe lya Bayola lishilehutanɛ na kombe lya Baboyo lya bubisɔkɔlɔ</char></note>, ben'kinyiyɛ chǐna lya Yɛso, lyɛnɛ n'kɛnji kwesambelɛ Malia hambɛlɛ ha kɛ obá na kumɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya na Yosofo bam'hicha Yɛso n'Lobonga*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Masuku ma ohahachwa* wa Yosofo na Maliya olamana na ndɔ kya Musa mewelelɛ. Betɛtilɛ mwǎna Yɛso Yɛlusalɛma yolo bam'beyɛ hambɛlɛ ha Ɔlɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Balawi 12.2-6</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Beitilɛ biya, yolo ibikɔliwɛ n'ta ndɔ* kya Ɔlɔ kɛte: «Kɛkɛsɛ m'boswa kwa n'tangi kwa n'lomyana kwetangelwa wa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Uhuma 13.2, 12</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Eyǎka betangelɛ tambekɔ*olamana na koya m'benda kwa Abɛcha kohokana kɛte: «Tohɛlɛ tobele aɔ miombo kebele kya tokondolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Balawi 12.8</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bolangochi bwa Shimɛɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />M'mboka kya Yɛlusalema mwebɛlɛ komwɛ n'to kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Shimɛɔni. Koya Shimɛɔni kwebɛlɛ n'to kwa chikelwɛ hambɛlɛ ha Abɛcha na om'oka. Kwebɛlɛ hɛmba wa yǒma ohɔnywa wa elɔngɔ ya Ishilaɛli. N'tema Kohaha kwebɛlɛ hamwɛchi nǎkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />eyaka kwebɛlɛ on'kanina kɛte kushîwa nâmbɔ kushinamɔna Kilishito minɛ kwehilwa na Ɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Na Shimɛɔni wa olɔmbɔlwa na N'tema Kohaha, kwekingelɛ n'Lobonga*. Bibushi bya Yɛso byekingelɛ na mwanǎbɔ n'ta, yolo bam'etɛ byɛnɛ M'benda* kwebakana. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Shimɛɔni kwetɛtilɛ mwǎna Yɛso m'mabɔ̂ makɛ, kwetolilɛ otɔna Abɛcha okana:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Ɔlɔ, waeta enywa ya welakilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">obɛndɛa nɛnɛ n'kambi kɔ̌bɛ nilewelɛ wa talala.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Yolo nɛnɛ minɛ namɔna wa mɛ̌sɔ manyi M'hɔnya minɛ kwawahila.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Wan'lɔngya ebalɔ kobɛ m'hɔnya* hambɛlɛ ha bato bɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Koya m'hɔnywa i yɛ̌ngɛ yɛnɛ yelamia bilɔngɔ byɔsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">eyaka nǎ kwêha elɔngɔ yɔbɛ Ishilaɛli bɛjibɛji.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Biya binywa byetɔkɔmɛ Shimɛɔni yolo ya Yɛso, bikakechɛ bibushi byakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ohwa Shimɛɔni kwebahalilɛ na kwen'sambelɛ Maliya n'nakɛ kwa mwǎna kɛte: «Holechiwɛ: koko mwǎna kwaboswa yolo kokushɛ bato bɛ̌ngi hawingi ha Baishilaɛli na okimia bɛ̌ngi m'ebalɔ ya Ishilaɛli. Nakɛ kweba ekake ohuma wa Abɛcha, yɛnɛ bato bɛ̌ngi behanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Obibyɔ malanga ma bato bɛ̌ngi mabiswɛ, mebisulwa. Na kɔkwɛ minɛ wesosoa nɛhɛ minɛ kwatɛwa o n'tema.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Hebɛlɛ komwɛ m'achana m'ongo wɛ̌nɛ, kwebɛlɛ n'languchi, chǐna lyakɛ kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Ana, kwebɛlɛ enyundu ya Fanuɛli, kwa lobotɔ lwa Ashɛli. Koya Ana kweetilɛ myâ njwe kya osɔngwa n'lomɛakɛ kwebulɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Kɛ nôshikala bila n'lomɛ miâ maumi enana na bina. Maya mɛngɔ mɔsɛ kweshaminɛ n'Lobonga* m'oetela Abɛcha n'kelɔ, m'ohamba na osaba busuku na chǒba. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Kwehǐlɛ m'mɔka maya mɛngɔ ma Shimɛɔni, na kwetolilɛ otɔna Abɛcha. Kwebelɛ okana mwanɔ kwa Yɛso o bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ hɛmba byɛnɛ Abɛcha kwehɔnya bato ba Yɛlusalɛma m'masoso mabɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bibushi bya Yɛso byasuela Nasalɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Bibushi bya Yɛso habyehulɛ oeta byɔsɛ, byɛnɛ m'benda kwa Abɛcha ikotɔkɔmɛ, byesuelɛ nakɛ wabɔ Nasalɛti m'ebalɔ ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Yɛso kwebɛlɛ ǒla na oɔma, kwebɛlɛ na lwɛ̌nyi lwingi, na mwandɔ kya Abɛcha kyebɛlɛ hamwɛchi nakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso n'ta Lobonga*lwa Abɛcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kila mwâ, bibushi bya Yɛso byebɛlɛ okya Yɛlusalɛma mɛngɔ ma m'onda kwa Pasaka*. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ na miâ umi na kebele, kɛ na bibushi byakɛ behɛlilɛ okya o koya m'onda nɛhɛ kyebɛlɛ kɔlɔbɛchi lya Bayola<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obayola, mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mwǎna kwahiya myâ umi na kebele, bebɛlɛ okana kɛte kushi eyaka mwǎnyuɛ. Haya, bebɛlɛ okana kɛte kwahoba hɔka na baya bato bahosenga n'ta dini </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />M'onda kwa Pasaka* hakwehulɛ, bibushi bya Yɛso byesuelɛ wabɔ. Ela Yɛso kweshikalɛ Yɛlusalɛma, bibushi byakɛ bishimanyinyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Byelangilɛ kwebɛlɛ hamwɛchi na eoto ya bɛndɔ nakɛ. Habenyatilɛ chǒba lyɔsɛ, betolilɛ om'ɛbɛla hawǐngi ha bashiwabɔ na bɛnɛ bebamananɛ nǎbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ela bashim'mɔninɛ. Obibyɔ, besuelɛ eyǎka Yɛlusalɛma m'om'ɛba.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ohwa musuku matato, bem'bangilɛ n'Lobonga* lwa Abɛcha kwen'shamɛ na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ*, m'obaholecha na obabocha binywa. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bɔsɛ bɛnɛ beholechɛ binywa byakɛ, bekakelwɛ na lwɛ̌nyi lwakɛ na okaa wakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Bibushi byakɛ habyem'mɔninɛ, byekakelwɛ. Nǎ Maliya n'nakɛ kwem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Haa! Mwananyi, yolo ya e watoetela bibyɔ? Sɔbɛ na nɛnɛ twabaohoɛba na anyɔngɔtɛla hɛ̌nɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Yolo ya e môkɛba? Mushibamǎnɛ okana i bibɛnju nɛnɛ oba n'sɛsɛ kya Tata?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ela bɔnyibɔ bashimaninɛ yolo ya e kwebasambelɛ biya. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Uesula, Yɛso kwesuelɛ Nasalɛti hamwɛchi nǎbɔ. Kwebɛlɛ oeta byɛnɛ byebɛlɛ on'sambela bibushi byakɛ. Biya binywa byɔsɛ, n'nakɛ kwebɛlɛ bibea n'ta n'tema kwakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Na Yɛso kwebɛlɛ ǒla n'ta lwɛ̌nyi na echuli, eyaka kwebɛlɛ obɛnja Abɛcha na bato.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Binywa bya Yɔana N'chunji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yɔa 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />O mwâ kwa umi na kotânɔ kwa boɔlɔ bwa Aisalia Tibɛliɔ, bɛnɛ beetilɛ n'kelɔ nǎkɛ nǎ banɔ: Pɔtiɔ Pilatɔ nǎ kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya ebalɔ ya Yolɛa, na Ɛlɔlɛ kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya ebalɔ ya Galilaya, na Filipɔ n'shiwabɔ kwa Tibɛliɔ kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya Itulia na Talakɔnitina. Na Lusania kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya ebalɔ ya Abilɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi na Kayafa bebɛle bibole* biolo bya Abɛcha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:2">M'maya mɛngɔ nǎ mɛnɛ binywa bya Abɛcha byehǐlɛ Yɔana mwǎna kwa Sakalia lwakebɛlɛ n'ta longo. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Koya Yɔana kwebɛlɛ oheta m'maboka mɛnɛ mebɛlɛ hɔka na lǒte lwa Yɔlɔlani. Kwebɛlɛ okya na tokoma o bato okana balebɛ̌chɛ na bachunjiwɛ, ebalɔ Abɛcha kolɛɛlɛlɛ́ bobé bwabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Binɔ binywa byawelela byekɔlilɛ ebole* Isaya okana kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Lete lya n'to komwɛ̂chi leoholechiwa n'ta longo*okana kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Lɔngyakwɛ ndela kya Ɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">kɔlɔlakwɛ mwakehetela!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Hɔsɛ he ehɔnga hehulilwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">He Yelokolo na aɔnɔ byɔsɛ byelɔngiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Matela mamabungamɛ mekɔlɔlwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na matela mɛnɛ mee matɔ̌kɛ melɔngiwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na bato bosɛ bemɔna bohɔnya bwɛnɛ bwechwa na Abɛcha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Isaya 40.3-5</char></note>!› »<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Obibyɔ, bato bɛ̌ngi bechulɛ wa Yɔana yolo kobachundɛ. Ela Yɔana kwebɛlɛ obasambela kɛte: «Bɛnywɛ mwe nɛhɛ ibushi ya ndɔa! I nanyi kwam'mɔnya ndela mosenɛ ateka a Abɛcha hechwa? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mobɛ omɔnya kɛte mwalɛa bobé olamana na bikɔkɔ byɛnyu! Eyǎka mushibɛ olemɔnya m'okana kɛte: ‹Bɛswɛ, sɛto olo nǎ Ibulaimu.› Nehon'sambela kěnɛ, Abɛcha kwenakalola mama mawɛ oba bǎna ba Ibulaimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Holechiwɛ! Ehoso yesele ibiiwɛ hɔka na shina lya n'te. Ebalɔ n'te kɔkɔsɛ kushi oha bikuma bya bisɔka, kwealwa na otɛlwa m'ahya.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ohwa, baya bato bem'buchichɛ Yɔana kɛte: «Hanɔ toetɛ ě?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yɔana kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Koya minɛ kwee na ngobɔ chibele kokabanyɛ o koya kushi na ngobɔ. Na koya minɛ kwee na elewa, koetɛ byɔ̂ka bîya.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Bamwɛ bawa n'lambo lwabɔ, bechǔlɛ wa Yɔana yolo kobachundɛ. Bem'buchichɛ Yɔana: «N'lɔmbɔchi, bɛswɛ lweto toetɛ wé?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yɔana kwebakailɛ: «Mushibɛ osaba n'lambo oheta byamwakaninwa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Bilusha lwabyɔ byem'buchichɛ: «Bɛswɛ, lwɛto toetɛ wé?» Yɔana kwebakailɛ: «Mushibɛ osapa bomɔna bwa n'to, aɔ mushibɛ obikicha n'to bya lulimi. Ela, mobɛ okyota na bomɔna bwamweohɛwa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ ohɛmba ochwa wa Mashiya*. Obibyɔ, betolilɛ olebocha m'mitema kyǎbɔ yolo ya Yɔana N'chunji nambɔ kɛ kushi koya Mashiya. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Obibyɔ,Yɔana kwebakaninɛ baya bato bɔsɛ kɛte: «Nɛnɛ nehon'chunda n'ta mǎte, ela koya minɛ kwehochwa unyuma wanyi, nǎ kwe na boɔmɛ oheta nɛnɛ. Nishilěngyɛ osula mikɔchi kya mikalabanda kyǎkɛ. Kɛnyikɛ nǎ kwen'chunda wa N'tema Kohaha na wa ahya. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Binɔ kwesele na lohɛ m'mabɔ̂ makɛ yolo kohulɛ n'kembo ohunya bihopo n'ta mbotɔ. Na keya mbotɔ kwekebea m'ahɔmbɔ hakɛ. Ela biya bihopo byɔ̂sɛ kwebitɛla m'ahya hɛnɛ ashibachima.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yɔana kwekelelelɛ na okanina bato Mwanɔ Kosɔka, na obasɔmya bingɛ binywa bǐngi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ɔlɔ Ɛlɔlɛ kwekuhilɛ Ɛlɔlia m'achi kwa n'shiwabɔ. Eyǎka kwebɛlɛ oeta bongɛ bobé bwǐngi. Yolo ya biya, Yɔana kwem'ambelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ela Ɛlɔlɛ kweetilɛ ekɔkɔ ebé wɛ̌nɛ m'on'tɛla Yɔana n'ta kolé.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwǎchunjiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ baya bato bɔsɛ behulɛ ochundiwa, Yɛso lwakɛ kwechundiwɛ. Hakebɛlɛ osaba Abɛcha, kolo lyebukuɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na N'tema Kohaha kwen'salilɛ Yɛso nɛhɛ akondolo. Lete lyehulichiwɛ ohuma hakolo okana: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ Mwanânyi minɛ kwandem'bɛnjɛ wɛ̌nɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Wabole 2.7</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">M'ɔka kwa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yɛsu hakehǐchɛ miâ olanga maumi matato, kwetolilɛ n'kelɔ kwakɛ. Bato bebɛlɛ olanga kɛte kwebábá mwǎna kwa Yosofo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Koya Yosofo kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Ɛli.<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Na Ɛli kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Matali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Matali mwǎna kwa Lawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Lawi mwǎna kwa Mɛlɛki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Mɛlɛki mwǎna kwa Yanai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">na Yanai mwǎna kwa Yosofo,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />koya Yosofo kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Matatia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Matatia mwǎna kwa Amɔshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Amɔshi mwǎna kwa Naumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Naumu mwǎna kwa Ɛshili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">na Ɛshili mwana kwa Nagai.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />koya Nagai kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Maati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Maati mwǎna kwa Matatia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Matatia mwǎna kwa Shɛmɛni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Shɛmɛni mwǎna kwa Yɔsɛki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">na Yɔsɛki mwǎna kwa Yɔla.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />koya Yɔla kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Yɔhanani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Yɔanani mwǎna kwa Lɛsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Lɛsa mwǎna kwa Sɛlubabɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Sɛlubabɛli mwǎna kwa Shalatiɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">na Shalatiɛli mwǎna kwa Nɛli, na Nɛli kwebɛlɛ<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwǎna kwa Mɛlɛki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Mɛlɛki mwana kwa Ali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Ali mwǎna kwa Kɔsamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Kɔsamu mwǎna kwa Ɛlɛmalamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">na Ɛlɛmalamu mwǎna kwa Ɛli.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />na Ɛli kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Yɔshua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yɔshua mwǎna kwa Ɛliasɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Ɛliasɛli mwǎna kwa Yɔlini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yɔlini mwǎna kwa Matali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">na Matali mwǎna kwa Lawi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />na Lawi kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Shimɛɔni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Shimɛɔni mwǎna kwa Yola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yola mwǎna kwa Yosofo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yosofo mwǎna kwa Yɔnamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yɔnamu mwǎna kwa Ɛliakimu.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Na Ɛliakimu kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Mɛlɛa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Mɛlɛa mwǎna kwa Mɛna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Mɛna mwǎna kwa Matata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Matata mwǎna kwa Natani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">na Natani mwǎna kwa Laole.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Na Laole kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Yɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Yɛsɛ mwǎna kwa Ɔbɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Ɔbɛli mwǎna kwa Bɔasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Bɔasi mwǎna kwa Sɔlɔmɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">na Sɔlɔmɔnɔ mwǎna kwa Nashɔni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />na Nashɔni kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Aminalabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Aminalabu mwǎna kwa Alumini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Alumini mwǎna kwa Alɔni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Alɔni mwǎna kwa Ɛshilɔni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Ɛshilɔni mwǎna kwa Pɛlɛsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">na Pɛlɛsi mwǎna kwa Yola,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />na Yola kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Yakɔbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Yakɔbɔ mwǎna kwa Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Isaka mwǎna kwa Ibulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Ibulaimu mwǎna kwa Tɛla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">na Tɛla mwǎna kwa Nahɔli.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Na Nahɔli kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Sɛlugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Sɛlugi mwǎna kwa Lɛu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Lɛu mwǎna kwa Pɛlɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Pɛlɛgi mwǎna kwa Ɛbɛle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ɛbɛle mwǎna kwa Sala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">na Sala kwebɛlɛ <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwǎna kwa Kainamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Kainamu mwǎna kwa Alufakasali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Alufakasali mwǎna kwa Shɛmu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Shɛmu mwǎna kwa Nɔa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">na Nɔa mwǎna kwa Lamɛki.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Na Lamɛki kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Mɛtusɛla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Mɛtusɛla mwǎna kwa Ɛnɔki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Ɛnɔki mwǎna kwa Yalɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Yalɛli mwǎna kwa Mahalalɛli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">na Mahalalɛli mwǎna kwa Kainamu.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Na Kainamu kwebɛlɛ mwǎna kwa Ɛnɔshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Ɛnɔshi mwǎna kwa Sɛti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Sɛti mwǎna kwa Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Alamu kwebombilwɛ na Abɛcha.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ehengele kwan'tɔnda Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Ohwa ochundiwa, Yɛso kwesuelɛ ohuma o lǒte lwa Yɔlɔlani, kwen'kilolɛ na N'tema Kohaha. Koya N'tema Kohaha kwen'lɔmbɔlɛ okya n'ta longo. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Oya, Ehengelé kwen'tɔndilɛ mɛngɔ ma masuku maumi mana. M'maya mɛngɔ mɔsɛ, kushibɛlɛ oya eto, wala onywa. Ohwa maya masuku kweholechɛ ndala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ná Ehengelé kwen'sambelɛ binɔ: «Nambɔ chikelwɛ kɔkwɛ wee Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha, kaninaka lele lewɛ lyekaloɛ n'katɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «I bikɔliwɛ n'ta Lokɔlɔ Lohaha kɛte: ‹N'to kushibâbá yolo ya oya n'katɛ ka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Langmelɔ 8.3</char></note>.› »<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ohwa, Ehengelé kwen'kuhilɛ eyaka Yɛso o ibu ya hakolo, kwem'mɔnyinyɛ hɔka haya boɔlɔ bɔsɛ bwa ebalɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Ehengelé kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «Neoha boɔmɛ́ bɔsɛ na bomɔná bwakɛ bɔsɛ. Yolo bibi byɔsɛ bepɛlɛ nɛnɛ, na nɛnɛ nenaha kɛkɛsɛ kwandebɛnja. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Bobo bɔsɛ bomɔna bwêba bɔbɛ nǎmbɔ wǎnɛmbɛtɛla.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Mikɔlɔ Kehaha i kekanɛ kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">‹Obɛ olɛmbɛtɛla Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kɔ̌bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">na on'kelela kɛ mǐnɛ ka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Langelɔ 6.13-14</char></note>.› »<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ohwa haya, Ehengelé kwen'kuhilɛ Yɛso m'paka Yɛlusalɛma, na kwem'hɛchichɛ hakolo ha Lobonga*, kɛ naon'sambela kɛte: «Nǎmbɔ chikelwɛ kɔkwɛ wee Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha, letɛlakɛ hase, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />yolo ibikɔliwɛ n'Lokɔlɔ Lohaha kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‹Abɛcha kwehicha bakɛnji* bakɛ baokǒngɛ.›<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Eyǎka ibikɔlilwɛ kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">‹Beowata m'mabɔ̂ mabɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">yolo ushilehyatalɛ okolo o lewɛ.› »<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Mikɔlɔ Kehaha i kekanɛ kɛte: ‹Ushibɛ otɔnda Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kɔ̌bɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Langelɔ 6.16</char></note>.› » <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ehengelé hakehulɛ on'tɔnda Yɛso o matela mɔsɛ, kwetangilɛ on'lɛa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso m'ebalɔ ya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Ohwa haya, Yɛso kwesuelɛ m'ebalɔ ya Galilaya kwebɛlɛ n'kelolɛ na oɔma wa N'tema Kohaha. Na mwanɔ kwakɛ kwewelelɛ m'ebalɔ yɔsɛ ya Galilaya na bibalɔ bya ŋumba. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Na kwetolilɛ osɔmya bato m'mashinagɔgi* mabɔ, na bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ on'tɔna.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bato ba Nasalɛti bam'hanya Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Lomwɛ lusuku Yɛso kwekělɛ o mboka kya Nasalɛti wɛnɛ wakeɔmɛnɛ. Lusuku lwa Sabatɔ* halwewelelɛ, kwekingelɛ n'ta Shinagɔgi* nɛhɛ lyebɛlɛ kɔlɔbɛchi lyakɛ. Kwekimanɛ yolo kosɔmyɛ Mikɔlɔ Kehaha. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bem'hɛlɛ binga lya etabɔ ya ebole* Isaya. Kwěbungulɛ, na kwebangilɛ hɛnɛ hehakɔliwɛ kɛte:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«N'tema kwa Abɛcha kwe hakolo hanyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kwasɔbɔla nebɛ otɔkɔma Mwanɔ Kosɔka o ba mbuchu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Kwapila yolo nasambelɛ bahambwa kɛte besulwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Na bihɔbu kɛte byemɔna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na bɛnɛ behomɔnyɛnywa, kɛte bashimɔnyɛnywɛ eyǎka.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na obasambela bato kɛte mwâ kwa mwandɔ wa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwahiyá<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaya 61.1-2</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ohwa osɔma, Yɛso kwembungilɛ ěya etabɔ, kwěsuechɛ on'kichi kwa leya Shinagɔgi*, kɛ nǎoshama. Bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ n'lea shinagɔgi* ben'lɔlilɛ wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ohwa osɔma, Yɛso kwetolilɛ obasambela kɛte: «Lolo Lokɔlɔ Lohaha lwamwaholecha, nehon'sɔmɛna lwawelela lênɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bato bɔsɛ, besɛ̌lɛlɛ Yɛso, na okakelwa na binywa bibɛnju byaketɔkɔmɛ. Betolilɛ okana binɔ: «We, koko kushi mwǎna kwa Yosofo?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Nikiti mwesambela koko m'hengo kohobɛnja okana é: ‹N'kilahi lehɔnyɛ kɔkwɛ minɛ.› Eyǎka mwesambela kɛte: ‹Twaholecha byɔsɛ byawǎeta oya Apɛlɛnaumu, obibyɔ obietɛ na n'kenɔ mboka kyɔ̌bɛ.› » <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yɛsu kwetɔkɔmɛ eyǎka binɔ: «Nehon'kanina kěnɛ kɛte: ushi n'languchi*minɛ kwebanyɛmiwa m'boka kyǎbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ela holechiwɛ! kěnɛ nehon'kanina, webɛlɛ mɛngɔ ma n'languchi Elia bǎchana babulwa bɛ̌ngi m'ebalɔ ya Ishilaɛli. M'maya mɛngɔ, mbula kyelɛilɛ olɔwa n'ta miâ ketato na myɛ̌chi n'toba. Na webɛlɛ ndala keolo m'ebalɔ yɔsɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Baɔlɔ batangi 17.1-7</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ata biya, Abɛcha kushihililɛ Ɛliya owasha m'achana m'bulwa kɛkɛsɛ hawǐngi habɔ. Ela, kwem'hililɛ ka wa m'achana m'bulwa komwɛchi kwa mboka kya Salɛpati m'ebalɔ ya Shilɔni.<verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />«Eyǎka, m'ebalɔ ya Ishilaɛli mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Ɛlisha kwebɛlɛ n'languchi, webɛlɛ bashɔndɔ mitala. Ela kushibɛlɛ kɛkɛsɛ kwehɔnyinywɛ, ela Namani, kwa ebalɔ ya Suliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Baɔlɔ ba bobele 5.1-14</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ n'shinagɔgi* habeholechɛ biya binywa, bechikelelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bekimanɛ, na om'hunya Yɛsɔ hamboka ha mboka kyǎbɔ. Bem'bolilɛ mpaka o sɔngɔ lya hiya hiaɔnɔ wɛnɛ keya mboka kyebɛlɛ kekubahwɛ hakolo hahyɔ. Bebɛlɛ na langa lya on'tɛla oehɔnga. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ela Yɛso kwebasɔtɔɛ na olekela.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwa benga m'ha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwěsalelɛ mpaka mboka kya Apɛlɛnaumu m'ebalɔ ya Galilaya. Lusuku lwa Sabatɔ* halwehǐlɛ kwesɔminyɛ bato. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bato, bekakelwɛ omɔna byakebɛlɛ osɔmya, yolo binywa byakɛ byebɛlɛ na boɔmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />N'ta Shinagɔgi mwebɛlɛ komwɛ n'to minɛ kwebɛlɛ na m'ha. Koya n'to kwetolilɛ okololoa m'okana binɔ: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Hɛ! Yɛso kwa mboka kya Nazalɛti, twaoeta ě? Wachwa otochimya? Nem'omanɛ bisɔka. Kɔkwɛ nǎ M'haha minɛ Abɛcha kwehililɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yɛso kweambelɛ koya m'ha wɛ̌nɛ kɛte: «Chamaka pi! Humaka n'ta mwa koko n'to!» Koya m'ha, kwen'kushishɛ koya n'to hase, hambɛlɛ ha bato, na kwem'huminɛ bila om'eta bibé.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bato bɔsɛ bekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ, betolilɛ osambelana bɔkawabɔka kɛte: «Ee i ekɔkɔ ya okakecha! Yolo kohobenga miha wa oɔma wakɛ kyehumɛ o n'to, na hɔka haya kyǎm'huma.» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Na mwanɔ kwa Yɛso kwewelelɛ ɔsɛ m'eya ebalɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya basomwa bɛ̌ngi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwehuminɛ n'leya shinagɔgi*, kwekělɛ wa Shimɔni. Hakehîlɛ oya kwebangilɛ n'nakɛ boɔ kwa Shimɔni kwebɛlɛ osomwa wɛ̌nɛ na lɔnda. Nǎ ben'tɛndɛlɛlɛ Yɛso kom'hɔnyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Nǎ Yɛso kwechǔlɛ na okimana hɔka nǎkɛ, na kweambelɛ leya lɔnda. Hɔka haya leya lɔnda lyem'huminɛ. Hɔka haya koya m'ma kwekinuɛ na otola obaɛbɛla elewa. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Hayehǐlɛ ekɔlɔ, bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ na basǒmwa, bechǔlɛ nabɔ we Yɛso, na kɛ kwebîlɛ mabɔ̂ makɛ hakolo ha kila komwɛ kwabɔ na kwebahɔnyinyɛ bɔsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Miha kyehuminɛ basomwa bɛ̌ngi. Hakyebɛlɛ ohuma, kyebɛlɛ okya nakololoa kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha!» Ela Yɛso kwekeambelɛ, na okehanya kishitɔkɔmɛ eyaka, yolo kyemaninɛ okana kɛnyikɛ nǎ Kilishito*.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohosɔmya Mwanɔ Kosɔka m'ebalɔ ya Yolɛa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />M'mɛshi mwǎkɛ ham'mɛshi kɔsɛ, Yɛso kwechuilɛ m'mboka na okya ushi bato. Na eoto ya bato yetolilɛ om'ɛba. Habem'mɔninɛ betɔndilɛ on'chibila yolo kushihumɛ eyǎka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ela, Yɛso kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «I bisɔka nasɔmyɛ Mwanɔ Kosɔka kwa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* m'mangɛ maboka, yolo Abɛcha kwepililɛ yolo ya biya.»<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yɛso kwekelelelɛ osɔmya Mwanɔ Kosɔka m'mashinagɔgi mɔsɛ ma ebalɔ ya Yolɛa.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwasɔbɔla bakikiwa bakɛ ba batangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ n'kimanɛ habamba ha echiba ya Gɛnɛsalɛti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Echiba ya Gɛnɛsalɛti: Eya echiba yebabochiwa eyǎka echiba ya Galilaya.</char></note>. Hâya, bato bɛ̌ngi bebɛlɛ ban'chongolowɛ m'olongana yolo bebɛlɛ bɛnja baholechɛ binywa bya Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yɛso Kwemɔninɛ mǎtɔ mabele m'ebamba ya echiba. Basɛngi bebɛlɛ basalɛ n'ta mwa bwǎtɔ m'okɔka maila mabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yɛso kwechininɛ m'bomwɛ bwǎtɔ bwebɛlɛ haya. Boya bwǎtɔ bwebɛlɛ bwa komwɛ n'to kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Shimɔni. Koko Shimɔni, Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte kolongɛ boya bwǎtɔ m'echiba, bashikanɛ hanɛ na ebɛka. Kweshaminɛ m'boya bwǎtɔ, na kwetolilɛ osɔmya bato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Yɛso hakehulɛ osɔmya, kwen'kaninɛ Shimɔni kɛte: «Oshilɛ bwǎtɔ mpaka m'bɛnga, m'bɛtɛla maila mɛnyu m'mǎte yolo mowatɛ swé.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Shimɔni kwen'kailɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, twasɛnga lênɔ busuku bɔsɛ, tushibawatɛ ata emwɛ. Ela, omɔna kɔkwɛ nawǎkana, nehotɛla eyǎka maila m'mǎte.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ohwa otɛla maila m'mǎte, bewatilɛ swe chǐngi, mpaka maila mabɔ metolilɛ ǒtoa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Obibyɔ, bebuchichɛ bangɛ nabɔ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ n'ta mwa bongɛ bwǎtɔ bachwɛ obawasha. Baya bangɛ nabɔ bechǔle obawasha, bɔsɛ bewatilɛ swɛ na okilocha mǎtɔ mɔsɛ mabele. Na mǎtɔ mɔsɛ mabele mebɛlɛ hɔka na ochinda. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Shimɔni Pɛtɛlɔ hakemɔninɛ bîya, kwebungilɛ machu hase hambɛlɛ ha Yɛso na on'sambela kɛte: «Ɔla! Ɔlɔ wenahuminɛ hambɛlɛ hanyi, yolo nɛnɛ nee n'to kwa bobé.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Shimɔni kwenaninɛ bîya, yolo kɛ na bangɛ nakɛ bekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ omɔna ubula wa swé chabewatilɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Byɔka bîya, Yakɔbɔ na Yɔana bǎna ba Sɛbɛlayɔ, bebɛlɛ osɛnga hamwɛ̂chi na Shimɔni, bɔ lwabɔ bekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Ela Yɛso kwen'sambelɛ Shimɔni: «Ushibɛ na bɔ̌ba, otola lenɔ wêbá n'sɛngi kwa bato.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Obibyɔ, ohwa osuecha maya mǎtɔ o yabo, beshikilɛ byɔsɛ na on'lama Yɛso.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya n'to kwa boshɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ n'kemwɛ mboka. Komwɛ n'to kwa n'kilolɛ boshɔndɔ m'bele kɔsɛ kwechǔlɛ. Hakemɔninɛ Yɛso kwekǔlɛ machu hase hambɛlɛ hakɛ, pala na hasé. Kwen'tɛndɛlɛlɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, byahoobɛnja wenapɔ̂nya bonɔ boshɔndɔ bwanyi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Obibyɔ, Yɛso kwen'kɔlɔlɛ obɔ̂ na om'oma na okana kɛte: «Nabɛnja, hɔnaka!» hɔka haya, koya n'to kwehahalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Ohwa Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ koya n'to kɛte: «Ushisambelɛ n'to kɛkɛsɛ konɔ mwanɔ. Ela ketaka otangɛ́ olemɔnya wa ebole*, uhunyɛ lotange*, olamana na byekɔlilɛ Musa, waomɔnya kɛte wahóhɔna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nǎmbɔ n'to kwahɔnyiwa boshɔndɔ, koya n'to kwebɛlɛ okya olemɔnya o bibolé kɛte kwahohɔna. Kwebɛlɛ oeta bîya, yolo bawashɛ kosoelɛ eyaka oshama na bato. Sɔmakwɛ Balawi 13.45-46, 14.1-32</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ela ata biya, mwanɔ kwa Yɛso kwebɛlɛ olomba ngobe chɔsɛ. Yolo ya bîya, bioto bya bato byebɛlɛ osambana yolo ya om'holecha na ohɔnyiwa bisumi byabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ela Yɛso kwebɛlɛ okya ushi bato, wa osaba Abɛcha ôya.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya n'to kwa elɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmya bato. Bamwɛ Bafalisayɔ na chimwɛ nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* ohuma m'maboka mɔsɛ ma ebalɔ ya Galilaya, na ya Yolɛa, na ba mboka kya Yɛlusalɛmu, nabɔ bebɛlɛ haya. Yɛso kwebɛlɛ ohɔnya basǒmwa wa boɔmɛ bwa Ɔlɔ Abɛcha.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Haya, hechǔlɛ bato bebɛlɛ batɛtɛ n'to komwɛ̂chi o etaleɔ, kwebɛlɛ na elɛbɛ. Baya bato betɔndilɛ on'kingecha n'ta mwa sɛsɛ, yolo bam'beɛ hambɛlɛ ha Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ela, yolo ya ubula wa bato, bashiɔshishɛ okingela n'ta. Obibyɔ, behɛlilɛ nakɛ hakolo ha kea sɛsɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamwɛ Bayola haokubaa masɛsɛ mabɔ, bebɛlɛ okanda mité hakolo, ohwa bɔ na okanda ɔ manjanja ma bitɛtɛ (mapaa).</char></note>, besulilɛ eba ya pawa na, ben'sachichɛ n'sɛsɛ hawǐngi ha bato, hambɛlɛ ha Yɛso kwemɔka m'etanda yakɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="Watu wanashusha mugonjwa kupitiya paa ya nyumba" file="WA03824b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="5.19">Bato baheshesha n'sǒmwa hakolo ha sɛsɛ</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yɛso hakemɔninɛ washa lya baya bato lyebɛlɛ leolo, kwesambelɛ koya n'to kɛte: «Kɛnda lyanyi, bobé bɔbɛ bwalɛɛlɛlwa!» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Chiya nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* na baya Bafalisayɔ* betolilɛ olebocha kɛte: «I nanyi kôko kwehotoa Abɛcha? Ushi n'to kwenaɔsha olɛ̌lɛla bobé, ela i Abɛcha kɛ buchima.»<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yɛso kwemaninɛ malanga mabɔ, Kwebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Yolo yaé Mweholanga bibi n'ta mitema kyɛ̌nyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nganinakwɛ! I ě ye ehuhu, m'otɔkɔma ‹Bobé bɔbɛ bwalɛɛlɛlwa›, aɔ ‹kimanaka okyatɛ?› <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Binɔ, nehobɛnja momanɛ okana nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nee na boɔmɛ́ bwa olɛ̌lɛla bobé n'ta ebalɔ.» Ohwa, Yɛso kwen'sambelɛ koya n'to kwa elɛbɛ okana: «Kimanaka, tɛtaka etaleɔ yɔbɛ, na osuelɛ o sɛsɛ kyɔ̌bɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Hɔka haya, koya n'to kwekimanɛ hambɛlɛ ha bato bɔsɛ, kwekuhilɛ etaleɔ yakɛ yakebɛlɛ obetela, na osuela wakɛ m'okya natɔna Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Baya bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ haya, bekakelwɛ na bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba. Bebɛlɛ otɔna Abɛcha okana: «Lenɔ chǒba twamɔ̂na bito bya okakecha!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwan'kanina Lawi kon'lǎmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ohwa biya, Yɛso kwetɔbɔɛ hamboka, kwemɔninɛ komwɛ n'to m'wa n'lambo kwebɛlɛ obuchiwa Lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lawi kwebabuchiwa eyaka Matayɔ. Sɔmakwɛ Matayɔ 9.9</char></note>, koya Lawi kwebɛlɛ n'chamɛ ha ibu yakɛ ya n'kelɔ. Yɛso kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «Ndamakɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Kɛ naokimana, naoshika byɔsɛ, na on'lama Yɛso.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ohwa, Lawi kwem'etelɛ Yɛso m'onda kǒlo wakɛ o sɛsɛ. N'keya sɛsɛ mwebɛlɛ bawa n'lambo bɛ̌ngi na bangɛ bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ oya hamwɛ̂chi nǎbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Bafalisayɔ,* na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* bemɔninɛ bǐya, betolilɛ oletɔkɔmɛna na okanina balɔmbwɛ ba Yɛso kɛte: «Yolo ya ě mwehoya na onywa hamwɛ̂chi na bawa n'lambo na bawa bobe?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Bɛnɛ benan'kɔma kobɛnju bashibaɛba n'kilahi, ela bebaɛba n'kilahi, i baya bɛnɛ beosomwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nɛnɛ nesǎchwa obocha bato basɔka, ela baya bɛnɛ bena bobe, yolo bahiyɛ olebɛcha.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Losabɔ lwa ohamba elewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />M'maya mɛngɔ, baya Bafalisayɔ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ haya ben'sambelɛ Yɛso okana: «Balɔmbwɛ* ba Yɔana N'chunji ná bɛto, bebaeta losabɔ lwa ohamba elewa eyaka bebasabá wɛ̌nɛ. Ela balɔmbwɛ bɔbɛ bashibaeta biya, bebâya ná onywa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Baya babuchiwa o lohangwɛ benakaninwa bahambɛ elewa na n'lomɛ kwa lohangwɛ kwe hamwɛ̂chi nǎbɔ? Nǎngo!  <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ela, mɛngɔ mehiya mɛnɛ koya n'lomɛ kwa lohangwɛ kwehuma hawingi habɔ. M'maya mɛngɔ na habeba ohamba elewa.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yɛso kwebaetelɛ eyaka engɛ eta kɛte: «Ushi n'to kwenaala eba ya ngobɔ kya kehya na oetata oesanjwa. Kwahoeta bǐya kwebá kwahotɔkya ngobɔ kya kehya eyaka eya eba ya ngobɔ ehya yɛnɛ ya kaala ishihutana na esanjwa.  <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Eyaka, ushi n'to kwenabeya lifai m'hya m'bibela bya bibambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Twebɛlɛ tohwaba twɛnɛ twelɔngiwɛ na bibambe bya mabuchi. Bayola bebɛlɛ oteba livai n'tohwaba tohya twa bibambe, yolo byɔ bishibɛlɛ obɛlɛa mɛngɔ mɛnɛ livai lyesele obela. Bebɛlɛ oeta biya, yolo tohwaba twa bibambe bya ala, byebɛlɛ bilɛbɛlɛ eyaka bya obɛlɛa abelɔ. Hanɔ i okana kɛte, binywa byɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmywa bibɛlɛ bihwa byɛnɛ bishinahutanɛ na kɔlɔbɛchi cha binywa bya ala. </char></note> bya ala. Minɛ kwahoeta biya, kwenahila koya lifai kwa m'hya kobɛlɛ biya bibela. Koya lifai m'hya na biya bibela, byɔsɛ byatɔka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ela, lifai kwa m'hya kwebabîwa ka m'ahwaba a ebambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayola bebɛlɛ olɔngya ndaa. N'keya ndaa bebɛlɛ obeya mǎte na mabɛlɛ na mauta. Keya ndaa hakyebɛlɛ kyěle kehya kyebɛlɛ otanuwa. Ela nǎmbɔ byahotola oɔta, byese byɔ̌mu, yolo ya biya bishibɛlɛ eyǎka otanuwa.</char></note> ehya! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ushi n'to kwenawâsha onywa lifai m'hya nǎmbɔ kwahoonywa lifai lya ala, yolo kwebatɔkɔma kɛte: ‹Lea lifai lya ala i lebɛnju.› »<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso nǎ ɔlɔ lya Sabatɔ*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lomwɛ lusuku lwa Sabatɔ, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ oheta m'mabala ma nganɔ. Balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ betolilɛ oala masoke ma nganɔ, betolilɛ oteya bikuma wa mabɔ̂ mabɔ, na obiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N'to kwahoeta n'lobala kwe na ndala kwe na ndo* kya oala aɔ oya on'kembo. oeta bîya ushiwêba. Sɔmakwɛ Ɛngɛlɛchɔ 23.26</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bamwɛ Bafalisayɔ bebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Yolo ya ě mwaeta byɛnɛ m'benda* kwɛto kwekohanyɛ oeta lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «We, mushinasɔma byɛnɛ Laole kweitilɛ hamwɛchi na bangɛnakɛ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mabeholechɛ ndala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Kwekingelɛ n'lobonga*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'masuku ma ɔlɔ Laole, Lobonga lǒlo lushibɛlɛ na kubahwa.</char></note>, kwekuhilɛ mikatɛ kyɛnɛ bato bebɛlɛ batangelɛ Abɛcha. Kwekelelɛ na obaha bangɛ nakɛ bakebɛlɛ nakɛ. Na i bibole ka byewashiwɛ oya mikatɛ kya bîya.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Samwɛli kwa bobele 21.1-5</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Obiya, kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «I nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nǎ ɔlɔ lya Sabatɔ*.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya n'to lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Longɛ lusuku lwa Sabatɔ, Yɛso kwekingelɛ n'ta Shinagɔgi*, na kwetolilɛ osɔmya bato. N'lea Shinagɔgi* mwebɛlɛ komwɛ n'to n'elɛbɛchu sanda lyakɛ lya obɔ̂ olomɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* na Bafalisayɔ* belɔlilɛ Yɛso wɛ̌nɛ, yolo bamɔnɛ nâmbɔ kwehɔnya koya n'to lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*. Beitilɛ bǐya, yolo bamɔnɛ enywa ya on'shitaki. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ela Yɛso kwebɛlɛ kwahǒhomana malangá mabɔ. Nǎ kwen'kaninɛ koya n'to kwa sanda lya elɛbɛ kɛte: «Kinuaka, na ochwɛ ombɛlɛ wa bato.» Koya n'to kwekimana na okya hawǐngi habɔ bɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ohwa Yɛso kwebakaninɛ baya Bafalisayɔ na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ kɛte: «Nehom'bocha: wé, iě yɛnɛ m'benda*kwɛto kwebabɛnja tobeoeta lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*? Oeta bibɛnju aɔ bibé? Ohɔnya n'to aɔ om'haka?»<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yɛso, kwebalɔlilɛ bɔsɛ, nǎ kwekaninɛ koya n'to kɛte: «Kɔlɔlaka sanda lyɔbɛ.» Kwelekɔlɔlɛ na hɔka haya lyehɔninɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ela chiya nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* na Bafalisayɔ* bechikelelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Betolilɛ obochana kɛte bam'etɛ Yɛso ě.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwǎsɔbɔla bakikiwa* umi na babele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwehɛlilɛ o aɔnɔ yolo kosabɛ Abɛcha. Kweyɛshishɛ busuku bɔsɛ m'osaba. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />M'mɛshi mwǎkɛ ha m'ɛshi, kwebuchichɛ balɔmbwe* bakɛ, kwesɔbɔlɛ umi na babele hawǐngi habɔ, na kwebakinyiɛ chǐna lya «bakikiwa*» <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Nǎ bâba: Shimɔni, (minɛ kwen'kinyiɛ chǐna lya Pɛtɛlɔ) na n'shiwabɔ kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Andɛlɛ, na Yakɔbɔ, na Yɔana na Filipɔ, na Balɔtɔmayɔ, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />na Matayɔ, na Tɔma, na Yakɔbɔ mwǎna kwa Alufayɔ, na Shimɔni ( kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Sɛlɔti) <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yola mwǎna kwa Yakɔbɔ, na Yola Ishikaliɔti (koya minɛ kwetambolɛ Yɛso).<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohosɔmya bato na ohɔnya basǒmwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yɛso kwesalilɛ ohuma o aɔnɔ, kwe na bakikiwa* bakɛ. Hakehǐlɛ ha ibu yɛnɛ ye bolole, kwekimanɛ. Kwebangilɛ eoto ya balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ na bângɛ bato bɛ̌ngi ohumina ebalɔ yɔsɛ ya Yolɛya, na mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma, na lǒbe lwa mboka kya Tilɔ na Shilɔni kyɛnɛ kyebɛlɛ habamba ha echiba. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Baya bato bechǔlɛ yolo bam'holechɛ Yɛso, na kobahɔnyɛ bisumi byabɔ. Na bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ otɛnjiwa na miha bɔ lwabɔ kwebahɔnyinyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Batɔ bɔsɛ bebɛnjichɛ om'oma, yolo ya boɔmɛ́ bwebɛlɛ ohuma n'ta mwǎkɛ na obahɔnya bɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miha na Kɔnami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwelɔlilɛ balɔmbwɛ bakɛ, na obakanina kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Komba bɛnywɛ bambuchu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">yolo Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* i bwɛnyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Komba bɛnywɛ môholecha ndala manɔ mɛngɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">yolo mwekyota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Komba bɛnywɛ moholela manɔ mɛngɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">yolo mwesɛa wa sasɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />«Komba bɛnywɛ nǎmbɔ bato bem'mɔnywa na om'bakola na on'toa na otɔkya ma chǐna mɛnyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">yolo yanyi nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ biya bikɔkɔ byeba om'hîla, mobɛ ashama na sasɔ m'oina, yolo ibam'beelɛ matabishi maolo hakolo. Ebalɔ basabɔ olo bêtelɛ ŋanguchi byɔka biya.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ela bɛnywɛ bambɔna mwebakɔnamiwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">yolo mwahohɛwa mwɛkɔ kwa lɛma lyɛnyu<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Kɔnami bɛnywɛ mwebakyotɛ manɔ mɛngɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">yolo mangɛ mɛngɔ mweholecha ndala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Kɔnami wɛnyu bɛnywɛ mohosɛa wa sasɔ manɔ mɛngɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">yolo mwelela na mwêban'lelɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Kɔnami wɛnyu bɛnywɛ nǎmbɔ bato bɔsɛ beon'tɔna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">yolo nǎ byɔka biya byɛnɛ basabɔ olo bebɛlɛ tɔná ŋanguchi cha lulimi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ǒnda tomango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Yɛso kwekelelɛ otɔkɛma eyaka. Ela bɛnywɛ bɛnɛ mohopolecha nehobɛnja on'kanina bînɔ: «Tomango twɛnyu mobɛ otoonda, na baya bɛnɛ bebam'mɔnywa, mɔbɛ́ obaetela bisɔka. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Baya bɛnɛ beban'kɔnamina mobɛ obasabela Abɛcha yolo kobahalelɛ. Na baya bɛnɛ bebán'sobya mobɛ obasabela wa Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Nǎmbɔ n'to kwaohola o lemwɛ tama, on'kalochechɛ lêngɛ. Nǎmbɔ n'to kwahosapa echibabɔ yɔbɛ, on'shikilɛ na shimishi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />N'to kwahosaba eto yɔyɔsɛ ushin'kimɛ, aɔ kwahosapa eto yɔbɛ, ushibɛnjɛ kôsuechechɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Biya byamwebabɛnja bato bam'etelɛ, moetelɛ bǎngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />«Nâmbɔ mwebahobɛnja ka baya behom'bɛnja, wé, moholanga mwehɛwa ě? Ebalɔ bawa bobé lwabɔ bebabɛnja baya bɛnɛ bebababɛnja! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Eyǎka, nâmbɔ mwebaetela ka bisɔka baya bɛnɛ bebam'etela bisɔka, malepɔ naké yamwehɛwa? Ata bawa bobe lwabɔ bebaeta byɔka biya. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nambɔ mwenasɔmbɔlɔcha ka baya bamweomana kɛte ben'lěpa, wé, mwepata akɔɛlɔ naké? Ata bawa bobé bebasɔmbɔlɔcha lwabɔ baya bɛnɛ benabalepa.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />«Ela bɛnywɛ, mobɛ ǒnda tomango twɛnyu. Na mobɛ otoetela bisɔka. Eyǎka mobɛ osɔmbɔlɔcha, mushilǎngɛ osuechechiwa. Mwahoeta bîya, mwehɛwa matabishi maolo, eyǎka mwêba chikelwɛ bǎna ba Abɛcha kwe hakolo ha byɔsɛ, yolo kɛnyikɛ kwebaeta bisɔka o baya bashi na boswachi na o bawa bobé. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mobɛ omɔnɛnana kɛnɛ nɛhɛ Sɛnyu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushimɔnɛ bibé bya bǎngɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Yɛso kwetokɔmɛ́ eyaka kɛte: «Mushibɛ́ omɔna ka bibé bya bângɛ, yolo Abɛcha kushimɔnɛ byɛnyu. Mushibɛ okɔnamina bângɛ, yolo Abɛcha kushin'kɔnaminɛ lwɛnyu. Ela bɛnywɛ mobɛ olɛ̌lɛla bângɛ, yolo Abɛcha kon'lɛ̌lɛlɛ lwɛnyu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mobɛ oha bângɛ, yolo bɛnywɛ lwɛnyu Abɛcha kom'hɛ. Na biya byamwehɛwa byeba byelɔngiwɛ bisɔka, byabihielelwɛ, byekilola bɛ́ na otola omwakea. Byamwebabɛnja oha bângɛ, Abɛcha lwakɛ kwem'ha byɔka bîya.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Eyǎka Yɛso kwebahɛlɛ engɛ eta kɛte: «Ehɔbu yelengyɛ olɔmbɔla ehɔbu nakɛ́? Nǎngo! Kwahon'lɔmbɔla chikelwɛ, byɔsɛ bibele byekwa m'ena. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />N'lɔmbwɛ* kushinaheta n'lɔmbɔchi kwǎkɛ. Ela n'lɔmbwɛ kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwahwa osɔma bisɔka, kwênabá nɛhɛ n'lɔmbɔchi kwǎkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />«Yolo yaě wenamɔ̂na hiyǎnyi hyɛnɛ hyee n'lisɔ lya minɔ̌bɛ, ushihomɔná ehende ya n'te yɛnɛ ye n'lǐsɔ lyɔbɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Yolo yaě wenakanina minɔ̌bɛ: ‹Lɛyaka naohunyɛ hiyǎnyi hyɛnɛ hye n'lǐsɔ lyɔbɛ.› Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ n'lǐsɔ lyɔbɛ́, mwěle ehende ya n'te? M'bona kɔkwɛ! Tangaka ohunya ehende ya n'te yɛnɛ yee n'lǐsɔ lyɔbɛ, na hawemɔna hololo wa om'hunya hiyanyi hyɛnɛ hyee n'lǐsɔ lya minɔ̌bɛ́!»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omana n'te o bikuma byakɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «N'te kobɛnju kushibaha bikuma bibe, na n'te kobe kushibaha bikuma bibɛnju. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bato bebamana n'te ohetela bikuma byakɛ. Bato bashibahɔmba bǔngɔ o n'te kwa asɛmɛkɛ, na bashibahɔmba bumú o n'te kwa esongwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Nǎ biya, n'to m'bɛnju kwebatɔkɔma binywa bibɛnju bye ohuma o n'tema kwakɛ. Ela n'to m'be, bibé byekebatɔkɔma byebahuma m'bibé byɛnɛ byebikilolɛ n'ta n'tema kwakɛ. Yolo anywa a n'to ebatɔkɔma ka binywa byɛnɛ byebikilolɛ n'ta n'tema kwakɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya bakubai babele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Yɛso kwekelelelɛ okana kɛte: «Yolo ya ě mwehombocha: ‹Ɔlɔ, Ɔlɔ› na mushioeta byɛnɛ byandehon'sambela?  <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nehobɛnja om'mɔnya byɛnɛ n'to minɛ kohondama na oholecha binywa byanyi na obieta byɛnɛ byandeokana, kwem'hutanɛ: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />kwem'hutanɛ na minɛ kwekubaɛ sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ. Kwetangilɛ otaba wɛ̌nɛ ohiya o ndanda. O leya ndanda, kwebiilɛ ɔ n'shingi kwa sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ. Hehǐlɛ hohé, lǒte lwekilolɛ, keya pela ketolilɛ ohola o keya sɛsɛ, keya sɛsɛ kishitekelɛ, yolo kyebɛlɛ ndi. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ela n'to minɛ kohoeta nɛhɛ kohondama wa oholecha mwanɔ kwanyi na kushioeta byandeokana, kwem'hutanɛ na koya minɛ kwekubaɛ sɛsɛ kyakɛ o etɛtɛ bila otaba n'shingi. Mɛngɔ mehǐlɛ keya pela o keya sɛsɛ, hɔka haya keya sɛsɛ kyeondoɛ na otɔka wɛ̌nɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya komwɛ n'kichi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yɛso hakehulɛ okana biya byɔsɛ hambɛlɛ ha bato bebɛlɛ om'holecha, kwekělɛ Apɛlɛnaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />N'keya mboka, mwebɛlɛ komwɛ m'hɛla kwa bilusha minɛ kwebɛlɛ na n'kichi kwǎkɛ kwakebɛlɛ bɛnja wɛ̌nɛ. Koya n'kichi kwebɛlɛ n'sǒmwa minɛ kwesebɛlɛ ohukumba. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Koya m'hɛla kwa bilusha hakeholechɛ mwanɔ kwa Yɛso, kwem'hililɛ bamwɛ baongo ba Bayola bakyɛ on'saba Yɛso kochwɛ ohɔnya n'kichi kwǎkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Baya baongo habehǐlɛ we Yɛso, belenyɛmbɛtɛlɛ na okana: «Koko m'hɛla kwa bilusha kwelěngyɛ owashiwa, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />yolo kɛ kwebabɛnja elɔngɔ yɛto, nǎ kɛnyikɛ kwetokubailɛ lele shinagɔgi* lyɛto.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Obibyɔ, Yɛso kwekělɛ hamwɛchi nǎbɔ. Habebɛlɛ hɔka na ohiya o sɛsɛ kya koya m'hɛla kwa bilusha, koya m'hɛla kwa bilusha kwehililɛ makɛnda makɛ makyɛ on'sambela Yɛso kɛte: «N'kaninakɛ kushiletɛnjɛ ochwa, yolo nɛnɛ nishilěngyɛ kɛ okingela n'sɛsɛ kyǎnyi.  <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Nǎ yolo ya biya, nalemɔna nɛnɛ mǐnɛ nishilěngyɛ ochwa wa kele. Ela kotɔmɛ enywa emwɛ̂chi ka na n'kichi kwanyi kwehɔna. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ebalɔ nɛnɛ lwanyi nebábá hamanda ha bahɛla banyi, na nɛnɛ nebábá na bilusha hamanda hanyi; nahosambela komwɛ kɛte: ‹ketaka!› kwebakya. Na nahosambela kongɛ: ‹chutaka!› kwebachwa. Na nahosambela n'kichi kwanyi kɛte: ‹etaka ee!› kwebaeta.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yɛso hakeholechɛ bîya, kwekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ koya m'hɛla kwa bilusha obibyɔ kwekaloɛ o eya eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ on'lama na obakanina kɛte: «Nehon'kanina kɛte n'ta ebalɔ yɔsɛ ya Ishilaɛlɛ nishinamɔna n'to kwa washa leolo nɛhɛ lenɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Baya bato behililwɛ na koya m'hɛla kwa bilusha habesuelɛ o sɛsɛ, bebangilɛ koya n'kichi kwahohɔna.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwakukya mwǎna kwa m'achana m'bulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekělɛ o kemwɛ mboka kyebɛlɛ buchiwa Naini, bakikiwa* bakɛ na bangɛ bato bɛ̌ngi bekelɛ nakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Hakebɛlɛ hɔka na n'changɔ kwa loba lwa keya mboka, kwesambanɛ na eoto ya bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ okya ochia m'mu kwa mwǎna kwa n'lomyana, koya mwana kwebɛlɛ ehɛnɛ na n'nakɛ kwebɛlɛ m'achana m'bulwa. Bato babǔlɛ ba n'keya mboka bebɛlɛ on'shindiicha koya m'achana m'bulwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ɔlɔ Yɛso hakem'mɔninɛ kwem'mɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «M'ma nǎngo olela.» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yɛso kwesɛninɛ hɔka na sanduku lya m'mu na ǒma. Bato bebɛlɛ batɛtɛ leya sanduku bekimanɛ. Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: «m'walobaka, nǎkana: byoaka!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Koya m'walobaka minɛ kwebulɛ, hɔka hǎya kwebyoilɛ na kweshaminɛ hase na otola okɔmbɔla. Yɛso kwen'suechɛ we n'nakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bato bɔsɛ bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba, betolilɛ otɔna Abɛcha m'okana kɛte: «N'languchi m'olo nǎ kwǎhiya hawǐngi hɛto!» Eyǎka bekaninɛ kɛte: «Abɛcha kwǎchwa ohɔnya bato bakɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Mwanɔ kwa eya ekɔkɔ yeitilɛ Yɛso kwehǐlɛ ngobɛ chɔsɛ n'ta ebalɔ ya Yolɛa na m'bibalɔ byɔsɛ bya ŋumba.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɔana n'chunji kwahila balɔmbwɛ bakɛ wa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Biya binywa byɔsɛ byeitilɛ Yɛso, balɔmbwɛ ba Yɔana ben'kaninɛ. Yolo ya bǐya, Yɔana kwebuchichɛ babele hawǐngi habɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Kwebahililɛ wa Ɔlɔ Yɛso bam'bochɛ kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ koya Mashiya minɛ kwěchwa? aɔ toɛmbɛ kongɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Baya balɔmbwɛ habehǐlɛ we Yɛso ben'sambelɛ kɛte: «Yɔana N'chunji nǎ kwatohila wa wele tôbochɛ nǎmbɔ kɔkwɛ nǎ Mashia minɛ kwěchwa, aɔ tohɛmbɛ kongɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />M'maya mɛngɔ, Yɛso kwehɔnyinyɛ bato bɛ̌ngi bebɛlɛ ososoa na bisumi, na bitɛndɛ, na bebɛlɛ na miha, na bihɔbu bǐngi byemɔninɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Oisula, Yɛso kwebakailɛ baya balɔmbwɛ ba Yɔana kɛte: «Mokyɛ on'sambela Yɔana biya byɔsɛ byamwamɔ̂na na oholecha. Bihɔbu byatola omɔ̂na, na bitɛndɛ byatola okyata, na baboshɔndɔ bahahachwa, na bihole byatola oholecha na babu bakuka, na ba mbuchu beosɔmiwa Mwanɔ Kosɔka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Isaya 35.5-6, 61.1</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Komba koya minɛ kushichiminya washa lyakɛ wandele!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Baya balɔmbwɛ ba Yɔana besuelɛ. Yɛso kwetolilɛ osambela bioto bya bato yolo ya Yɔana kɛte: «Mwekělɛ n'ta longo* olɔla ě? Wé Mwekělɛ omɔna losɔ lwe otekechwa na n'naka? Nǎngo! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Nǎmbɔ bishi biya, mwekělɛ olɔla ě? Mwekělɛ olɔla n'to kwe n'chwalɛ ngobɔ chibɛnju? Nǎngo. Baya beochwala ngobɔ chibɛnju na be na maisha masɔka, i n'sɛsɛ kya boɔlɔ mwabebashama! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Obibyɔ, mwekělɛ olɔla ě? Ɔmɔna n'languchi? Nǎ bibyɔ! nee hon'sambela kɛte kwebɛlɛ n'languchi*, Eyaka kwebɛlɛ m'etɛ n'languchi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Koya Yɔana nǎ minɛ Lokɔlɔ Lohaha lwehotɔkɔma yolo yakɛ kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‹Holechiwɛ! Nahila n'kichi kwanyi kôbangelwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">yolo kwôlɔngɛchɛ ndela.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malaki 3.1</char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Nehon'kanina kɛte, hawǐngi ha bato bɔsɛ ba m'ɛnɔ ebalɔ ushi n'to kwe m'hɛla oheta Yɔana. Ela ata biya, koya minɛ kwe mwǎnyuɛ m'boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*, nǎ m'hɛla oheta Yɔana.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bato bɔsɛ na bawa n'lambo bɛnɛ beholechɛ mwanɔ kwa Yɔana bemaninɛ kɛte Abɛcha kwebábá n'sɔka. Na byebewashishɛ ochundiwa na Yɔana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ela Bafalisayɔ na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* bɔ behanyinyɛ biya byɛnɛ byebɛlɛ bɛnja Abɛcha wa bele. Obibyɔ, behanyinyɛ otabewa na Yɔana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yɛso kwe kaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «Nenahutanya bato ba lonɔ lobotɔ lwa lenɔ na bato ba bihé? I bahutanɛ na nanyi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ibahutanɛ nɛhɛ bǎna bebashamɛ n'lakala m'oeta yɔka bamwɛ o bangɛ nabɔ kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‹Twan'kɔmbɛla ŋɔma, ela musaîna!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Twakemba ngembɔ cha elelɔ, ela musǎlela!›<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />«Yolo hehǐlɛ Yɔana n'chunji, kushibɛlɛ oya mikatɛ na kushibɛlɛ onywa livai na bɛnywɛ mwebɛlɛ okana kɛte: ‹Kwee na m'ha!› <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mɛngɔ nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nǎchwa nee hoya na onywa, bɛnywɛ mweokaná: ‹Lɔlakwɛ! koko n'to i n'lafi na m'ɔlwa, Kenda lya bawa n'lambo na bawa bobé!› <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ela lwɛ̌nyi lwa Abɛcha lwe lomanyiwɛ oba lwa chikelwɛ o baya bɛnɛ behomwasha.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwa lɛɛlɛla bobé bwa komwɛ m'achana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Komwɛ M'falisayɔ* kwem'buchichɛ yɛso o sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ oya elewa. Yɛso kwekingelɛ n'sɛsɛ kya koya M'falisayo kweshaminɛ oya elewa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />N'keya mboka mwebɛlɛ komwɛ m'achana kwa bobé. Koya m'achana hakeholechɛ mwanɔ kɛte Yɛso kwe n'sɛsɛ kya koya M'falisayɔ, kwekingelɛmɔ kwen'kohɛ ekaya yɛnɛ ye ekilolɛ mwambɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Kwekimanɛ onyuma wa makolo ma Yɛso m'olela. Ohwa, kwetolilɛ ohosa makolo ma Yɛso na njuli chakɛ. Kwebɛlɛ omaumbatela maya makolo na omashinya mwambɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">O Bayola nǎmbɔ nꞌto kwahobɛnja omɔnya wa kongɛ́ kɛte kwehon'nyɛmya kwebɛle om'ombatela makolo.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="La femme prostituée essuie les pieds de Jésus avec ses larmes" file="WA03839b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="7.38">M'achana kwa masɛi kwahosa makolo ma Yɛso wa lohanga lwakɛ</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ koya M'falisayɔ minɛ kwebuchichɛ Yɛso kwemɔninɛ bîya, kwetolile otɔkɔmá n'ta n'tema kwakɛ kɛte: «Koko n'to kwenabɛlɛ kěnɛ n'languchi, kwenamaninɛ koko m'achana kwa m'oma i n'to kwa bihé. kwenamaninɛ okana kěnɛ i m'wa bobé.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Obiya,Yɛso kwekaninɛ koya M'falisayɔ kɛte: «Shimɔni, nee na eto ya oosambela.» Shimɔni kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, kanaka.» Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />«Webɛlɛ bato babele bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ na lɛni lya komwɛ n'to.Kwan'tangi kwekuhilɛ linali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenali bobɛlɛ bomɔná. Na lenale kemwɛ lyebɛlɛ olepa n'kelɔ kwa n'to kwa lusuku lomwɛ̂chi.</char></note> kama chitanɔ na kwa bobele kwekuhilɛ maumi matanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Baya bato babele habemɔninɛ kɛte bashiɔsha osuecha boya bomɔna. Koya minɛ bomɔna kwebalɛ̌lɛlɛ bɔsɛ babele lea lɛni. Obibyɔ, o baya bɔsɛ babele i kohe kwem'bɛnja wɛ̌nɛ koya n'to minɛ kwebahɛlɛ lea lɛni? <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Shimɔni kwekailɛ: «Neholanga kɛte i koya minɛ kwalɛɛlɛlwa bomɔna bwǐngi.» Yɛso kwen'sambelɛ: «Wǎkaa bisɔka.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekalowelɛ koya m'achana nǎ on'sambela shimɔni kɛte: «Wemwɛnɛ koko m'achana? Nɛnɛ nakingela n'sɛsɛ kyɔ̌bɛ, wasǎpa mǎte ma okɔka makolo manyi. Ela koko m'achana kɛnyikɛ kwakɔka makolo manyi na matata ma lohanga lwakɛ na ohosa makolo manyi na njuli chakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Kɔkwɛ wasatǎnya wa okombatela, ela koko m'achana, tango byandakingela hanɔ kushiolɛa oumbatela makolo manyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Kɔkwɛ osam'bɔnga mauta on'swɛ kwanyi, ela kɛnyikɛ, kwashinya mwambɔ o makolo manyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">O Bayolo n'kɛnyi kwahohiya, bebɛlɛ on'tanya m'om'ha mǎte ma osoa makolo, m'om'ombatela, m'om'bɔngya mwambɔ o makolo.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Yolo ya bîya, naosambela kɛte: Ata nǎmbɔ bobé bwakɛ bwebɛlɛ bwǐngi bwa lɛɛlɛlwa bɔsɛ. yolo kwamɔnya lǒndɔ lǒlo wa ndele. Koya minɛ kwabalɛɛlɛlwa hinɛ, kwebá onda hinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekaninɛ koya m'achana kɛte: «Bobé bɔbɛ bwalɛɛlɛlwa.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baya bebɛlɛ hamwɛchi na Yɛso m'oya, betolilɛ oboshana kɛte: «I n'to nake koko minɛ kwenaɔsha olɛ̌lɛla bobé?»  <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ela Yɛso kwekaninɛ koya m'achana kɛte: «Washa lyɔbɛ lyaohɔ̂nya, ketaka na talala.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Bǎchana bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ hamwêchi na Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ohwa haya, Yeso kwebɛlɛ ochongoloa m'maboka maolo na manɛ m'otɔkɔma Mwanɔ Kosɔka kwa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha. Bakikiwa bakɛ umi na babele bekelɛ hamwɛchi nǎkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na bamwɛ bǎchana bakebingilɛ miha, na bǎngɛ bekehɔnyinyɛ bisumi byabɔ. Hawǐngi ha baya bǎchana webɛlɛ: Maliya kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Magilalɛnɛ. Koya Malia nǎ minɛ Yɛso kwem'hunyinyɛ miha njwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Na Yanɛ m'achi kwa Kuza. Koya Kusa nǎ kwebɛlɛ n'kichi m'olo kwa Hɛlɔlɛ. Webɛlɛ eyǎka Suzana na bǎngɛ bǎchana bɛ̌ngi. Baya bǎchana bebɛlɛ uhunya bomɔná bwabɔ yolo ya owasha Yɛso na bakikiwa* bakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya m'uni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bato bɛ̌ngi bebɛlɛ uhuma o maboka mashikanɛ na okya wɛnɛ webɛlɛ Yɛso. Yɛso kwebakaninɛ ê eta: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Webɛlɛ komwɛ m'munyi kwebɛlɛ okya omwaka mbotɔ n'lobala lwakɛ. Hakebɛlɛ omwaka chiya mbotɔ chakɛ, bimwɛ bituchi byekǔlɛ habamba ndela. Na bɛndɔ bebinyatelɛ na tonɔnyi twebilelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />bǐngɛ byekǔlɛ o mawɛ, hachemɛninɛ, chekuminɛ yolo ya uhulwa mǎte m'bitɛtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Chǐngɛ chekǔlɛ m'bwǐngi mwa mǐkwa. Keya mǐkwa hakyeɔminɛ hamwêchi na biya bituchi, keya mîkwa kyebihiminɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ela biya bingɛ bituchi byekǔlɛ m'bitɛtɛ bisɔka. Byemɛninɛ na oha mia wa mia.» Yɛso hakehulɛ otɔkɔma biya, kwetɔkɔmɛ wa lete leolo okana: «Koya minɛ kwe na matɔ ma oholecha, koholechɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebalɔ ya osɔmya wa beta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Obibyɔ, bakikiwa* ba Yɛso bem'buchichɛ kɛtɛ: ‹‹Ê eta yehobɛnja okana é?» <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ: «Bɛnywɛ mwehɛlwɛ mwandɔ na Abɛcha wa omaná bito bya Boɔlɔ bwakɛ, ela o bǎngɛ bato nǎngo, bɔ nehosambela wa beta, yolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‹babɛ beholɔlá, ela bashimɔnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Yolo babɛoholechɛ, ela bashitɔtɔbɔlɛ.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Isaya 6.9</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwatɔtɔbɔla eta ya m'uni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka: «Holechiwɛ byɛnɛ byehobɛnja okana ê eta: mbotɔ nǎ Mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Chiya mbotɔ chɛnɛ chekǔlɛ habamba ndela chechihutanywɛ na baya bato bebaholecha Mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha. Hanyuma, Ehengele yechǔlɛ na ohunya koya Mwanɔ m'mitema kyǎbɔ, yolo bashiwashɛ na ohɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Chiya chekǔlɛ o mawɛ, chechihutanywɛ na baya bato bɛnɛ bebaholecha koya Mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha, na okowasha wa sasɔ. Ela koya Mwanɔ kushibabá na michinga n'ta mwǎbɔ, yolo bebawasha mɛngɔ manɛ ka. Habebabá m'bikinjwa, bebahanya washa lyabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Chiya chekǔlɛ m'bwǐngi mwa mǐkwa, i chihutanywɛ na baya bato bɛnɛ bebaholecha Mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha. Ela bebahelelechiwɛ na binywa bǐngi, na obɛnja bomɔná, na ǒnda ebalɔ, nǎ bashibabota bikuma. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Na chiya chekǔlɛ m'bitɛtɛ bisɔka chechuhutanɛ na baya bato bebaholecha koya Mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha na okobea n'ta n'tema kyǎbɔ, nǎ bebabota bikumá mia mia.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya yɛ̌ngɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka: «Ushi n'to kwenalamya tala na olewila na lwɛsɔ aɔ olebea osé wa elebaleba. Ela, kwebáebea o yɔbɔ, yolo bato habekingela n'sɛsɛ, bamɔnɛ yɛ̌ngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Na Byɔsɛ byɛnɛ byebibiswɛ, byebisulwa hololo, na shitɔ lyɔlyɔsɛ lyelibiswɛ lye manyiwa hololo.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />«Obibyɔ, shamakwɛ lwɛngɛlolomɛ o biya byamweoholecha! Yolo koya minɛ kwe na eto nǎ kwebahɛwa êngɛ, ela koya minɛ kushi na eto, ben'sapa na eya yakeholanga oba nǎyɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'nakɛ na bashiwabɔ na Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Lomwɛ lusuku, n'nakɛ kwa Yɛso na bashiwabɔ bekělɛ om'ɛnɛna, ela bashiɔshishɛ ohiya wakele yolo ya ubula wa bato. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ben'kaninɛ Yɛso kɛte: «N'nɔbɛ na bashiwɛnyu bee hamboka, behobɛnja oomɔna.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ela Yɛso kwebakaninɛ bato bɔsɛ kɛte: ‹‹M'ma na bashiwɛto, ná baya bɛnɛ bebáholecha Mwanɔ kwa Abɛcha na okoeta.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwǎmbela n'naka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwechininɛ m'bwǎtɔ hamwɛ̌chi na bakikiwa bakɛ. kɛ na obakaninɛ binɔ: ‹‹Totabowɛ m'bongɛ bwala bwa echiba.›› Nǎ byabekělɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Habetolilɛ lwɛndɔ, Yɛso kwewasilwɛ na tolɔ, kɛ na obeta. Hɔka haya, n'naka kwetolilɛ olomba (otola) m'echiba, na mǎte metolilɛ okingela n'ta bwǎtɔ, bebɛlɛ m'atale. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Baya balɔmbwɛ ba Yɛso, ben'kelɛ om'biola m'okaba kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, N'lɔmbɔchi twǎwa!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yɛso kwebyuilɛ, na oambela n'naka na mabembe, na webɛlɛ pí. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekaninɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ kɛte: «Washa lyɛnyu lyeohé?» Ela, bekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ, eyǎka bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba. Betolilɛ okaninana bɔka wa bɔka kɛte: «Koko i nanyi? Minɛ kwǎmbela n'naka na mabembe, na byɔnyibyɔ byam'holecha!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwabenga miha n'ta mwa n'to</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Hanyuma ha hâya,Yɛso na bakikiwa* bakɛ betabowɛ m'bwala echiba, bekimanɛ́ o yabo ya ebalɔ ya Bagɛlasi yɛnɛ ye yelɔlanɛ na ebalɔ ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osala m'bwǎtɔ, komwɛ n'to kwa keya mboka kwechǔlɛ hɔka nǎkɛ. Koya n'to kwebɛlɛ na miha, mɛngɔ malǎhu kushibɛlɛ ochwala ngobɔ, eyǎka kushibɛlɛ shama o sɛsɛ, ela o bichwate. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Hakɛm'mɔninɛ Yɛso, Kweletɛlilɛ hase hambɛlɛ hakɛ na kwekabilɛ wa lete leolo kɛte: «Yɛso, Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha kwee hakolo, ohobɛnja é na nɛnɛ? Naotɛndɛlela ushisǒbyɛ!»  <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kwekaninɛ biya, yolo Yɛso kwebɛlɛ okanina koya m'ha kom'humɛ. Koya m'ha kwebɛlɛ om'wata Nyɛndɔ chǐngi. Eyǎka bato bebɛlɛ om'hamba mikɔchi kya bikɛla o makolo na o mabɔ̂ yolo ya om'hɔcha. Ela kwebɛlɛ oala byɔsɛ. Eyǎka koya m'ha kwebɛlɛ on'longa okya n'longo.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Nǎ Yɛso kwem'buchichɛ: «Chǐna lyɔbɛ i nanyi?» Kwen'kailɛ: «Chǐna lyanyi i ‹Elele.› » Kwetɔkɔmɛ biya yolo miha kǐngi kyen'kingelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Keya miha kyelekɔmbɛlɛlɛ wa kele yolo kushibatɛlɛ m'ena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ena ye obɛnja okana i ibu yɛnɛ miha kyebawɛnywa nabyehiya lusuku lwa esula.</char></note> elǎhu. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ha eya ibu hebɛlɛ eoto ya ngolobɛ chɛnɛ chebɛlɛ oya o aɔnɔ. Keya miha kyelekɔmbɛlɛlɛ wa Yɛso kobalɛ̌ bakingelɛ n'chiya ngolobɛ. Yɛso kwewashishɛ bakyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Yolo ya bîya, keya miha kyehuminɛ n'koya n'to, na okingele n'chiya ngolobɛ. Eya eoto ya ngolobɛ yetolilɛ osala abelɔ, uhuma o aɔnɔ na oletɛla n'ta mwa echiba. Ngolobɛ chɔsɛ chechiminɛ<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Baumbi ba chiya ngolobɛ habemɔninɛ byɔsɛ byeeteɛ besininɛ, okya o mboka na o mabala okanina bato koya mwanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bato bechǔlɛ omɔna byɛnɛ byêteɛ. Ben'kelelɛ yɛso, bɔ na omɔna koya n'to minɛ miha kyem'huminɛ kwen'shamɛ hɔka na Yɛso, kwebɛlɛ n'chwalɛ ngobɔ na kwebɛlɛ na lwɛ̌nyi lwakɛ lɔsɛ, bemɔninɛ bɔ̌ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Baya bato bɛnɛ bemɔninɛ na mɛ̌sɔ mabɔ eya ekɔkɔ, betolilɛ okanina bange bato koya n'to minɛ kwebɛlɛ na miha kwehɔnyiwɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Bato ba ebalɔ ya Bagɛlasi bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba. Ben'sabilɛ Yɛso kuhumɛ m'eya ebalɔ. Yɛso kwechininɛ m' bwǎtɔ kɛ na okya. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Koya n'to minɛ miha kyem'huminɛ kwelekɔmbɛlɛlɛ wa kele yolo kokyɛ hamwɛchi nǎkɛ. Ela Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Suela ɔbɛ, okyɛ olesamba byaoetela Abɛcha.» Nǎ koya n'to kwekělɛ m'okana n'keya mboka, byɔsɛ byam'etela Yɛso.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enyundu ya Yailɔ na komwɛ m'achana bahɔnywa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwetabowɛ bongɛ bwala bwa echiba, eoto ya bato yem'pɔkɛlɛm yolo bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ om'hɛmba. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Komwɛ n'to chǐna lyakɛ Yailɔ kwechǔlɛ haya. Kwebɛlɛ m'hɛla kwa shinagɔgi. Kwebungilɛ machú hambɛlɛ ha Yɛso, na olekɔmbɛlɛla wakele kokyɛ o sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />yolo enyundu yakɛ yebɛlɛ osǒmwa hɔka na owa, na eya enyundu nǎ yebɛlɛ mwanâkɛ kwa ehɛnɛ. Ebɛlɛ na miâ umi na kebele. Yɛso kwekělɛ nakɛ hamwɛchi. Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwesebɛlɛ n'lwɛndɔ, eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ om'hindilicha ngobe chɔsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />M'eya eoto, webɛlɛ komwɛ m'achana kwebɛlɛ na esumi ya abale miâ umi na kebele. Kwekuchichɛ byɔsɛ byakebɛlɛ nǎbyɔ o bakilahi, ela ushi n'to kweɔshishɛ om'hɔnya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Koya m'achana kwesɛninɛ o nyumá wa Yɛso kɛ na ǒma ngobɔ kyakɛ. Hɔka haya kɛ na ohɔna. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yɛso kwebuchichɛ: «I nanyi minɛ kwakoma?» Bɔsɛ bekaninɛ nambɔ ushibɛlɛ n'to kwem'ominɛ. Pɛtɛlɔ kwen'kaninɛ: «N'lɔmbɔchi, eoto ya bato ye eochongolowɛ na oohindilicha ngobe chɔsɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ela Yɛso kwekaninɛ: «We n'to kwakoma, yolo naholecha omwɛ oɔma wapûma.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Koya m'achana hakemɔninɛ kɛte kwahomanyiwa, kwelehunyinyɛ m'otanda, na kwebungilɛ machú hambɛlɛ ha Yɛso. Kwekaninɛ hambɛlɛ ha bato bɔsɛ, ebalɔ ya om'oma Yɛso na byakehɔninɛ hɔka haya. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Enyudu yanyi, washa lyɔbɛ lyaohɔnya. Ketaka na talala!»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yɛso lwakebɛlɛ otɔkɔma, komwɛ n'to kwechǔlɛ uhuma o sɛsɛ kya Yailɔ na on'kanina kɛte: «M'hɛla! Enyundu yɔbɛ ishi hɔ eyǎka. ushin'tɛnjɛ eyaka n'lɔmbɔchi!» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yɛso hakeholechɛ biya, kwen'kaninɛ Yailɔ: «Ushibɛ na bɔ̌ba, washaka ka, na enyundu yɔbɛ yehɔna.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwehǐlɛ o sɛsɛ kya Yailɔ, kweɛminɛ n'to kɛkɛsɛ okingela hamwɛchi nǎkɛ, ela Pɛtɛlɔ na Yɔana na Yakɔbɔ na bibushi bya eya enyundu ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ m'olela mwǎna. Nǎ Yɛso kwebakaninɛ: «Moshilělɛ, yolo mwǎna kushinawá, kwebetɛ ka!» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bɔnyibɔ ben'sɛilɛ yolo bemaninɛ okana mwǎna kwesebɛlɛ m'mubɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ela Yɛso kwem'watilɛ mwǎna o obɔ̂ na okana wa lete leolo kɛte: «Mwǎna, byoaka!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Hɔka haya Eya enyundu yekukilɛ na okimana. Yɛso kwebakaninɛ bam'hɛ mwǎna elewa. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Bibushi byakɛ byekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. ela Yɛso kwebahanyinyɛ bashikaninɛ n'to kɛkɛsɛ byɛnɛ byêtea.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahila bakikiwa* bakɛ umi na babele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lok 6.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:1-16">10.1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Lomwe lusuku Yɛso kwesambanyɛ bakikiwa bakɛ umi na babele. Kwebahɛlɛ oɔma na boɔmɛ hakolo ha miha kyɔsɛ na ohɔnya bisumi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kwebahililɛ okya natɔkɔma Mwanɔ kwa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* na ohɔnya basǒmwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «N'ta lwɛndɔ lwɛnyu mushitɛtɛ eto na emwɛ yɔsɛ , nǎngo otɛta abangɔ na lotaa na n'katɛ na bomɔna. Mushitɛtɛ ngobɔ chibele. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />N'sɛsɛ kyɔkyɔsɛ kyamwekingela na om'pɔkɛla, chamakwɛ n'ya ná byamwesuela. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Nâmbɔ bato ba n'kemwɛ mboka baɛma om'pɔkɛla, humakwɛ n'keya mboka. Ela hamwehuma n'keya mboka, muhukumunɛ ahwele a o makolo mɛnyu. Na eya yebá bolɛhɔ wabele.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oukumuna ahwele o makolo: Nǎ okana n'to minɛ kwahilwa kushi eyǎka na lɛni o baya bakwahililwa, nǎmbɔ bahanya mwanɔ kwabahililwa.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ohwa, baya bakikiwa* betolilɛ lwɛndɔ okya naheta mboka wa mboka m'otɔkɔma Mwanɔ Kosɔka na ohɔnya basǒmwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matoba ma ɔlɔ Hɛlɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-19">Mlk 6.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Omaya mɛngɔ, Hɛlɔlɛ kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya ebalɔ ya Galilaya kweholechɛ myanɔ kya Yɛso, kwebɛlɛ na matoba, ebalɔ bamwɛ bebɛlɛ okana kɛte: «I Yɔana N'tabii kwa kuka.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bangɛ bebɛlɛ okana kɛte: «I n'languchi Ɛlia kwamɔnea eyǎka.» Na bangɛ kɛte: «I komwɛ n'ŋanguchi cha ala kwakuka.»<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ela Hɛlɔlɛ kwekaninɛ kɛte: «I Nɛnɛ minɛ kweachichɛ n'swɛ kwa Yɔana. Koko kongɛ i nanyi kwande oholecha myanɔ kyakɛ?» Obibyɔ Hɛlɔlɛ kwebɛlɛ na yǒma ya om'mɔna.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwalesha bato ɛlufu atanɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yɔa 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Hesuelɛ baya bakikiwa ben'sambelɛ Yɛso byɔsɛ byabeitilɛ. Ohwa Yɛso kwekělɛ nǎbɔ kɔ na bato, lǒbe lwa mboka kya Bɛtɛsaila.<verse eid="LUK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ela bato bemaninɛ wakebɛlɛ, ben'laminɛ. Yɛso kwebapɔkɛlɛ nǎ obasɔmwa binywa bya Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* nǎ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ basǒmwá kwebáhɔnyinyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ chǒba lyesebɛlɛ osala, baya bakikiwa umi na babele besɛninɛ hɔka nakɛ na on'sambela kɛte: «Obɛsambela bato bakyɛ o maboka na o bitola byɛnɛ bye hɔka, baleɛbɛlɛ elewa na ibu ya obeta, yolo hanɔ hetwele i n'ta longo.»<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ela Yɛso kwebasambelɛ: «Bɛnywɛ mobahɛ elewa.» Ben'kailɛ: «Twe na mikate ketanɔ na swe chibele ka. Wehobɛnja tokyɛ obakolela elewa baba bato bɔsɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />[ Na haya hebɛlɛ olanga balomyana ɛlufu atanɔ. ]</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yɛso kwesambelɛ balɔmbwɛ bakɛ kɛte: «Mosambelɛ bato bashamɛ hase m'bioto bya bato maumi matanɔ matanɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Balɔmbwɛ*beitilɛ mwebesambelɛ Yɛso na achamya bɔsɛ hase. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Ohwa biya, Yɛso kwekuhilɛ keya mikatɛ ketanɔ na chiya swe chibele, kwelɔlilɛ hakolo na obihalela. Ohwa, kwebinɔkilɛ, naoha balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ yolo bakabanyinyɛ bato. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Baya bato bɔsɛ belelɛ naokyota. Balɔmbwɛ betɔlilɛ makoko mɛnɛ meshikalɛ, bekilochɛ bitanga umi na bibele.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtɛlɔ kwǎkana kɛte Yɛso nǎ Kilishito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osaba kɛ buchima, balɔmbwɛ bakɛ bebɛlɛ hɔ̂ka nǎkɛ. Kɛ naobabocha bînɔ: «Bato behokana nɛnɛ nee nanyi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bɔ naon'kǎ kɛte: «Bamwɛ behokana kɔkwɛ nǎ Yɔana n'chunji, na bangɛ kɛte wee Ɛlia, na bǎngɛ wee komwɛ hawǐngi ha ŋanguchi cha ala minɛ kwakuka.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Obibyɔ, Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ: «Na bɛnywɛ mwee okana nɛnɛ nee nanyi?» Pɛtɛlɔ kwekailɛ kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ Kilishito mwǎna* kwa Abɛcha.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwehotɔkɔma yolo ya lubu lwakɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Mlk 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Haya, Yɛso kwehanyinyɛ bakikiwa bakɛ bashikaninɛ n'to kɛkɛsɛ koya mwanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />eyǎka Kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Byelěngyɛ nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nesosoɛ wɛ̌nɛ, naoɛmwa na baongo na bahɛla ba bibole* na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ*. Něhakwa, ela lusuku lwabotato nekuka.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ohwa, kwebakaninɛ bɔsɛ kɛte: «Nǎmbɔ n'to kwehobɛnja ondama, koleɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oleɛma: nǎ okana ushibeolanga ka yolo ya kɔkwɛ minɛ.</char></note> kɛ mǐnɛ na kotɛtɛ n'salaba kwakɛ masuku mɔsɛ na kondamɛ <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Yolo koya n'to kwe obɛnja ohɔnya mwɛkɔ kwakɛ kwekochiminya. Ela koya kwechiminya mwɛkɔ kwakɛ yolo yanyi, kwekohɔnya. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Eyǎka, we akɔɛlɔ nake n'to ohɛwa bomɔna bɔsɛ bwa ebalɔ, ela wa olechiminya na oletɔkya kɛ mǐnɛ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Obibyɔ, Nǎmbɔ n'to kwambɔnɛna abolɛ na omɔnɛna abolɛ binywa byanyi, nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to lwanyi, něm'ɔnɛna abolɛ mɛngɔ mendechwa n'ta butukufu bwanɛ na bwa Tata, na butukufu bwa bakɛnji* bahaha. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Neon'sambela kěnɛ: we bamwɛ bɛnɛ be hanɔ, bashîwa bashinamɔna Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwakaloa yɛnyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ohwa oeta olanga masuku enana, Yɛso ohwa otɔkɔma biya binywa, kwekuhilɛ Pɛtɛlɔ na Yakɔbɔ na Yɔana, kwehɛlilɛ nabɔ oaɔnɔ osaba Abɛcha*. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Hakebɛlɛ osaba, yɛnyi yakɛ yekalɔɛ, na ngobɔ kyakɛ kyesebɛlɛ kehaha na okɛngɛta wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30-31" />M'eya yɛ̌ngɛ, mwetɔbɔɛ balomyana babele bebɛlɛ bakilolɛ na butukufu, Musa na Iliya. Baya bolomyana bebɛlɛ okɔmbɔla na Yɛso yolo ya lubu lwakɛ lwɛnɛ lwesele hɔka obɔ Yɛlusalɛma.<verse eid="LUK 9:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />M'maya mɛngɔ, Pɛtɛlɔ na bɛ̌nakɛ bebɛlɛ babetɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Ela mɛngɔ mabebyuilɛ, bemɔninɛ butukufu bwa Yɛso, na baya bato babele bebɛlɛ bakimanɛ hamwɛ̂chi nǎkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Baya balomyana babele hɛnɛ habelɛanɛ na Yɛso, Pɛtɛlɔ kwen'kaninɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, i bibɛnju toshamɛ́ hanɔ. Tokubaɛ bitola bitato: emwɛ yɔbɛ na engɛ ya Musa na engɛ ya Ɛlia.» Ela pɛtɛlɔ Kushibɛlɛ omana byakebɛlɛ otɔkɔma. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Pɛtɛlɔ hakebɛlɛ kwěleotɔkɔma, lisu lyechǔlɛ obawila. Baya bakikiwa bemɔninɛ bɔ̌ba bwɛnɛ mɛngɔ mechǔlɛ leya lisu obawila. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />M'leya lisu, mweholecheyɛ lete okana: «Koko nǎ mwananyi kwandesɔbɔlɛ, m'holechakwɛ kɛnyikɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ohwa oholecha lea lete, baya bakikiwa bemɔninɛ Yɛso kwashikala kɛ buchima, beshaminɛ pi, na m'maya mɛngɔ bashikaninɛ o n'to kɛkɛsɛ biya byabemɔninɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwabenga miha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />M'ɛshi mwakɛ, habebɛlɛ osala ohuma o toɔnɔ, eoto eolo ya bato yechulɛ osambana nakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />M'eya eoto, n'to komwɛ̂chi kwetɔkɔmɛ lete leolo kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi! naotɛndɛlɛla, ondɔlɛlɛ koko mwanânyi, mwǎna kwa ehɛnɛ! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />M'ha kwa bolobe kwehom'wata, na, om'hila koetɛ yɔka, na on'tekecha, na ehuchu om'huma o anywa. Koya m'ha kweon'sosola wɛ̌nɛ na kushiban'lɛa abelɔ na on'shika mwɛkɔ kolɛbɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nasaba balɔmbwɛ bɔbɛ bakoběngɛ, ela basaɔ̂sha.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Haya Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Bɛnywɛ bato ba manɔ masuku bashi na washa eyaka bato babé, neshama nɛnyu mpaka mɛngɔ naké? M'paka mɛngɔ naké nebaom'ihya? Obɛ̌chwa na mwanɔ̌bɛ hanɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />mɛngɔ mɛnɛ koya mwǎna kwebɛlɛ sɛna hɔka na Yɛso, hɔka haya, koya m'ha kwen'tɛlilɛ hase na om'eta bolobe. Ela Yɛso kwebingilɛ koya m'ha na ohɔnya koya mwǎna na on'suecha we sakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Bato bɔsɛ bekakelwɛ na boɔmɛ bǒlo bwa Abɛcha.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yɛso kwatɔkɔma eyǎka yolo ya lubu lwakɛ</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ baya bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ beleokakelwa yolo ya biya bikɔkɔ byɔsɛ byakeitilɛ, Yɛso kwesambelɛ balɔmbwɛ bakɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Holechiwɛ bisɔka byandeon'sambela: nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to netambolwa m'mabɔ̂ ma bato.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ela balɔmbwɛ bashitɔtɔbɔlɛ eya enywa. Eya enywa Yebɛlɛ ibiswɛ wabele yolo bashiemǎnɛ, na bebɛlɛ na bɔ̌ba bwa om'bocha ebalɔ ya eya enywa.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">M'hɛla hawǐngi ha bakikiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Ohwa biya, bakikiwa ba Yɛso bebɛlɛ oeta pǎ bɔka wa bɔka, yolo bamanɛ nanyi nǎ m'hɛla hawǐngi habɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yɛso kwemaninɛ biya byabebɛlɛ olanga m'mitema kyǎbɔ. Obibyɔ kwekuhilɛ mwǎna kwa alɛla, na om'beya hɔka nǎkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Kwebakaninɛ bînɔ: «N'to kɛkɛsɛ kwepɔkɛla koko mwǎna kwa alɛla o chǐna lyanyi, nɛnɛ nǎ kwapokɛla. Kɛkɛsɛ kwapɔkɛla nɛnɛ, i koya minɛ kwepililɛ nǎ kwapɔkɛla. I okana, koya minɛ kwe n'nuna hawǐngi hɛnyu nǎ m'hɛla.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koya kushiamango ɛto kwe lǒbe lwɛto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Obiya, n' kikiwa Yɔana kwekaninɛ kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, twamɔna komwɛ n'to kweobenga miha o chǐna lyɔbɛ, na bɛswɛ twabɛnja om'hanya, yolo kushi komwɛ kwa enɔ eoto yɛto.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ela Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Mushim'hanyɛ, Yolo koya minɛ kushiamango ɛto kwe lǒbe lwɛto.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bato ba samalia baɛ̂ma om'pɔkɛla Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Masuku ma Yɛso okohiwa okya hakolo mesebɛlɛ hɔka, kwehambilɛ m'ongɔ (ibipakanyɛ) kwa okya Yɛlusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />O bibyɔ, Yɛso kwetangichɛ bato. Baya bato bekělɛ, na bekingilɛ n'kemwɛ mboka kya Basamalia*, yolo ya on'lɔngɛcha ibu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ela bato ba keya mboka beɛminɛ om'pɔkɛla yolo kwebɛlɛ okya Yɛlusalɛmu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tango ala Basamalia na bayola bashibɛlɛ holechanya. obibyɔ Basamaliya bashibɛlɛ bɛnja bayola bahetelɛ m'ebalɔ yabɔ haokya Yɛlusalɛma osaba Abɛcha.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Bakikiwa bakɛ Yakɔbɔ na Yɔana, Habemɔninɛ bîya, bekaninɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, ohobɛnja tosabé ahya uhuma hakolo asalɛ abachǐmywɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ela Yɛso kwebakaloelɛ na obaambela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">We bingɛ bitabɔ byekɔliwɛ ala byɛnɛ byebibǔchɛ bingɛ binywa o biya bya ala kɛte: «Eyǎka Yɛso kwekaninɛ: ‹Bɛnywɛ mushibamǎnɛ okana kɛte mwebaba na N'tema Kohaha kwa Abɛcha. Manakwɛ kɛte Nɛnɛ Mwana kwa N'to nesǎchwa ochimya bato, ela nichǔlɛ obahɔnya.› »</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Oesula, Yɛso na balɔmbwɛ bakɛ bekělɛ o kengɛ mboka.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olɛya byɔsɛ yolo ya on'lama Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Mɛngɔ mebebɛlɛ Yɛso na balɔmbwɛ n'tela, komwɛ n'to kwen'sambelɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Nebáolama ɔsɛ we weba okya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ: «Mibwabwa kyebábá na mahondo ma obetela na tonɔnyi twebábá na bǐsa. Ela nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nishibabá na ibu ya obetela.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekaninɛ kongɛ n'to kɛte: «Ndamakɛ.» Ela koya n'to kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, tanga ondea nakyɛ ochia tata.»<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Lɛakwɛ babu babɛochianɛ, ela kɔkwɛ obɛ̌kya nakanina bato Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Kongɛ n'to kwechǔlɛ okanina Yɛso kɛte: «Ɔlɔ Nêbaolama, ela ndɛakɛ nitangɛ okya olaka bato ba sɛsɛ kyǎnyi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yɛso kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «Kɛkɛsɛ kwe na luasu yolo ya olema na koholɔla unyuma, kushilěngyɛ otɔkɔma Mwanɔ kwa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">N'kelɔ kwa balɔmbwɛ maumi njwe na babele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ohwa biya, Ɔlɔ kwesɔbɔlɛ bǎngɛ balɔmbwɛ* maumi njwe na babele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">We bingɛ bitabɔ byɛnɛ byebikanɛ kɛte i maumi njwe.</char></note>. Kwebahililɛ babele babele, yolo babangwɛ m'maboka na ɔɔsɛ hɛnɛ kɛ mǐnɛ kwebɛnjichɛ okya. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Mikembo i kǐngi, ela bakembochi i banɛ. Wa biya, kaninakwɛ minɛ lobala kohilɛ bǎngɛ bakichi bachwɛ oeta n'kelɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Obibyɔ m'bɛkya! manakwɛ kɛte nam'hila nɛhɛ bǎna ba miɔɔ kyehokya hawǐngi ha lwele. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mushitɛ̌tɛ bomɔna, aɔ ahwaba, aɔ mikalabanda, na mushitanyɛ n'to kɛkɛsɛ n'ndela.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />«Sɛsɛ kyɔkyɔsɛ kyamwekingela, tangakwɛ okana kɛte: ‹Talala lyebɛ n'kenɔ sɛsɛ!› <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nambɔ komwɛ n'to kwatalala kohochama ha keya sɛsɛ, talala lyɛnyu lyeba nǎkɛ. nambɔ bishi bibyɔ, leya talala lyen'sowelela bɛnywɛ bɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Shamakwɛ n'keya sɛsɛ, moyɛ na monywɛ byɛnɛ byabem'ha, yolo n'kichi kwelěngyɛ ohɛwa malepɔ makɛ. Mushihumɛ n'keya sɛsɛ na okya o kengɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Hamwekingela n'kimwɛ mboka, na ban'kaa bibɛnju, moyɛ byabem'ha. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Hɔnyakwɛ basǒmwa ba keya mboka, na mokaninɛ bato kɛte: ‹Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwe hɔka na uhiya wɛnyu.› <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ela nambɔ mwakingela m'mboka elakɛ, na bato baɛma on'kaa, mokyɛ m'matela na mokanɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Twahukumuna hambɛlɛ hɛnyu ahwele a mboka kyɛ̌nyu hɛnɛ hɛɛ o byahe byɛto. Ela manakwɛ kɛte: Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwesele hɔka wemwele.› <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Chikelwɛ nan'kanina kɛte, lusuku lwɛnɛ Abɛcha kweeta ateka, bato ba keya mboka behɛwa ateka oheta bato ba Sɔlɔma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Botangi 19.24-28.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'shicha o maboka mam'hanya Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «I n'shicha ɔbɛ mboka kya Kɔlazini! I n'shicha ɔbɛ mboka kya Bɛtɛsaila! Yolo nambɔ bikake byandeitilɛ wɛnyu byenaeteɛ omboka kya Tilɔ na mboka kya Shilɔni, bato ba m'maya maboka benashaminɛ hasé, na ochwala elamba, na olebɔngya n'tɔ, yolo bamɔnyɛ kɛte bakalola bikɔkɔ byabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Obibyɔ, lusuku lwa ateka, masoso mɛnyu meheta ma bato ba Tilɔ na Shilɔni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na kɔkwɛ mboka kya Apɛlɛnaumu, weholanga kɛte mwehɛchiwa m'paka hakolo? nǎngo! Wetɛlwa m'ena elǎhu ya babu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka balɔmbwɛ bakɛ kɛte: «Nambɔ n'to kwam'holecha, i nɛnɛ nǎ kwaholecha. Ela koya minɛ kwam'hanya, i nɛnɛ nǎ kwǎhanya. Na koya kwapanya nɛnɛ, i koya minɛ kwepililɛ nǎ kwǎhanya.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osuela wa baya balɔmbwɛ* maumi njwe na babele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ohwa, baya balɔmbwɛ* maumi njwe na babele besuwelɛ na sasɔ leolo na bekaninɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, ata miha kyabaotoholecha mɛngɔ matwebɛlɛ okebenga o chǐna lyɔbɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Nǎ Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Nabaomɔna byɛnɛ Ehengele yabaokwa uhuma hakolo nɛhɛ ahɛnyuhɛnyu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />holechakwɛ: nam'ha boɔmɛ bwa okanda ehengele. Mwebá omatela ndɔa na ngɛlɛngɛlɛ, na ushi eto ata emwɛchi yɛnɛ yenam'eta bobe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ata biya, mushisɛ̌lɛlɛ yolo miha kyeom'holecha, ela, mosɛ̌lɛlɛ yolo machǐna mɛnyu memakɔliwa hakolo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sasɔ lya Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />M'mɔka maya mɛngɔ, N'tema Kohaha kwem'etelɛ Yɛso kobɛ na sasɔ, kwekaninɛ: «Tata, Ɔlɔ kwa kolo na asé, naoha buswachi, yolo wabisa o baya bee na bomanyi na lwɛ̌nyi bibi bito, na obibisula o bǎnyuɛ! Kɔkwe Tata, wabɛnja byabɛ binɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Tata kwǎpá bito byɔsɛ. Ushi n'to kwembǎnɛ nɛnɛ Mwǎna, ela Tata kɛ mǐnɛ. Ushi n'to kwem'mǎnɛ Tata, ela i nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwǎkɛ kwa ehɛnɛ nǎ neem'mǎnɛ, na bato bɛnɛ bandebɛnja bam'mǎnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwebasoelelɛ balɔmbwɛ bakɛ okana kɛte: «Komba bɛnywɛ behomɔna binɔ byamwehomɔna!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">We bingɛ bitabɔ bye bikanɛ kɛte: komba mɛ̌sɔ mehomɔna byamwehomɔna</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Chikelwɛ nan'kanina kɛte bibole bǐngi na maɔlɔ měngi bebɛlɛ bɛnja omɔna bibi bya mwehomɔna, ela bashibimɔninɛ. Eyǎka bebɛlɛ obɛnja baholecha bibi bya mweoholecha, ela bashibiholechɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya N'samaliya kwa misa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ohwa haya, komwɛ n'lɔmbɔchi kwa ndɔ* kwebɛnjichɛ on'tɔnda Yɛso. Kwekimanɛ na om'bocha kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, naetɛ é yolo nabɛ na mwɛkɔ kwa milombo?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «N'ta mwa ndɔ* mwebaban'kɔliwɛ wé? Na webatɔtɔbɔla wé haweba sɔma?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Koya n'lɔmbɔchi kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «M'bɛnjɛ Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kɔbɛ wa n'tema kɔbɛ kɔsɛ, na bon'to bɔbɛ bɔsɛ, na oɔma ɔbɛ ɔsɛ, na wa lwɛ̌nyi lɔbɛ lɔsɛ. Na obɛ ǒnda m'binji nɔbɛ nɛhɛ kɔkwɛ mǐnɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Engɛlɛ chɔ 6.5; Balawi 19.18</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />O esula Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Wakaa bisɔka! obɛ oeta biya, yolo obɛ na mwɛkɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ela koya n'lɔmbɔchi kwa ndɔ kwebɛnjichɛ olemɔnya oba n'to kwa chikelwɛ, kwem'buchichɛ Yɛso: «M'binji nanyi i nanyi?»<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Komwɛ n'to kwebɛlɛ sala uhuma Yɛlusalɛma okya Yɛlikɔ. Hakebɛlɛ n'tela, kwewasilwɛ na bilomɛ pambwa (bandi). Biya bilomɛ pamba ben'sapilɛ bito byakɛ byɔsɛ na om'hola, bɔ na on'shika kweohukumba.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />We chulɛ emwɛ ebole* yebɛlɛ heta n'keya ndela, hakem'mɔninɛ koya n'to, kwehitilɛ habamba na olekela. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Byɔka biya komwɛ N'lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N'lawi:Balawi bebɛlɛ bato ba elɔngɔ ya Ishilaɛli bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ owasha bahɛla ba bibolɛ oeta n'kelɔ n'ta lobonga sɔmakwɛ Lobalɔ 3.1-13.</char></note> kwehǐlɛ a eya ibu. Hakemɔninɛ koya n'to, kɛ lwakɛ kwehitilɛ habamba na olekela. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ohwa, wechulɛ komwɛ N'samaliya minɛ kwebɛlɛ oheta n'keya ndela. Hakem'mɔninɛ koya n'to, kwem'mɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kwesɛninɛ hɔka nǎkɛ, kwen'kilahɛ malasɛ makɛ na mauta na livai, na kwemahambilɛ. Ohwa, kɛ na on'chinya o ponda, kwekělɛ nǎkɛ o sɛsɛ kya bakɛnyi, yolo kokilahwɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="Le bon samaritain bande les plaies du blaissé" file="WA03863b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="10.34">N'samalia kwa misa kwa hamba malasɛ ma koya minɛ kweholilwɛ</figure><verse eid="LUK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />M'mɛshi mwǎkɛ, kwehunyinyɛ linali chibele cha bomɔna, na om'ha minɛ sɛsɛ na on'kanina kɛte: ‹Obɛon'kilaha bibɛnju koko n'to, na handesuwela, něosuechɛcha bongɛ bomɔna bwɛnɛ bwewehunya wakele.› »<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ohwa Yɛso kwem'buchichɛ koya n'lɔmbɔchi kwa ndɔ* kɛte: «Hawǐngi ha baya bato batato i nanyi kwelěngyɛ oba m'binji nakɛ kwa koya n'to minɛ kwewasilwɛ na bilomɛ pamba? <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Koya n'lɔmbɔchi kwa ndɔ* kwen'kailɛ Yɛso kɛte: «I koya minɛ kwǎm'mɔnɛna kɛnɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Nǎ Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ: «Ketaka na obɛoeta byɔka biya.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwaɛnɛna o sɛsɛ kya Malia na Malata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ okya na balɔmbwɛ, bekingelɛ n'kemwɛ mboka. N'keya mboka mwebɛlɛ komwɛ m'achana kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Malata, kwem'pɔkɛlɛ Yɛso o sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Koya Malata kwebɛlɛ na n'nunâkɛ minɛ kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Malia. Koko Malia kwebɛlɛ oshama habamba ha makolo ma Ɔlɔ Yɛso, m'oholecha byɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmya. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ela Malata kɛ kwebɛlɛ oeta kengɛ mikelɔ kya n'sɛsɛ. Kwen'kelelɛ Yɛso na on'kanina kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, biya byɔsɛ bishiohokanina eto wa omɔna n'nunânyi kwandɛa nɛnɛ ka oeta n'kelɔ? On'kaninɛ kombwashɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Yɛso kwan'kailɛ: «Aah Malata, Malata!Kɔkwɛ waletɛnja na bito bǐngi.» <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ela wee eto emwɛchi ka ye na akɔɛlɔ. Malia kɛ kwasɔbɔla eto ebɛnju wɛ̌nɛ. Na ushi n'to kwenaɔ̂sha on'sapa yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwe osomya balɔmbwɛ bakɛ osaba Abɛcha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lomwɛ lusuku Yɛso kwebɛlɛ a emwɛ ibu m'osaba. Lwakehulɛ osaba, komwɛ m'balɔmbwɛ bakɛ kwen'sambelɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, otosɔmyɛ osaba, nɛhɛ byeitilɛ Yɔana obalɔmbwɛ bakɛ. »<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yɛso kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «hamwebaosaba mobɛ́okana bînɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‹Tata!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">chǐna lyɔbɛ le tɔnywɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">boɔlɔ bɔbɛ bochwɛ!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Obɛ otoha elewa yeto ya masuku mɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Obɛ otolɛ̌lɛla bobé bwɛto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">ebalɔ bɛswɛ lwɛto twebalɛ̌lɛla baya bɛnɛ bebatoetela bobé,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">ushibɛ́ otolɛa tokingelɛ m'bikinjwa.› »<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Eyǎka Yɛso, kwebasambelɛ balɔmbwɛ bakɛ ê eta: «Nǎmbɔ komwɛ kwɛnyu kwe na kɛnda lyakɛ na koya kenda lyakɛ kwǎkya wakɛ m'bwingi na busuku na on'sambela kɛte: ‹Kɛnda, ebombo enɔ otangɛ opa mikatɛ ketato. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Yolo kenda lyanyi lya pihila, na lye n'lwɛndɔ nishi nayaom'ha.› <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Nǎmbɔ koya kwe n'ta sɛsɛ kwahoon'kǎ kɛte: ‹Ushitɛnjɛ! Nahohamba n'changɔ. Nɛnɛ na bǎna banyi twahobeta. Nishibyoa eyǎka naohɛ mikatɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nan'kanina kɛte nǎmbɔ kushibyoa om'ha yolo kɛ i kɛnda lyakɛ, kwebyoa na om'ha byɔsɛ byakwasaba yolo ya koya n'to kwekelelelɛ na osaba.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Obibyɔ nɛnɛ nan'sambela bînɔ: «Mobɛ osaba yolo mohɛwɛ, mobɛoɛba na mwemɔna, mobɛ ohola n'changɔ na mwesulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Yolo kɛkɛsɛ kwebasaba nǎ kwebahɛwa, na koya minɛ kwebaɛba nǎ kwebamɔna, na koya kwebahola n'changɔ nǎ beban'sulila. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Wé, we komwɛ hawîngi hɛnyu minɛ mwǎnakɛ kwahosaba swé, kwem'ha ndɔa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nǎmbɔ mwǎna kwahon'saba leke, kwem'ha ngɛlɛngɛlɛ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nǎmbɔ bɛnywɛ bato babé mwebahá bǎna bɛ́nyu bito bibɛnju, chikelwɛ sɛnyu kwa hakolo kwêha Ntema Kohaha o baya beban'saba kɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso na bɛlɛzɛbuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mlk 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ obenga m'ha kwɛnɛ kweitilɛ komwɛ n'to amɛmɛ. Hɔka haya, koya m'ha kwem'muminɛ na koya n'to kwetolilɛ otɔkɔma. Eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ haya yekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ela bamwɛ m'baya bato bekaninɛ kɛte: «Koko n'to kwehobenga miha o boɔmɛ bwa Bɛlɛzɛbuli, m'hɛla kwa miha.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bangɛ ben'tɔndilɛ okana kobamɔnyɛ emwɛ ekake, yolo bamanɛ nǎmbɔ kwahuma hakolo.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ela Yɛso kwemaninɛ malanga mabɔ, kwebakaninɛ bînɔ: «Nǎmbɔ bato ba bomwɛ boɔlɔ beoholana bɔka wa bɔka, boya boɔlɔ bushinakimana, na elɔngɔ yɔsɛ yɛnɛ bato beoholana bɔka wa bɔka eya elɔngɔ ishinakimana. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Nǎmbɔ Ehengele lwakɛ kweolehola bita, boɔlɔ bwakɛ bwekimana wé? Nehokana binɔ, i yolo mwehokana kɛte nee obenga miha na boɔmɛ bwa Bɛlɛzɛbuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nǎmbɔ nehobenga miha o boɔmɛ bwa Bɛlɛzɛbuli, bǎna bɛnyu behokebenga o boɔmɛ bwa nanyi? Obibyɔ baya bǎna bɛnyu nǎbemɔnya kɛte mushi na ndɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ela nɛnɛ nǎmbɔ nehobenga miha oboɔmɛ bwa Abɛcha, manakwɛ kɛte boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwahohiya wamwele.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«N'to kwa m'ɔ̌mu minɛ kwe na poto, kwebakonga sɛsɛ kyakɛ, bomɔna bwakɛ bwebabá talala. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ela nǎmbɔ n'to kwa m'ɔ̌mu om'heta kɛ, kwǎchwa olwa bita nǎkɛ, kwen'sapa maya mapoto mɔsɛ makebɛlɛ oleutakecha na okabanya bito byɔsɛ byakan'sapa.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />«Kɛkɛsɛ kushiolelonga wanyi, i amango anyi, koya minɛ kushiombwasha osambanya, kwehosala. »<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osuela wa m'ha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «M'ha kwahobengwa n'ta mwa n'to, kwebakya na hetaheta n'ta longo oɛba ibu ya olehɔcha. Nambɔ kwasamɔna ibu, kwebalesambela kɛte: ‹Nesuela o sɛsɛ kyǎnyi kyandahûma.› <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Haosuela wakɛ, kwebanga keya sɛsɛ kye kehakelwɛ na olɔngiwa bisɔka. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Obibyɔ, kwebakya okoha kengɛ miha njwe oheta kɛ. Bɔsɛ bechwa okingela n'keya sɛsɛ na oleshamina mɔ. Obibyɔ, koya n'to kwesosoa wɛ̌nɛ oheta habotangi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sasɔ lya kěnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yɛso hakebɛlɛ otɔkɔma bîya, komwɛ m'achana m'eya eoto ya bato kwehunyinyɛ lete leolo okana kɛte: «Kohalelwɛ m'achana minɛ kweobutilɛ na ookɔkya!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ela Yɛso kwen'kailɛ: «I bahalelwɛ baya bɛnɛ bebaholecha binywa bya Abɛcha na obiwata.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obɛnja omɔna abandelechɔ a ekake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Omɔna eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ okya na bǔla, Yɛso kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «Bato ba manɔ masuku bashibabɛnju. Behobɛnja bamɔnɛ abandelechɔ a ekake, ela bashihɛwa ekake nǎmbɔ ishi eya ya n'languchi Yɔna. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Biya byebɛlɛ Yɔna abandelechɔ o bato ba ninawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Yɔna 3.3-5</char></note>. Na byɛnɛ byeba nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to abandelechɔ o bato ba manɔ masuku.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />M'masuku ma ateka m'achi kwa ɔlɔ uhuma kusini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Ɔlɔ letangi 10. 1-10</char></note> kwe kukela hamwɛchi nɛ̌nyu yolo ya on'shitaki. Yolo kɛ kwehuminɛ kɔ, ochwa oholecha binywa bya lwɛ̌nyi lwa ɔlɔ Sɔlɔmɔnɔ. Obibyɔ, koko kwe hanɔ i m'hɛla oheta Sɔlɔmɔnɔ! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ loya lusuku lwa ateka lwe hiya, bato ba ninawi lwabɔ bekuka lomwɛ̂chi na bɛnywɛ bato ba manɔ masuku yolo ban'shitaki. Yolo habeholechɛ binywa bya n'languchi Yɔna, belebɛchichɛ. Obibyɔ, koko minɛ kwe hanɔ i m'hɛla oheta Yɔna!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">yɛ̌ngɛ yá m'bele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka: «Ushi n'to kwebalamywa yěngɛ na oebisa aɔ oewila m'etanga, ela kwebaebea hakolo o yɔbɔ, yolo bato bɛnɛ beokingela n'sɛsɛ bamɔnɛ yěngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mɛ̌so mɔbɛ nǎ yɛ̌ngɛ ya m'bele kɔbɛ, nǎmbɔ mɛ̌sɔ mobɛ me pɔ, m'bele kɔbɛ kɔsɛ kweba n'ta yɛ̌ngɛ. Ela Mɛ̌sɔ mɔbɛ nǎmbɔ me matɔ̌kɛ, nǎ m'bele kɔbɛ lwakɔ kweba n'ta n'tɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />O bibyɔ obɛ lwɛngɛ lolomɛ, yolo yɛ̌ngɛ ye n'ta mɔ̌bɛ ishikaloɛ oba n'tɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Obibyɔ, nǎmbɔ m'bele kɔbɛ kɔsɛ kwe n'ta yɛ̌ngɛ, na ushi yeba ye n'ta n'tɔ, m'bele kɔbɛ kɔsɛ kweba n'ta yɛ̌ngɛ yɛ̌nɛ, nɛhɛ biya byɛnɛ yɛ̌ngɛ yebalamia yɛngɛ yakɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwe hobɛcha Bafalisayɔ na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwehulɛ otɔkɔma, komwɛ m'falisayɔ* kwen'kalibishɛ wakɛ o sɛsɛ oya elewa, Yɛso kwekělɛ na oshama oya elewa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Koya M'falisayɔ kwekakelwɛ omɔna Yɛso kwebɛlɛ oya kushi n'lekɔkɛ mabɔ̂.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Yɛso kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «Bɛnywɛ Bafalisayɔ mwebakɔka bilɛkɔ na mbata hamboka, ela n'ta mitema kyɛ̌nyu mwen'kiluchu etema na bobé. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Bɛnywɛ bashi na lwɛ̌nyi, momane okana, koya minɛ kwelɔngichɛ hamboka nǎ minɛ kwelɔngichɛ ná n'ta byɔ̂ka bîya? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mobe oha ba mbuchu bito bye n'ta mbata na n'ta bilɛkɔ, yolo byɔsɛ byebɛ bihahachu wa mwele.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«N'shicha wɛnyu bɛnywɛ Bafalisayɔ, yolo mwebahunyá eba ya umi ya abale, na elewe, ná bingɛ byanyi byebalewa, ela mwebakibelela ndɔ na lǒndɔ lwa Abɛcha. Biya na byamwelěngyɛ obieta mushi kibelelɛ ohunya eba ya umi ya biya bîngɛ byɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«N'shicha wɛnyu bɛnywɛ Bafalisayɔ*, yolo mwebabɛnja oshama m'bibu bya bitangi n'ta mashinagɔgi. Eyǎka mwebabɛnja otanyiwa wa onyɛ̌mu m'bibu bya bato bɛ̌ngi. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />N'shicha kwɛnyu, yolo mwebaba nɛhɛ bichwate bishiomɔnɛa, ná bato behonyata hakolo hakɛ bashiomana.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Komwɛ hawǐngi ha nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ kwen'sambelɛ Yɛso kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, m'okana bibyɔ watotoa ná bɛswɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «N'shicha wɛnyu lwɛ̌nyu nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ! yolo mwebatɛcha bato michikɔ kyɛnɛ kishinatɛta n'to, ela bɛnywɛ mushibabea ata n'ywɛ kwɛnyu obawasha. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />«N'shicha kwɛnyu, yolo mwebakubaela bichwate bya ŋanguchi chɛnɛ bamasɛnyu olo behakilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Obibyɔ, mweoeta bolɛhɔ na owashana na bikɔkɔ bya bamasɛnyu olo, yolo bɔnyibɔ na behakilɛ chichɔ ŋanguchi, na bɛnywɛ mweokubaela bichwate byabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Yolo ya bîya, Abɛcha kwehokanɛ n'ta lwɛ̌nyi lwakɛ kɛte: ‹Nibahichicha ŋanguchi* na bakikiwa*. Ela bebaohaka bamwɛ na bângɛ bebasosola.› <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Haesula ee elɔngɔ yesabwa mashi ma ŋanguchi* mɔsɛ mɛnɛ mesuilɛ tango obombwa wa ebalɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Oya ohakwa wetolilɛ we Abɛli, m'paka we Zakalia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'alakɔ a ala, Bayola bemaninɛ okana minɛ kwebulɛ kwa n'tangi i Abɛli na kwaesula kwebɛlɛ n'languchi Zakaliya. Sɔmakwɛ Botangi 4.8; Bito bya masuku kwa bobele 24. 20-22</char></note> minɛ kwabehakilɛ m'lobonga hawǐngi ha etambolelɔ na ibu ya ehahachu. Chikelwɛ nehon'sambela mashi ma baya bato bɔsɛ meba o miswɛ kyɛ̌nyu bɛnywɛ bato ba manɔ masuku.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«N'shicha kwɛnyu bɛnywɛ nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ, yolo mohobisa bangɛ bato ahɔngɔlɔ, yolo bashimǎnɛ binywa bya obahǐcha wa Abɛcha, bɛnywɛ bɛnɛ mushiobɛnja okingela mwɛ, ela mwehsochibila bato bashikingelɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yɛso hakehuminɛ n'keya sɛsɛ, Bafalisayɔ na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ betolilɛ om'bocha binywa bǐngi wa songo, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />yolo bamɔnɛ ndela kya om'wata o binywa byakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Osɔmya yolo ya bubisakolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmya bato, eoto eolo ya bato yesambanɛ na bebɛlɛ ohinana yolo bebɛlɛ bɛ̌ngi. Yɛso kwetangilɛ okanina bakikiwa bakɛ kɛte: «Mobɛ lwɛngɛlolomɛ na n'shimi* kwa Bafalisayɔ, i okana bubisakolo bwabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Eto yɔsɛ yɛnɛ yeibisiwɛ, yebisulwa, na eya yêteɛ m'bubisɔkɔlɔ yemanyiwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Obiya, biya byɔsɛ bya mwǎtɔkɔma n'n'tɔ, bato bebiholecha n'chǒba, na biya bya mwekaninana oyomba ehambwɛ, byekaniwa lete leolo hakolo sɛsɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koya kwelěngyɛ osenwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka bato kɛte: «Nan'kanina bɛnywɛ makɛnda manyi: mushibɛ na bɔ̌ba o baya benahaka m'bele, ela ohwa ohaka, bashinaɔsha oeta engɛ eto. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nem'mɔnya koya minɛ kwamwenaba omɔna bɔ̌ba: mobɛ na bɔ̌ba bwa Abɛcha minɛ kwenaɔsha osapa mwɛkɔ kwa n'to, na ohwa okosapa, kwe na boɔmɛ́ bwa on'tɛla n'ta Jɛanamu. Chikelwɛ nan'kanina, koya nǎ mwelěngyɛ oba na bɔ̌ba wakɛ!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />«Mushiomana kɛte bisɔlɛ bitanɔ byebakolwa bomɔná bobele ka? Ela Abɛcha kushibakibelela ata esɔlɛ emwɛs. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ata chɛnɛ njuli cha o miswɛ́ kyɛnyu; Abɛcha kwem'mǎnɛ i chinga. Yolo ya bîya mushibɛ na bɔ̌ba, yolo bɛnywɛ mwebahetɛ bisɔlɛ onyɛma wa Abɛcha.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Om'washa Yɛso aɔ om'hanya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛtɛ: «Nan'kanina kěnɛ, n'to kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwewasha n'lakala kɛte kɛnyikɛ i n'lɔmbwɛ kwanyi, na nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to něm'washa hambɛlɛ ha bakɛnji* ba Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ela koya mine kwǎpanya hambɛlɛ ha bato, na nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nem'hanya hambɛlɛ ha bakɛnji ba Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />N'to kɛkɛsɛ kwěkana enywa ebe yolo yanyi nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to kwelɛ̌lɛlwa. Ela koya minɛ kwetoa N'tema Kohaha kɛ kushilɛ̌lɛlwa ata hinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Habeba okya nɛnyu yolo motɔtɔlɛ n'ta mwa mashinagɔgi* aɔ hambɛlɛ ha bahɛla aɔ hambɛlɛ ha maɔlɔ, mushibɛ na bɔ̌ba yolo ya biya byamwekaa aɔ byɛnɛ bya mwetɔkɔma. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Ebalɔ m'maya mɛngɔ, N'tema Kohaha kwem'bululila bya mwelěngyɛ okaa aɔ otɔkɔma.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya mbɔna minɛ kushi na lwɛ̌nyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Komwɛ n'to hawǐngi ha eoto ya bato kwen'kaninɛ Yɛso kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi ondɔkɔmɛnɛ wa n'shiwɛto kokabanyinyɛ yanyi eba o bohyanyi bwetoshikilɛ sɛto.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ: «Kenda lyanyi, i nanyi kwambea nɛnɛ oba aloleya hawǐngi hɛnyu aɔ yolo ya on'kabanyinya bomɔná bwɛnyu?»<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nǎ Yɛso kwekaninɛ bato bɔsɛ kɛte: «Mobɛ lwɛngɛlolomɛ na ǒnda bomɔná. Yolo mwɛkɔ kwa n'to kushi kuhutanyɛ na bomɔná bwakɛ, ata nǎmbɔ kwenabá na bomɔná bwǐngi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwebakaninɛ ê eta: «Webɛlɛ komwɛ mbɔna minɛ kwebɛlɛ na mabala makɛ mɛnɛ mebɛlɛ na n'kembo kwǐngi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Koya mbɔná kwetolilɛ olanga n'ta n'tema kwakɛ na olebocha: ‹Naetɛ ě? Nishi na ibu yandebeela n'kembo kwanyi.› <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Nǎ kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Nikiti byandêta: nebɛla tohɔmbɔ twanyi na nekubaa tôngɛ tǒlo tǒlo oheta tôya. N'ya, na mwandebea mikembo kyanyi kyɔsɛ na bǐngɛ bito byanyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ohwa, nelekanina nɛnɛ mǐnɛ kɛte: ‹Hanɔ nee na bomɔná bwǐngi bwandeya miâ kǐngi. Obinɔ, n'nalehɔ̂cha, neyɛ, nenywɛ na nebɛ na sasɔ!›<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ela Abɛcha kwen'kaninɛ: ‹Kokwɛ ehinda, bonɔ busuku nekoha n'tema kɔbɛ. Na biya bito byɔbɛ byɔsɛ byawele n'lebeelɛ byeba bya nanyi?› » <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka binɔ: «Bibi Nǎ byebabá wa n'to kwe olebeela bomɔná bwakɛ, yolo ya kɛ buchima, ela i mbuchu hambɛlɛ ha Abɛcha.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oba na utakelɔ wa Abɛcha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekaninɛ balɔmbwɛ bakɛ kɛte: «Yolo ya biya nan'kanina kɛte: mushibɛ onyɔngɔtɛlɛla elewa yolo ya mwɛkɔ kwɛnyu, aɔ onyɔngɔtɛlɛla ngobɔ yolo ya mibele kyɛnyu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Yolo mwekɔ kwɛnyu nǎ kwé konyɛmu wɛ̌ne oheta elewa, na mibele kyɛ̌nyu nǎ kye kenyɛmu wɛ̌ne oheta ngobɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Monakwɛ eta ya bǐmpole: Bishibaona, bishibakembola eyǎka bishibabea elewa na bishibaba na ahɔmba. Ela Abɛcha kwebabalesha. Obibyɔ, mushibamanɛ kɛte bɛnywɛ mwe banyɛ̌mu oheta bǐmpole! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ushi n'to kɛkɛsɛ hawǐngi hɛnyu kwenaɔsha otɛtɛa mɛngɔ manɛ o mwɛkɔ kwakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nambɔ mushiɔ̌sha oeta hieto hinɛ nɛhɛ hiya, obibyɔ, yolo yaě mweholetɛnja na bingɛ bito?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Monakwɛ byɛnɛ asoso byaebatɔta, ashioeta n'kelɔ wala olelɔngɛcha ngobɔ. Ela nan'kanina, ata ɔlɔ sɔlɔmɔnɔ m'bombɔna bwakɛ bɔsɛ, kushichwalilɛ ngobɔ kebɛnju nɛhɛ anɔ asoso. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Byǎnyi bya m'mabala bye omɔnɛa lênɔ na m'mɛshi kwakɛ byetɛlwa o ahya, ela Abɛcha kwebabichuya chibɛnju. I we kushina n'chuya bibɛnju, bɛnywɛ bé na washá lenɛ?<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Mushibeoletɛnjɛ m'oɛba byamwêya aɔ byamwênywa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />I bashibawashɛ Abɛcha na bato ba enɔ ebalɔ nǎ bebaɛba biya, bila oimwa. Ela bɛnywɛ, mwe na Tata minɛ kwekiti byɔsɛ byamwehobɛnja. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Obibyɔ, bɛnywɛ motangɛ oɛba Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha, na kɛ kwem'buchicha bito byɔsɛ byamweobɛnja.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Mushibɛ oshama na bɔ̌ba bɛnywɛ eoto enɛ! Yolo sɛnyu kwabɛnja om'ha boɔlɔ bwakɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bombɔná hakolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «Mokochɛ bomɔná bwɛnyu bɔsɛ. Na chiya falanga mohɛ chɔ bambuchu. Molelɔngɛchɛ bǒmbɛ bwɛnɛ bushina ahwaba ɛnɛ ashiachibowɛ, na mobeɛ bomɔná bwɛnyu hakolo hɛnɛ bushichimina. Oya wɛnɛ bɛ̌bi bashibahiya wala bichimu bishinatɔkya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Yolo, haya hɛnɛ he bǒmbɛ bɔbɛ, nǎ hɛba n'tema kɔbɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakichi bɛnɛ be lwɛngɛ lolomɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «Mobɛ oshama lwɛngɛ lolomɛ m'owɛnya aleɔmɔ (n'kaba) n'lobonda, na yɛ̌ngɛ yɛnyu yebɛ olama. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mobɛ nɛhɛ bakichi bɛnɛ beohɛmba minɛ sɛsɛ m'paka mɛngɔ makesuwela o lohangwɛ, yolo hɔka hâya, ban'sulilɛ n'changɔ hake ɔkɔla. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Komba o bakichi bɛnɛ mɛngɔ mesuwela ɔlɔ lyabɔ, kobabangɛ be mɛ̌sɔ! Nan'kanina kěnɛ koya ɔlɔ kwelehamba n'kaba n'lobonda, na obachamya hase na obaha elewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Komba o baya bakichi ata nâmbɔ leya Ɔlɔ lyabɔ lyahosuwela m'bwǐngi na busuku aɔ ham'hɛshi kɔsɛ na obabanga beele mɛ̌sɔ!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Manakwɛ binɔ: nâmbɔ minɛ sɛsɛ kwenamaninɛ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mechwa mǐbi, kushinalɛilɛ sɛsɛ kyǎkɛ obɛlwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Na bɛnywɛ molelɔ̌ngyɛ, yolo nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nechwa mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mushiolanga.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'kichi n'sɔka na N'kichi m'bé</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Nǎ Pɛtɛlɔ kwen'buchichɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, eya eta ya wǎ eta i yolo yɛto ka, aɔ i yolo ya bato bɔsɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ɔlɔ kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Nanyi nǎ n'kichi n'sɔka na kwa lwɛ̌nyi? I koya minɛ ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyam'bea ohɛmba sɛsɛ, yolo kokabanyinyɛ bǎngɛ bakichi elewa yabɔ, mɛngɔ mɛnɛ melěngyɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Komba wa koya n'kichi minɛ nambɔ ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyahosuwela lyem'bangɛ kohoeta biya. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Chikelwɛ lea Ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyem'bea oba m'hɛla yolo kokongɛ bomɔná bwakɛ bɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />«Ela nâmbɔ koya n'kichi kwatola oletɔkɔmɛna kɛ mǐnɛ okana: ‹Ɔlɔ lyanyi lyasenga osuela.› Hanyuma na otola ohola bakichi nakɛ, balomyana na bǎchana, na oya na onywa na oɔlwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyesuwela lusuku na mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kushikiti, kwem'ha koya n'kichi malipizi mabe na om'bea lǒbe lomwɛ̌chi na baya bakichi babé.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />«N'kichi minɛ kwem'mǎnɛ byɛnɛ ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyehobɛnja, ela kushiooeta byakelěngyɛ oeta, lea Ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyem'hola wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ela koya n'kichi minɛ kweeta byɛnɛ bishilěngyɛ wa ushiomana byɛnɛ byehobɛnja ɔlɔ lyakɛ, kweholwa hinɛ. Koya minɛ kwahɛwa bǐngi nǎ kwěsabwa bǐngi, na koya minɛ kwahɛwa bǐngi wɛ̌nɛ nǎ kwesabwa bǐngi wɛ̌nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso nǎ ebalɔ ya okabana wa bato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yɛso kwǎkana eyǎka kɛte: «Nechǔlɛ olamya ahya m'ebalɔ na nehobɛnja, abe alǎmɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Nelěngyɛ ohɛwa lochundɔ na n'nabɛnjichɛ loya lochundɔ lowelelɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Moholanga nechǔlɛ oshika talala m'ebalɔ? Nǎngo! I okabanya! <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Otola hanɔ, lobotɔ lwa bato batanɔ lwekabana, batato bebá lǒbe lwabɔ, na babele lǒbe lwabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tata kushiholechanya na mwanǎkɛ, na mwǎna lwakɛ kushiholechanya na sakɛ, m'ma kushiholechanya na enyundu yakɛ, na ɛnyundu lwayɔ, ishiholechanya na n'nakɛ, m'ma boɔ kushiholechanya na m'achi kwa mwanǎkɛ, na m'achi kwa mwǎna lwakɛ, kushiholechanya na n'nakɛ boɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omana mɛngɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka eya eoto ya bato kɛte: «Mɛngɔ mamwebamɔna lisu lyahohɛla uhuma wɛnɛ webakya chǒba (ngelelɔ), haya mwebakana kɛte: ‹Mbula kyelɔa, na kěnɛ kyebaloa.› <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Hamwemɔna n'naka kwa kusini kwahochwa kwǐngi, mwebakana: ‹Weba yǒta›, na byeetea byɔka biya. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Bɛnywɛ tolombe ndokecha! Mwebamǎnɛ olangola n'naka wa omana byebaba ebalɔ na kolo. Yolo yaě mushinaɔsha omana bito bya manɔ mɛngɔ?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oholechanya na amango ɔbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «Yolo yaě mushinalealela bɛnywɛ bɛ̌nɛ eto esɔka yemwelěngyɛ oeta? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nambɔ n'komanyi nɔbɛ kwaohicha o mashitaki na mohokya bɛnywɛ bɔsɛ o tololeya, byenabɛlɛ bisɔka moholechanyɛ nǎkɛ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mwele n'tela. Nambɔ ushioeta biya, koya n'to kwe ohicha o tololeya, na tololeya tweotambola o bamishipala, na bamishipala beotɛla n'kole. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Kěnɛ naokanina kɛte: ‹Ushihuma n'lea kole, m'paka hawehwa olepa bomɔná bwa isula.› »<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Akɔɛlɔ a olɛa bobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />M'maya mɛngɔ, bamwɛ bato bechulɛ we Yɛso na on'sambela yolo ya bato ba ebalɔ ya Galilaya, bɛnɛ Pilatɔ kwehakichɛ, mɛngɔ mabebɛlɛ ohaka nyama chabɔ na on'tambolela Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Ohwa Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Mweholanga kɛte baya Bagalilaya bɛnɛ behakilwɛ biya, bebɛlɛ na bobé oheta bangɛ Bagalilaya bɔsɛ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Nǎngo! Ela nan'kanina kɛte nambɔ bɛnywɛ lwɛnyu mushinalɛa bobe bwɛnyu, bɛnywɛ bɔsɛ mwewa ka, byɛnɛ bɔ bebulɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Na m'mboka kya Shilɔamu sɛsɛ kyǒlo kyekulilɛ bato umi na enana na bebulɛ. Obibyɔ, moholanga kɛte bɔ ka nǎ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ na bobé oheta bangɛ bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ shama Yɛlusalɛma? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nǎngo! Ela nan'kanina kɛte nǎmbɔ bɛnywɛ lwɛnyu, mushinalɛa bobe bwɛnyu, mwêchima nɛhɛ bɔnyibɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya n'te kushioha bikuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwebasambelɛ ee engɛ eta kɛte: «Komwɛ n'to kweuninɛ tini n'lobala lwakɛ lwa misabibu*. Lomwɛ lusuku, kwekělɛ kohɔmbɛ́ bikuma o koya n'te, ela kushibangilɛ ɔ eto. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Yolo ya bîya, kwesambelɛ n'kichi kwakɛ kwa loya lobala kɛte: ‹Lɔlaka! Wesele myâ ketato kyɛnɛ kyaeta koko tini, nishibabanga ɔ eto. Alaka kɔ! Yolo kohotɔkya bitɛtɛ bonɛnɛ› <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ela, koya n'kichi kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Ɔlɔ, tanga okolɛa konɔ mwâ, nekelelela okosɛolela na okobeela bito bya okonakya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />O bibyɔ, hângɛ kweha bikuma m'mwâ kwɛnɛ kwechwa. Na nambɔ kushiha, haya wenakoála.› »<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya komwɛ m'achana lusuku lwa sabatɔ*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lomwɛ lusuku lwa sabatɔ*, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmya bato n'shinsagɔgi* lya Bayola. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />N'leya mwebɛlɛ komwɛ m'achana n'sǒmwa. Koya m'achana, kweitilɛ miâ umi na enana m'osoba na m'ha. Koya m'ha kwesebɛlɛ kom'bungɛ n'kɔngɔ, na kushibɛlɛ oɔsha eyaka ololama. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwemɔninɛ koya m'achana, kwem'buchichɛ na on'sambela kɛte: «M'achana! Wahɔnyiwa esumi yɔbɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yɛso kwem'beelɛ mabɔɔ hakolo hakɛ. Hɔka haya koya m'achana kwekinuɛ na kwetolilɛ on'tɔna Abɛcha.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ela m'hɛla kwa leya shinagɔgi* kwechikelelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ, ebalɔ Yɛso kwehɔnyinyɛ n'to lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*. Obibyɔ, kwesambelɛ bato bɛnɛ besambanɛ n'ya kɛte: «Webaba masuku n'toba ma oeta n'kelɔ. Obibyɔ, nǎ m'maya masuku ma mwelěngyɛ ochwa mohɔnyiwɛ bisumi byɛnyu, ela nǎngo lusuku lwa sabatɔ*.»<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ela, Ɔlɔ kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Bɛnywɛ mwe babisakolo! Atambe lusuku lwa sabatɔ* kwabalwa hawingi hɛnyu kwebasola ŋɔmbɛ kyǎkɛ aɔ ponda kyǎkɛ ohuma n'leha okya okenyusha mǎte! <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Koko m'achana i kwa elɔngɔ ya Ibulaimu minɛ Ehengelé kwem'hambilɛ myâ umi na enana. Obibyɔ byasabá bibɛnju on'sula lusuku lwa sabatɔ*?»<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yɛso hakehulɛ otɔkɔma bîya, tomango twakɛ twetɔbilɛ na abolɛ. Ela bangɛ bato bɔsɛ, bɔ bewasilwɛ na sasɔ o bikɔkɔ bya okakecha byɛnɛ byakebɛle oeta.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya ekumá enɛ ya halalali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mat 13.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha i buhutanɛ náě? Na twenabolengamanya ná ě? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Boya Boɔlɔ bwebuhutanɛ na himbotɔ hinɛ hya halalali, hyɛnɛ n'to komwɛ̌chi kwekuhilɛ na okeona n'lobalá lwakɛ. Hiya himbotɔ hyemɛninɛ na oba n'te, na tonɔnyi twechǔlɛ okubaa bǐsa byabɔ o matabe makɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka kɛte: «Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* nenabolengamanya náě <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Bobɔ Boɔlɔ* ibuhutanɛ na n'shimi* kwɛnɛ komwɛ m'achana kwekuhilɛ na okosambanya na busu bwingi, mpaka byɛnɛ koya n'shimi kwebimbichɛ boya busu bɔsɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'changɔ konɛ́</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21.23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yɛso kwekelelelɛ na lwɛndɔ lwakɛ okya Yɛlusalɛma. Kwebɛlɛ okya na sɔmya bato m'maboka maolo na manɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />N'to komwɛ̌chi kwem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, bato banɛ ka nǎ behɔna?» Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Omɛnyɛnyakwɛ okingelela o n'changɔ konɛ. Ebalɔ nan'kanina kěnɛ, bato bɛ̌ngi betɔnda okingela mɔ, ela bashiɔsha.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mekimana minɛ sɛsɛ na ohamba n'changɔ, bɛnywɛ mweshikala hamboka. mwebaohola n'changɔ m'okana: ‹Ɔlɔ otobukulilɛ!› Nakɛ kwen'kǎ: ‹Nishikiti wa mwahumina.› <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Na mwetola okana kɛte: ‹Bɛswɛ nǎ baya bebɛlɛ oya na onywa hamwɛchi nɔ̌bɛ. Eyaka webɛlɛ m'matela ma maboka kyɛto.› <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ela kɛnyikɛ kwebakanina kɛte: ‹Bɛnywɛ nishin'kiti, humakwɛ hambɛlɛ hanyi bɛnywɛ bɔsɛ bawa bobe!›<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />«Haya nǎ mwemɔná Ibulaimu na Isaka na Yakɔbɔ na ŋanguchi* chɔsɛ n'ta Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*. Ela bɛnywɛ, mwetɛlwa hamboka. Obɔ, mwelela na oteka mɛ̌nɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bato bechwa ohuma huminɔ na ngelelɔ, ohuma hakolo na o manda. Baya bato beshama m'oya elewa m'Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Holechiwɛ! Bamwɛ bato bɛnɛ bee baesula, beba batangi. Na bɛnɛ bee batangi, beba ba esula.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso koholela yolo ya bato ba Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />M'mɔka maya mɛngɔ, bamwɛ Bafalisayɔ* bekelɛ we Yɛso on'sambela kɛte: «Humaka hanɔ, olekělɛ ôngɛ, ebalɔ Hɛlɔlɛ kwehobɛnja oohaka.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Mokyɛ osambela aya ambwe okana lênɔ na m'mɛshi něbenga miha na ohɔnya basomwa. Na m'bongɛ něba nahohwa n'kelɔ kwanyi. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ela nelěngyɛ okelelela na lwɛndɔ lwanyi lenɔ, na m'mɛshi na m'bôngɛ. Ebalɔ bishilěgyɛ n'languchi* ohakwa n'kengɛ mboka, ela Yɛlusalɛma.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Aah bɛnywɛ bato ba Yɛlusalɛma! Bɛnywɛ mwebahaka ŋanguchi*. Na bato ba Abɛcha bɛnɛ bakem'hililɛ, mwehobahaka m'obatɛlɛla mawɛ. Nyɛndɔ chǐngi nebɛlɛ obɛnja om'ombelecha nɛhɛ kɔɔ kyebahombelecha bǎna bakɛ m'bihwahwa. Ela bɛnywɛ mwasawâshá. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />O binɔ holechiwɛ! Sɛsɛ kyɛnu kyeshikala bonɛnɛ. Nan'kanina kěnɛ kɛte mushimbɔna eyaka, ná byehia mɛngɔ mamwekana kɛte: ‹Kohalelwɛ koya kwehochwa o chǐna lya Ɔlɔ.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Zabuli 118.26</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya n'sǒmwa lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lomwɛ lusuku lwa sabatɔ*, Yɛso kwekělɛ oya elewa o sɛsɛ kya komwɛ m'hɛla kwa Bafalisayɔ*. Bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ n'keya sɛsɛ, bebɛlɛ on'lɔla wɛ̌nɛ yolo bamɔnɛ byakêta. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ombɛlɛ wa Yɛso webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to minɛ kwebɛlɛ na esumi ya ohela m'bele. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yɛso kwebuchichɛ nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ* na Bafalisayɔ* kɛte: «Ndɔ* kyɛto kyebawasha aɔ kyebahanya ohɔnya n'to lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ela beleshaminɛ pi. Yɛso kweominɛ koya n'sǒmwa na om'hɔnya, na kwen'kaninɛ kolekělɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ eyǎka kɛte: «I nanyi hawǐngi hɛnyu, nambɔ mwanǎkɛ aɔ ŋɔmbɛ kyǎkɛ kyakula m'ena ya mǎte lusuku lwa Sabato* kushikya abelɔ na okehunya, ata nǎmbɔ i lusuku lwa Sabatɔ*?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ela bɔnyibɔ bashibamɔnɛ enywa ya on'kaa.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olehɛcha aɔ olesacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yɛso kwemɔninɛ byɛnɛ bato bebuchiwɛ, byabebɛlɛ osɔbɔla bibu bya bitangi. Obibyɔ, kwebahaninɛ bînɔ: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Nambɔ n'to elakɛ kwahôbocha o lohangwɛ, ushibɛ oshama o ibu ya hambɛlɛ. Ebalɔ wenachwa kongɛ n'to kwabochiwa kwa n'nyɛ̌mu ooheta. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Na koya minɛ kwem'ohetɛ kwabehiya, koya minɛ kwam'bocha bɛnywɛ bɔsɛ babele, kwenaokanina kɛte: ‹Shikilaka koko n'to ibu.› Haya wemɔna abolɛ a okya oshama o esuba ya onyuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ela nambɔ wabochiwa , ketaka oshama o esuba ya onyuma. Obibyɔ, koya minɛ kwaobocha kwahohiya, kwenaokaniná kɛte: ‹Kɛnda lyanyi, chutaka onɔ ombɛlɛ. Haya, wěnyɛma hambɛlɛ ha bɔsɛ bɛnɛ wehoya nǎbɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Yolo kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwebalehɛcha, kwesachiwa. Ela kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwebalesacha, kɛ kwehɛchiwa.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ohwa Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ koya minɛ kwem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ we ohɛtana elewa ya m'onda, ebɛ ya chǒba, aɔ ya ekɔlɔ, ushibɛobocha ka makɛnda mɔbɛ, aɔ bashiwɛnyu, aɔ bibushi byɔbɛ aɔ babinji nɔbɛ mbɔnaka. Yolo wahoeta bîya, bɔlwabɔ beobocha oya wabɔ wa osɔmbɔcha ohetela biya bya webaetelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ela, wahoeta m'onda, obɛobocha bambuchu na bitɛndɛ na lwǎta na bihɔbu. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Obibyɔ weba na miha, yolo baya bato bashina ya oosowechecha. Ela Abɛcha kweosɔmbɔcha mɛngɔ mɛnɛ baya bɛnɛ bee basɔka bekuka.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya m'monda kǒlo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ohwa, komwɛ n'to hawǐngi ha baya bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ bashamɛ haya m'oya na Yɛso, hakeholechɛ biya binywa, kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Komba n'to koya kwêya elewa m'Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ ohetela ée eta kɛte: ‹‹Webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to minɛ kwelɔngichɛ m'onda kǒlo, na kwebuchichɛ bato bɛ̌ngi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Hamehǐlɛ mɛngɔ ma oya, kwehililɛ n'kichi kwǎkɛ okanina baya bakebuchichɛ okana kɛte: ‹M'bɛchwa, yolo bito byɔsɛ byesele bilɔngiwɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ela kwabâlwa, kwetolilɛ okana ebalɔ in'chibilɛ kushihǐyɛ. Kwa n'tangi kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Nekulilɛ lobálá, na nelěngyɛ okya olomɔna. Naotɛndɛlɛla ombɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Kǒngɛ kwen'kaninɛ: ‹Nekulilɛ ŋɔmbɛ umi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">O bayola, bebɛlɛ ohamba ŋɔmbɛ chibele chibele wa olema</char></note> cha olema mabala. Obinɔ, nehokya nǎchɔ netɔndɛ nemɔnɛ nambɔ cheɔsha oeta n'kelɔ. Naotɛndɛlɛla ombɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Na kongɛ kɛte: ‹Nǎwele okɔnda, i ebalɔ nishǐchwa.›<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />«Koya n'kichi kwesuwelɛ wa ɔlɔ lyakɛ. Kwen'kaninɛ biya binywa byɔsɛ. Leya ɔlɔ lyakɛ halyeholechɛ bîya, lyechikelelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Na lyekanina koya n'kichi kwakɛ kɛte: ‹Ketaka abelɔ m'matela maolo na manɛ ma mboka. Ochwɛ na bambuchu, na bitɛndɛ, na bihɔbu na lwǎta.› <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ohwa, koya n'kichi kwesuwelɛ na okana kɛte: ‹Ɔlɔ, biya byawǎkanina naetɛ, nabieta. Ela ata bîya wele ibu.›  <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Lea ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Ketaka m'matela mɔsɛ ma maboka manɛ na ma o mabala. Bato bɔsɛ bawemɔna, obahindilichɛ yolo bakingilɛ mwǎnyi, ebalɔ sɛsɛ kyanyi kyekilolɛ bato. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kěnɛ nan'kanina kɛte ushi ata komwɛchi hawingi habaya bɛnɛ babuchiwa kwêya elewa kwanyi.› »<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">olɛa byɔsɛ yolo ya olama Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lomwɛ lusuku, bato bɛ̌ngi bebɛlɛ olama Yɛso. Kwekaloɛ na obasambela kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Koya minɛ kohobɛnja ondama, kokondɛ oheta sakɛ na n'akɛ, na m'achiakɛ, na bǎna bakɛ, na bashiwabɔ, na kachi chakɛ. Eyǎka kokondɛ oheta mwɛkɔ kwakɛ kɛ mǐnɛ. Nambɔ bishibîya kushinabá n'lɔmbwɛ* kwanyi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />N'to minɛ kushiɔsha otɛta n'salaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">otɛta n'salaba i owasha masoso aɔ owa yolo ya Kilishito*</char></note> kwǎkɛ, na okonda, kushinabá n'lɔmbwɛ* kwanyi.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />«Nǎmbɔ komwɛ hawǐngi hɛnyu kohobɛnja okubaa sɛsɛ keolo wɛ̌nɛ, byelěngyɛ kotangɛ oshama, komɔnɛ nambɔ kwenabá na bomɔná bwakenaɔsha oeta nabɔ koya n'kelɔ na okohwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ela, nâmbɔ kwatola n'kelɔ kwa okubaa n'sele, hanyuma kɛ na oiswa ohwa keya sɛsɛ, bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bebaokemɔna bebaon'sɛya <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />m'okana kɛte: ‹Koko n'to kwatola okubaa sɛsɛ, ela, kwasaɔsha ohulilisha n'kelɔ.›<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />«Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ ɔlɔ elakɛ lyehobɛnja onywa bita na lêngɛ ɔlɔ, byelěngyɛ kotangɛ oshama, lyemɔnɛ nambɔ ohetela oɔma wa bilusha byakɛ ɛlufu umi byakele nǎbyɔ, lyenaɔsha koya minǎkɛ minɛ kwe na ɛlufu maumi mabele. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Kwahomɔna kushiɔsha, kwenahila mwanɔ o koya kongɛ nakɛ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kwěle kɔ, yolo kom'bochɛ byɛnɛ benaeta yolo babɛ na talala hawingi habɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Wɛnyu bɛnywɛ nǎ byɔka bîya, ushi n'to hawǐngi hɛnyu minɛ kwenaba n'lɔmbwɛ* kwǎnyi nambɔ kushinalɛa byɔsɛ byakele nǎbyɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǐnyu kushi na akɔɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «Mǐnyu kwebâbá eto esɔka. Ela nambɔ kwachiminya sa kyakɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǐnyu kwa Bayola kushibɛlɛ kuhutanɛ na kwa leno.Kɔ kwebɛlɛ nɛhɛ lewɛ lyɛnɛ lyebɛlɛ obeiwa n'ta elewa, kwaholɔka kwebɛlɛ ohunyiwa na okongiwa eyǎka. kwahohwa sa kyakɛ, kwebɛlɛ otɛlwa. </char></note>, i ě yabenabêa n'ta yolo yasoechɛ sa kyakɛ? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Koya mǐnyu kushi na n'kelɔ kɔkɔsɛ, oba o bitɛtɛ aɔ oonaka. Bebakotɛla hamboka. Koya minɛ kwe na mato ma oholecha, koholechɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Eta ya m'ɔɔ kwechiminɛ na omɔnɛa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lomwɛ lusuku, bawa n'lambo na bangɛ bato babé, ben'sɛnɛnɛ Yɛso yolo bam'holechɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalisayɔ* na nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ* habemɔninɛ biya, betolilɛ on'tɔkɔma Yɛso bibe kɛte: «Koko n'to kwebasangelecha bato babé eyǎka kwebaya nǎbɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Obibyɔ, Yɛso kwebahɛlɛ ê eta kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Nambɔ komwɛ n'to hawǐngi hɛnyu kwee na miɔɔ kyakɛ miya kemwɛ̂chi, komwɛ hawǐngi hakyɔ kwahochimina, kwenaeta e? Atambɛ kwělɛa keya maumi lyahabola na lyabola o ibu ya olela na okya naɛba koya kwɛnɛ kwechiminɛ, m'paka kokomɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kwahôkomɔna, kwekowata na okobea o maɔmbɛ, m'okya nasɛ̌lɛla. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Hakehiya wakɛ, kwebosha makɛnda makɛ, na babinji nakɛ na obasambela kɛte: ‹Sɛ̌lɛlakwɛ hamwɛchi nǎnyi! Ebalɔ namɔna koya m'ɔɔ kwanyi kwechiminɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Kěnɛ, nehon'sambela kɛte nǎ byɔka bîya byɛnɛ Abɛcha kwebaba na sasɔ leolo mɛngɔ mɛnɛ m'wa bobe komwɛchi kwebalɛa bobe bwakɛ. Leya sasɔ lyakɛ lyebaba leolo naole bato maumi lya abola na lya abola bɛnɛ bashioɛba eyaka owasha.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufalanga lwa echɛlɛ lwechiminɛ na omɔnɛa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yɛso kwekelelelɛ otɔkɔma kɛte: «Olechiwɛ eyǎka: We, nǎmbɔ komwɛ m'achana kwe na bichɛlɛ umi bya falanga, emwɛ̂chi yahochimina, kwenaeta e? Atambɛ kwenalamya yɛ̌ngɛ na kwehyakela sɛsɛ, na oeɛba wɛ̌nɛ m'paka koemɔnɛ! <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Kwahoemɔna, kwebocha makɛnda makɛ na babinji nakɛ na obasambela kɛte: ‹Tosɛɛlɛlɛ hamwɛchi, ebalɔ namɔna eya echɛlɛ yanyi ya falanga yechiminɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nehon'sambela kɛte nǎ byɛnɛ bakɛnji* ba Abɛcha bebasɛ̌lɛla mɛngɔ mɛnɛ m'wa bobe komwɛchi kwebalɛa bobe bwakɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">M'walobaka kwechiminɛ na omɔnɛa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yɛso kwetɔkɔmɛ eyaka kɛte: «Webɛlɛ n'to komwɛ̂chi, kwebɛlɛ na bǎna bakɛ babele ba balomyana. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />N'nuna bato kwesambelɛ sakɛ kɛte: ‹Tata, pɛtakɛ eba yanyi ya bohyanyi m'bomɔna bɔbɛ.› Sakɛ kwebakabanyinyɛ bɔsɛ babele bomɔna bwakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />«Oheta masuku manɛ, koya n'nuná bato kwekuchichɛ bohyanyi bwakɛ bɔsɛ, na kwekelɛ na bomɔna bwakɛ o ebalɔ ya kɔ. Hakehǐlɛ obɔ, kwehulililɛ bomɔna bwakɛ m'masɛlɛkonda. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Lwakehulɛ otɔkya bomɔna bwakɛ bɔsɛ, m'eya ebalɔ mwekingilɛ asɛnga aolo. Kwehǐlɛ mpaka m'mɛngɔ ma kɛ oholwa na elewa. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Obiyɔ, kwekělɛ okelela komwɛ n'to kwa eya ebalɔ. Koya n'to kwem'hililɛ o mabala yolo kon'kongelɛ ngolobɛ chakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Koya m'walobaka kwebɛlɛ bɛnja oya elewa yɛnɛ ngolobɛ chebɛlɛ oya, ela wishibɛlɛ n'to kwa om'ha yɔ.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />«Obibyɔ, kwetolilɛ oletɔkɔmya n'ta n'tema kwakɛ kɛte: ‹Ɔla! Bakichi bɔsɛ ba tata beholɛka na elewa, ela nɛnɛ nehowa na asɛnga onɔ! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nesuela wa tata na nen'kanina kɛte: ''Tata, naeta bobé wa Abɛcha ná wéwéle tɛtɛtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Nishilěngyɛ eyǎka obuchiwa mwanɔ̂bɛ. Obɛmbea nɛhɛ komwɛ m' bakichi bɔbɛ.'' ›<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />«Nǎ koya m'walobaka kwetolilɛ osuela wa sakɛ. Hakebɛlɛ kwěle kɔ inɛ na sɛsɛ kyabɔ, sakɛ kwem'mɔninɛ na om'mɔnɛna kɛnɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Kwekělɛ abelɔ on'kalebesha, na kwen'yambelelɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="Le fils prodigue" file="WA03876b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="15.20">M'walobaka kwechiminɛ kwakalebeshwa na sakɛ</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Koya m'walobaka kwen'sambelɛ sakɛ kɛte: ‹Tata, naeta bobé wa Abɛcha, ná wéwéle tɛtɛtɛ. Obibyɔ, nishilěngyɛ eyǎka obuchiwa mwǎna kɔ̌bɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ela, sakɛ kwesambelɛ bakichi bakɛ kɛte: ‹Abelɔ m'bɛ̌chwa na ngobɔ kebɛnju mon'chuyɛ kyɔ. N'chuyakwɛ eyaka pɛtɛ o n'nywɛ na mikalabanda o makolo.› <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />M'bɛ̌chwa na longa lya mwǎna kwa ŋɔmbɛ kwa mauta, momohakɛ, toetɛ m'onda, na tosɛ̌lɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ebalɔ koko mwǎna kwaba m'ubɛ, ela kwakuka. kwaban'chiminɛ, ela kwamɔnɛa.› Obibyɔ, betolilɛ m'onda.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«M'maya mɛngɔ, m'olo bato kwebɛlɛ omabala. M'osuela, kwesebɛlɛ hɔka na mboka, kweholechɛ ngembɔ na ŋɔma. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kwebuchichɛ komwɛ hawingi ha bakichi na om'bocha kɛte: ‹we ě?› <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Koya n'kichi kwen'kailɛ kɛte: ‹I n'nunɔ̂bɛ kwasuela, na sɔbɛ kwam'hakela longa lya mwǎna kwa ŋɔmbɛ kya mauta, ebalɔ mwanâkɛ kwasuela kwe na mwɛkɔ.›<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />«Koya m'olo bato, hɔka haya kwewasilwɛ na songo, kweɛminɛ okingela na n'sɛsɛ. Sakɛ kwetɔbɔɛ amboka na olekombɛlɛla wa kele kokingelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ela kɛnyikɛ kwen'kailɛ sakɛ kɛte: ‹Holechaka! Kenɔ miâ kyɔsɛ kyandaoetela mikelɔ, nishinaɛma ata lomwɛ̂chi o binywa byɔbɛ. Ela, na lenɔ ushinapa ata himwɛ hyana hya mbuchi yolo naetɛ m'onda na makɛnda manyi. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ela, hachwa mwanɔ̂bɛ minɛ kwehulɛ bomɔna bɔbɛ bɔsɛ m'masɛlɛkonda, wam'akela longa lya mwňa kwa ŋɔmbɛ kwa mauta.›<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Sakɛ lwakɛ kwen'kailɛ kɛte: ‹Ɔla mwanǎnyi! Kɔkwɛ webaba nanyi masuku mɔsɛ, na byɔsɛ byandele nǎbyɔ i byɔbɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Atambɛ byaba bibɛnju toetɛ m'onda na osɛɛlɛla! Ebalɔ koko n'nunɔ̂bɛ kwaba m'ubɛ́, ela kwakuka. Kwaban'chiminɛ, ela kwamɔnɛa.› »<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Eta ya n'kungi kwa lwɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yɛso kwetɛlɛlɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ ê eta kɛte: «Webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to mbɔná kwebɛlɛ na n'kichi kwǎkɛ minɛ kwebɛlɛ okonga bito byǎkɛ. Bato ben'shitaki koya n'kungi wa ɔlɔ lyakɛ okana kohoya bomɔná bwa ɔlɔ lyakɛ bibe. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Nǎ ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyem'buchichɛ na on'kanina kɛte: ‹Bato behokana we yolo yɔbɛ? Binɔ, ombalela bomɔná bwanyi, ebalɔ ushiba eyaka n'kungi.›<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Koya n'kungi kwelangilɛ n'ta n'tema kwelebochichɛ kɛte: ‹Ɔlɔ lyanyi lyehobɛnja ombenga o n'kelɔ, o binɔ naetɛ we? Nishiɔsha olema, na osaba saba nemɔna abolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nahomana byandêta, yolo handebengwa o n'kelɔ, bato babɛ okalebesha wabɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Nǎ kwetolilɛ obocha bato malɛnyi ma ɔlɔ lyakɛ komwɛchi komwɛchi. Kwebuchichɛ koya kwan'tangi: ‹We na lɛnyi lya chnga wa ɔlɔ lyanyi?› <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Kwen'kailɛ kɛte: ‹Nee na lɛnyi lya ngongolo mia kemwɛ̌chi kya mauta. › Koya n'kungi kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Shamaka hanɔ abelɔ, kohaka ekɔlɛlɔ, kɔlaka ngongolo maumi matanɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ohwa kwebuchichɛ kongɛ kɛte: ‹Kɔkwɛ we na lɛnyi lya chinga?› Kwen'kailɛ: ‹Nee na lɛnyi lya saki mia kemwɛ̌chi kya busu bwa nganɔ.› Koya n'kungi kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Kohaka engɛ ekɔlɛlɔ, kɔlaka maumi enana.› <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Koya mbɔná kwesɛ̌lɛlɛ koya n'kungi mwɛ̌ngɛ, yolo ya lwɛ̌nyi lwakɛ. Ebalɔ bato ba enɔ ebalɔ bebaeta bito byabɔ hawǐngi habɔ wa lwɛ̌nyi oheta bato ba yɛ̌ngɛ. »<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka: «Na nɛnɛ nan'kanina kɛte mobɛ oleetela makɛnda na bomɔná bwa bubikya bwa enɔ ebalɔ. Yolo mɛngɔ mɛnɛ bushiba eyaka, Abɛcha kwem'pɔkɛla m'boshami bwa milombo. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />N'to minɛ kwem'utakelwɛ o bito binɛ, i kwa uútakelwa byɔka biya o bito biolo. Na koya minɛ kwe mwɛ̌ngɛ o bito binɛ, i mwɛ̌ngɛ ka na o bito biolo. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Obibyɔ, nambɔ bɛnywɛ mushi bautakelwɛ o bomɔná bwa bubikya bwa enɔ ebalɔ, i nanyi kwem'utakela wa okonga bomɔná bwa kěnɛ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Na nambɔ mushinaba bautakelwɛ o bomɔna bwa bangɛ, i nanyi kwenam'ha bomɔná bwelěngyɛ oba bwɛnyu?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Ushi n'kichi kwenakelela maɔlɔ mabele. Yolo, byelěngyɛ koɔnywɛ lemwɛ, na kobɛnjɛ lengɛ. Aɔ kweba n'chibatebatelwɛ wa lemwɛ ɔlɔ, na oɛcha lěngɛ. Mushinakelela Abɛcha na okelela bomɔná m'mɔka maya mɛngɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwakaa Bafalisayɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Bafalisayɔ* beholechɛ biya, ben'sɛilɛ Yɛso, yolo bebɛlɛ obɛnja bomɔná. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Nǎ Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Bɛnywɛ mwebalêta oba basɔka o mɛ̌sɔ ma bato. Ela Abɛcha kwebamana byɛnɛ bye m'mitema kyɛ̌nyu. Yolo, bito byɛnɛ bato bebamɔna oba bisɔka, Abɛcha kwebabiɔnywa wɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />M'benda* kwa Musa na mikɔlɔ kya ŋanguchi* na byɛnɛ bato bebɛlɛ olama mpaka ohiya masuku ma Yɔana N'chunji. Otanga maya masuku, i Mwanɔ Kosɔka kwa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* nǎ kwehotɔkɔmwa ka. Na kwabalwa kohoeta oɔma wakɛ ɔsɛ, yolo kokingelɛ m'boya Boɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ela, ata binɔ, oheta wa kolo na sé i ohuhu. Ela, M'benda* kwa Abɛcha kushihunyiwa ata abande amwɛchi.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«N'to kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwabenga m'achiakɛ na okɔnda kongɛ, komanɛ okana kwaeta busɛi. Na kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwekɔ̌nda m'achi kwabengwá, kɛlwakɛ kwaeta busɛi.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya mbɔna na Lazalɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yɛso kwetɛlilɛ eyaka ê eta kɛte «Webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to mbɔna. Koya mbɔna kwebɛle ochwala ngobɔ chisɔka wɛ̌nɛ na cha bɛi leolo. Masuku mɔsɛ kwebɛlɛ oeta m'onda kela lusuku. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ombɛlɛ wa sɛsɛ kya koya mbɔna webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to mbuchu, kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Lazalɔ. Koya Lazalɔ kwebɛlɛ na mbyabya m'bele kɔsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Kwebɛlɛ bɛnja oya makoko mɛnɛ mebɛlɛ okwa ohuma o etaleɔ ya koya mbɔna. Na towa twebɛbɛlɛ ochwa olamba mbyabya chakɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />«Lomwɛ lusuku, Lazalɔ kwebulɛ, bakɛnji* ben'kuhilɛ hɔka na Ibulaimu. Ohwa haya, koya mbɔná lwakɛ kwebulɛ, bɔ na on'chiya. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Oya o babú, koya mbɔná kwebɛlɛ ososowa wɛ̌nɛ. Kwekinunɛ mɛ̌sɔ, kwemɔninɛ Ibulaimu wa kɔ, na kwemɔninɛ Lazalɔ kwe hɔka nakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nǎ kwekabilɛ wa lete leolo kɛte: ‹Tata Ibulaimu, ombɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ! M'hilakɛ Lazalɔ kochundɛ n'nywɛ kwakɛ m'mǎte, yolo kohɔchɛ lulimi lwanyi. Yolo nehososoa n'ta lônɔ lolende.›<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />«Ela Ibulaimu kwen'kailɛ: ‹Mwananyi! Ɛngɛlɛchaka kɛte wepatilɛ bito bisɔka bǐngi hawebɛlɛ o mwɛkɔ. Ela Lazalɔ kwesosoɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Lenɔ kɛnyikɛ kwesele n'ta sasɔ, na kɔkwɛ we n'ta masoso. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Eyaka, hawingi ha bɛswɛ na bɛnywɛ hɛ ena eolo. Oibyɔ, baya bɛnɛ behobɛnja oheta ohuma onɔ, okya obɔ, bashiɔsha. Na baya bɛnɛ behobɛnja ohuma obɔ, ochwa onɔ, bashiɔsha.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Koya mbɔná kwekaninɛ kɛte: ‹Tata, naosaba tangaka uhila Lazalɔ kokyɛ o elɔngɔ yɛto, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />yolo ne na bashiwɛto batanɔ, kokyɛ obamɔnya yolo bashichwɛ ososoela onɔ o ibú ya masoso.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ela Ibulaimu kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Bashiwɛnyu bee na mikɔlɔ kya Musa na kya ŋanguchi*. Babɛ oholecha byɛnɛ byakekekǎnɛ!› <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ela koya mbɔna kwekaninɛ kɛte: ‹Nǎngo tata Ibulaimu. Na bishi biya ka, ela nambɔ komwɛ n'to kwakuka, na obakelela, benawasha.› <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ela Ibulaimu kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Nambɔ baya bashiwɛnyu bashinaholecha mikɔlɔ kya Musa na kya ŋanguchi* byakekekǎnɛ, bashinaholecha ata n'to kwakuka ohuma o babú.› »<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwatɔkɔma yolo ya bobe na olɛɛlɛla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:22">21.22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Ohwa Yɛso kwesambelɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ kɛte: «Binywa bya okusha bato m'bobe byekelelela ka. Ela i inshicha wa koya n'to minɛ kwekingecha bangɛ m'bobe. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Byenabɛlɛ bibɛnju n'to nɛhɛ koko kohambwɛ lewɛ leolo o ɔshi na on'tɛla m'echiba, naole kɛ kokoshɛ komwɛ hawingi ha baba bǎnyuɛ m'bobe.<verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />«M'bɛ oshama lwɛngɛlolomɛ! Nǎmbɔ inshiwɛnyu kwaolobela, m'hanakɛ, na kwaholekilocha, on'lɛ̌lɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nǎmbɔ kwaolobela nyɛndɔ njwe wa lusuku lomwɛ̌chi, na kwahoochwa ɔbɛ olekilocha nyɛndɔ njwe, on'lɛɛlɛlɛ ka.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohosɔmya yolo ya washa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Ohwa biya, bakikiwa* ben'sambelɛ Ɔlɔ okana: «Otobuchichɛ washa.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Kɛ lwakɛ kɛte: «Nǎmbɔ washa lyɛnyu lyenabɛlɛ nɛhɛ hiekuma hya halalali, mwenasambela koko n'te kɛte kocholeɛ kokyɛ oletɛla m'echiba, kwenam'washa.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'kelɔ kwa n'kichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka kɛte: «Komwɛ n'to hawingi hɛnyu kwenaba na n'kichi kwakɛ kwehotɛma o lobala aɔ okonga bisukanywa byakɛ. Koko n'kichi kwahosuela o mabala, wé, ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyenan'sambela kɛte koshamɛ na kotolɛ oya? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Nǎngo! Binɔ nǎ byakenan'kanina: ‹Tangaka opěla elewa, ohwa sɔmbɔlɔchaka ngobɔ yolo opakolelɛ. Ohwa biya, na kɔkwɛ wêya na onywa.› <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Wé, moholanga ɔlɔ lya koya n'kichi lyenaɔsha oha koya n'kichi boswachi, ebalɔ kwaeta biya byɔsɛ byɛnɛ kwan'sambela? Nǎngo! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Bɛnywɛ lwɛnyu i bîbi ka. Mwahoeta byɔsɛ byɛnɛ Abɛcha kwan'kanina oeta, mobɛ okana bînɔ: ‹Bɛswɛ twee bakichi bonɛnɛ ka. Tohoeta n'kelɔ byelěngyɛ bɛswɛ oeta ka.› »<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya bawa boshɔndɔ umi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yɛso hakebɛlɛ n'ta lwendɔ okya Yɛlusalema, kwehitilɛ n'ŋumba kya ebalɔ ya Samalia na ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Hakekingelɛ n'kemwɛ mboka, bato umi bɛnɛ bawa boshɔndɔ bechǔlɛ osambana nǎkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olamana na byɛnɛ M'benda kwa Musa kwebaba m'okana, n'to minɛ kwe na boshɔndɔ, kushibɛlɛlěngyɛ osɛna hɔka na bangɛ bato. Sɔmaka Balawi 13.46</char></note>. Bekimanɛ wa kɔ, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />na otola okololoa kɛte: «Ee N'nɔmbɔchi Yɛso, tomɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebamɔninɛ, kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «Mokyɛ olemɔnya o bibole*.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka Balawi 14.2-3</char></note> Habebɛlɛ bele n'tela m'okya obɔ, behɔninɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Komwɛ hawǐngi habɔ, hakemɔninɛ kɛte kwahɔna, nǎ kwesuelɛ wa Yɛso m'on'tɔna Abɛcha wa lete leolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kweletɛlilɛ hase ombɛlɛ wa makolo ma Yɛso, pala na m'bitɛtɛ, kwem'hɛlɛ boswachi. Koya n'to kwebɛlɛ N'samalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Nǎ yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: «We, atambɛ bashɔndɔ umi nǎ bahɔ̂nyiwa! Baya bangɛ lyahabola beohé? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ushiomɔnɛa kongɛ kwasuela on'tɔna Abɛcha, ela i konɔ kushi N'yola ka?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ohwa kwen'sambelɛ koya N'samaliya kɛte: «Kimanaka, okyɛ na talala. Washa lyɔbɛ lyaohɔnya.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ochwa wa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Ohwa haya, Bafalisayɔ* bem'buchichɛ yɛso kɛte: «Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwechwa mɛngɔ naké?» Kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bushǐchwa nɛhɛ eto ya omɔnɛa. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Bato bashikana kɛte: ‹Mɔnakwɛ, nǎ bonɔ bwe hanɔ!› Aɔ ‹Nǎ boya bwe hâya!› Hulichiwɛ! Boya Boɔlɔ bwesele hawǐngi hɛnyu.» <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwesambelɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ kɛte: «Mɛngɔ mehochwa, mamwebɛnja ombɔna nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to ata lusuku lomwɛ̂chi, ela mushimbɔna. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Na bato ben'sambela kɛte: ‹Lɔlakwɛ, kwee haya!› Aɔ ‹Lɔlakwɛ, kwe hanɔ!› Ela bɛnywɛ mushitɔɔ̌ndɛ osenena haya. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ebalɔ lusuku lwɛnɛ nɛnɛ Mwana kwa N'to nesuela, nemɔnea nɛhɛ ahɛnyuhɛnyu lwebamɔnɛa a hakolo wa olamia ebalɔ yɔsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ela hambɛlɛ ha biya byɔsɛ, nelěngyɛ nesosoɛ wɛ̌nɛ, na neɛmwɛ na bato ba enɔ elɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Nɛhɛ byebɛlɛ m'mɛngɔ ma Nɔa, nǎ byeba mɛngɔ mɛnɛ nɛnɛ Mwana kwa N'to nesuela. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Ebalɔ m'maya masuku, bato bebɛlɛ oya na onywa, bebɛlɛ okɔnda na okɔnjwa nǎ byewelelɛ mɛngɔ ma Nɔa okingela safina. Ohwa, pela kyechǔlɛ na ochimya bato bɔsɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Botangi 6.5-22; 7.1-23</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Eyaka byebá byɔka biya nɛhɛ mɛngɔ ma Lɔti. Bato bebɛlɛ oya na onywa, bebɛlɛ okocha na okola, bebɛlɛ ǒna na okubaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ela lusuku lwehuminɛ Lɔti m'mboka kya Sɔlɔma, Abɛcha kwekushishɛ ahya ebɛlɛ nɛhɛ mbula kya mawɛ ohuma hakolo. Aya ahya echiminyɛ bato bɔsɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Botangi 18.20-33; 19.1-25</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Biya nǎ byeba lusuku lwandesuela nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Loya lusuku, kɛkɛsɛ kwêbá hakolo ha sɛsɛ kyakɛ, kushisalɛ eyaka okoha bito byɛnɛ bye n'ya. Byɔka bîya, koya kwebá olobala lwakɛ, kushisuelɛ eyaka o mboka. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Moɛngɛlɛchɛ byehǐlɛ m'achi kwa Lɔti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka Botangi 19.26</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Kɛkɛsɛ kweɛba ohɔnya mwɛkɔ kwakɛ, kwekochiminya. Ela, kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwekochiminya, kwekohɔnya. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nehon'sambela kɛte m'boya busuku, bato babele bebá babetɛ hamwɛ̂chi, komwɛ kwětɛtwa na kongɛ kweshikwa.  <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bǎchana babele bebá oswa hamwɛ̂chi, komwɛ kwětɛtwa na kongɛ kweshikwa. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Balomyana babele bebá n'lobala, komwɛ kwětɛtwa na kongɛ kweshikwa.] »<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Haya, balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ bem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, bibi binywa byeetea ohé?» Kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Haya hɛnɛ hee etomba na hɛnɛ hebakilola maobe.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Eta ya aloleya na m'achana m'bulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yɛso kwetɛlilɛ eyaka balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ ée eta, yolo ya obamɔnya kɛte byelěngyɛ babɛ osaba Abɛcha bila oimwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Kwekaninɛ kɛte: «N'kemwɛ mboka mwebɛlɛ amwɛ aloleya. Aya alolea ashibɛlɛ onyɛmya Abɛcha, eyaka kwebɛlɛ oɛcha kela n'to. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />N'keya mboka mwebɛlɛ eyaka komwɛ m'achana m'bulwa. Koya m'achana m'bulwa kwebɛlɛ okya masuku mɔsɛ o aya aloleya on'kanina kɛte: ‹Ebombo enɔ, ndɔkɔmɛnɛ milando kyanyi bisɔka kyɛnɛ kyenaba hawingi ha nɛnɛ na n'komanyi.›<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />«Ela, masuku mɛ̌ngi mehitilɛ, aya aloleya ashitɔkɔmɛnɛ koya m'achana. O esula, elekaninɛ n'ta n'tema kwakɛ kɛte: ‹Kěnɛ, nishionyɛmya Abɛcha, na nishinabala n'to kɛkɛsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Ela, omɔna byɛnɛ koko m'achana m'bulwa kwatɛnja, nem'alela n'lando kwakɛ bisɔka. Ebalɔ nesahoeta biya, kwekelelela otɛnja ka.› »<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ohwa, Ɔlɔ kwekaninɛ eyaka kɛte: «Holechakwɛ bisɔka byakana áa aloleya abé! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />We, Abɛcha lwakɛ kushǐalela bisɔka baya bakesɔbɔlɛ, bɛnɛ beban'kabela busuku na chǒba? We, kwesenga obawasha? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nan'kanina kɛte kwebatɔkɔmɛnábyɔ abelɔ. Ela mɛngɔ mandechwa nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to, nebanga bato ba washa m'enɔ ebalɔ?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya M'falisayɔ* na m'wa n'lambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Webɛlɛ bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ olemɔna oba ba kěnɛ hambɛlɛ wa Abɛcha, na bebɛlɛ oɛcha bǎngɛ. Nǎ Yɛso kwebakaninɛ byɔka biya ée eta:<verse eid="LUK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Lomwɛ lusuku bato babele bekělɛ o Lobonga* osaba Abɛcha. Komwɛ kwebɛlɛ M'falisayɔ*, na kongɛ kwebɛlɛ m'wa n'lambó. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Koya M'falisayɔ* kwekimanɛ, na kwesabilɛ n'ta n'tema kɛte: ‹Ee Abɛcha kwanyi, naoha buswachi, yolo nɛnɛ nishiba nɛhɛ bǎngɛ bato. Bɔ bebaba bɛ̌bi, eyaka ba etema, eyaka basɛi. Eyaka naoha buswachi yolo nɛnɛ nishi nɛhɛ koko m'wa n'lambo. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nyɛndɔ chibele o inga, nebahamba losabɔ lwa ushioya. Eyaka nebahunya eba ya umi ya byɔsɛ byandebamɔna.› <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ela koya m'wa n'lambó kɛnyikɛ, kwekimanɛ wa kɔ, na kushitɔndilɛ olɔla hakolo. Ela, kwebɛlɛ ka olehola m'yǎle na mabɔɔ makɛ wa anyɔngɔtɛla m'olekɔmbɛlɛla kɛte: ‹Abɛcha kwanyi, ombɔbɛnɛ kɛnɛ! Nɛnɛ nee m'wa bobe!› <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Nǎ Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: ‹Nan'kanina kɛte koko m'wa n'lambó kwasuela o sɛsɛ, na Abɛcha kwam'mɔna kwa kěnɛ Ela nǎngo koya M'falisayɔ. Yolo n'to kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kwelehɛcha, kwesachiwa. Ela koya minɛ kwelesacha kɛ, kwěhɛchiwa.› »<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahalela bǎna bǎnyuɛ́</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Lomwɛ lusuku, bato bechǔlɛ na bǎna babɔ bǎnyuɛ wa Yɛso, yolo kobabêlɛ mabɔ̂. Ela mɛngɔ mɛnɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ bemɔninɛ biya, betolilɛ oambela baya bato. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ela Yɛso kwekaninɛ bachwɛ na baya bǎna wa kele. kwekaninɛ bakikiwa* bakɛ kɛte: «Molɛ̌ bǎna bachwɛ wa ndele! Mushibachibilɛ. Yolo Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* i bwa bato bee nɛhɛ bɔnyibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nan'kanina kěnɛ kɛte n'to kɛkɛsɛ minɛ kushipɔkɛla Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* nɛhɛ mwǎna, kushikingela ata hanɛ m'boya Boɔlɔ*.»<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus béni les petits enfants" file="WA03880b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="18.17">Yɛso kwahalela bǎna bǎnyuɛ</figure><verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohotɔkɔma na komwɛ mbɔna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:17-31">Mlk 1.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Komwɛ m'hɛla N'yaole kwebuchichɛ Yɛso kɛte: «N'nɔmbɔchi n'sɔka, naetɛ wé yolo nabɛ na mwɛkɔ kwa milombo?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Yolo ya é wambocha n'sɔka? Ushi n'to kwe n'sɔka, ela i Abɛcha kɛ buchima! <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Atambe webamana byɛnɛ mibɛnda* kya Abɛcha kyekokǎnɛ kɛte: ‹Ushibɛ oeta masɛi, ushibɛ ohaka, ushibɛ okiba, ushibɛ otɔkɔmɛna minɔ̌bɛ bya lulimi. Eyaka obɛ onyɛmya sɔbɛ na n'ɔbɛa.› » <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Koya n'to kwen'kailɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Keya mibenda kyɔsɛ nebabakewata tango bowalobaka bwanyi.»<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yɛso hakeholechɛ biya, kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Washikala eto emwɛchi ka ya waholwa: okochɛ byɔsɛ bya wee nǎbyɔ, na boya bomɔná bɔsɛ bwa wemɔna, okabanyinyɛ bɔ bambuchu. Wahoeta biya, wěba na bǒmbɛ hakolo. Ohwa, ondamɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ela hakeholechɛ biya binywa, kwechikelelwɛ, yolo kwebɛlɛ na bomɔná bwǐngi wɛ̌nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yɛso hakemɔninɛ kɛte koko n'to kwachikelelwa wɛ̌nɛ, kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Kěnɛ i biɔmu wɛ̌nɛ o bambɔná okingela m'Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*!» <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Kěnɛ i bihoho wa ngamiya oheta m'hondo lya loshingɛ, naole bambɔná okingela m'Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*.»<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Baya bato habeholecha biya, bebuchichɛ kɛte: «Nambɔ i binɔ, i nanyi kwehɔnyiwa?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Biya bishinaɔshɛa o bato, byebaɔshɛa wa Abɛcha.»<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Nǎ Pɛtɛlɔ kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Lɔlaka! Bɛswɛ twalɛa byɔsɛ bya twebɛlɛ nǎbyɔ, yolo ya oolama!»<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Nan'kanina kěnɛ: nambɔ komwɛ n'to kwalɛa sɛsɛ kyakɛ aɔ m'achiakɛ aɔ bashiwabɔ aɔ bibushi byakɛ aɔ bǎna bakɛ yolo ya Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />kwehɛwa bito bǐngi mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kwele hanɔ hase. Na mɛngɔ mɛnɛ mechwa, kwehɛwa mwɛkɔ kwa milombo.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwakana eyaka yolo ya lubu na ukukalwakɛ lwɛndɔ lwa botato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Ohwa biya, Yɛso kwekuhilɛ na baya bakikiwa* bakɛ umi na babele habamba, na obakanina kɛte: «Hulichiwɛ! Tohohɛla Yɛlusalɛma. Na oya, byewelela biya byɔsɛ byɛnɛ ŋanguchi* cha Abɛcha chekɔlilɛ yolo ya nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Yolo netambolwa m'mabɔɔ ma baya bɛnɛ bashi Bayola. Na bɔnyibɔ besɛa, na betoa, na osulila matɛ́, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />bepola toté, na o esula bepaka. Ela, masuku matato onyuma wa owa, nekuka.»<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ela, bakikiwa* bashitɔtɔbɔlɛ biya binywa, yolo byebɛlɛ bibiswɛ wabɔ. Na bashimaninɛ i ebalɔ ya é Yɛso kwetɔkɔmɛ bîya.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɔnya ehɔbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ hɔka na mboka kya Yɛlikɔ, kwebangilɛ emwɛ ehɔbu yebɛlɛ eshamɛ habamba ha ndela m'osabasaba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Eya ehɔbu hayeholechɛ eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ oheta, yebuchichɛ kɛte: «We ě?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bato ben'kailɛ kɛte: ‹‹Yɛso kwa kya Nazalɛti nǎ kooheta.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Hayeholechɛ biya, yekabilɛ kɛte: «Ee Yɛso Mwǎna kwa Laole, ombɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Baya bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ hambɛlɛ ha Yɛso, bem'ambelɛ na on'kanina kochamɛ pí. Ela kɛnyikɛ kwekelelelɛ okaba wɛ̌nɛ kɛte: «Mwǎna kwa Laole, ombɔnɛnɛ kɛnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yɛso kwekimanɛ, na obakanina bachwɛ na eya ehɔbu wa kele. Hayehǐlɛ hɔka na Yɛso, Yɛso kwěm'buchichɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Ohobɛnja naoetelɛ é?» Kɛlwakɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, nehobɛnja namɔnɛ eyaka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Nǎ Yɛso kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Mɔnaka eyaka! Washa lyɔbɛ lyaohɔnya!» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Hɔka haya eya ehɔbu yemɔninɛ eyaka. Yen'lamɛ Yɛso m'on'tɔna Abɛcha. Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ bato bɔsɛ bemɔninɛ biya, bɔ lwabɔ betolilɛ oseka Abɛcha.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso o sɛsɛ kya Zakayɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yɛso ohwa okingela m'mboka kya Yɛlikɔ, kwebɛlɛ oheta. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />N'keya mboka mwebɛlɛ komwɛ n'to kwebɛlɛ buchiwá Zakayɔ. Koya Zakayɔ kwebɛlɛ m'hɛla kwa bawan'lambo eyǎka mbɔná. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Kwebɛlɛ obɛnja komanɛ Yɛso i nanyi, ela, ebalɔ kwebɛlɛ n'kihihu, kushiɔshishɛ om'mɔna yolo ya obula wa bato. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Obibyɔ, kwebangilwɛ abelɔ, kwehɛlilɛ o n'te, Yolo komɔnɛ Yɛso, ebalɔ Yɛso kwabalěngyɛ ohetela n'keya ndela. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Mɛngɔ mehǐlɛ Yɛso hase ha koya n'te, kwelɔlilɛ hakolo na on'kanina Zakayɔ kɛte: «Zakayɔ, obɛsala abelɔ, yolo lênɔ nehongecha n'sɛsɛ kyɔ̌bɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakayɔ kwesalilɛ abelɔ nǎ on'sangelecha Yɛso wa sasɔ leolo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bato bɛnɛ bemɔninɛ bîya, betolilɛ onyɔngɔtɛla m'okana kɛte: «Hɔla! Kwǎkya okingela wa n'to kwa bobé!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ela, Zakayɔ kwekimanɛ hambɛlɛ ha Ɔlɔ na on'sambela kɛte: «Eee Ɔlɔ, holechaka! Nɛnɛ neha bambuchu eba ya bomɔna bwanyi. Na nǎmbɔ nesabilɛ oheta byelěngɛ, něn'suechɛcha nyɛndɔ china.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yɛso kwe kaninɛ kɛte: «Lenɔ, Abɛcha kwahɔnya kenɔ sɛsɛ, yolo koko lwakɛ i kwa elɔngɔ ya Ibulaimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ebalɔ nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nechǔlɛ oɛba na ohɔnya baya bechiminɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya bakichi batato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Bato bekelelɛ oolecha binywa byɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ otɔkɔma. Hakebɛlɛ hɔka na mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma, bato belangilɛ kɛte Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwehiya m'mɔka maya mɛngɔ. Nǎ Yɛso kwebaitilɛ ê engɛ eta kɛte. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />«Webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to kwa elɔngɔ ya boɔlɔ. Koya n'to kwekělɛ lwɛndɔ o ebalɔ ya kɔ, yolo kokimiwɛ o boɔlɔ na osuela oshama ɔlɔ m'ebalɔ yakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ela, hambɛlɛ ha kɛ ochoa, kwebuchichɛ bato umi hawǐngi ha bakichi bakɛ. Na obakabanyinya kwabâlwa bomɔná bomwɛ̂chi bomwɛ̂chi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bomɔna bomwɛ̂chi, bobɛlɛ bomɔna bwa olepa n'to o mibichi mia kemwɛ̂chi.</char></note>, na obasambela kɛte: ‹Moetɛ n'kelɔ na bobo bomɔna na obobucha nǎ byande suela.› <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ela bato ba ebalɔ yakɛ bebɛlɛ om'ɔnywa. Yolo ya biya, behililɛ bato bakyɛ okaná kɛte: ‹Tushi obɛnja kochwɛ onɔ kobɛ ɔlɔ lyɛto.›<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />«Ela ata biya koya n'to kwekimiwɛ obá ɔlɔ, na kwesuelɛ m'ebalɔ yakɛ. Hakehǐlɛ, kwebochechɛ baya bakichi bakɛ umi, yolo komanɛ kwabalwa kwapata akɔɛlɔ a bongá o boya bomɔna bwakebashikilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />N'kichi kwa n'tangi kwechǔlɛ na okana kɛte: ‹Ɔlɔ, akɔɛlɔ andamɔ̂na i umi o boya bomwɛ̂chi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Ɔlɔ lyen'sambelɛ kɛte: ‹Boswachi! Waeta bisɔka! Kɔkwɛ we n'kichi m'bɛnju. Omɔna webɛlɛ mwaminifu o bito binɛ, obibyɔ naobea oba m'hɛla kwa maboka umi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />N'kichi kwa bobele lwakɛ kwechǔlɛ na okana kɛte: ‹Ɔlɔ, akɔɛlɔ andamɔ̂na i atanɔ o boya bomwɛ̌chi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Ɔlɔ lyakɛ lye on'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Kɔkwɛ lɔbɛ naobea obá m'hɛla o maboka matanɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ohwa, kongɛ n'kichi kwechǔlɛ na okana kɛte: ‹Ɔlo, kohaka lofalanga lɔbɛ. Nilobisilɛ bisɔka n'ta hieba hya ngobɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Naba na bɔ̌ba bɔbɛ wɛ̌nɛ, yolo webabá n'lomyana n'kɔmakachu. Kɔkwɛ webakoha ishiyɔbɛ, eyǎka webákembola byɛnɛ ushioninɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyen'kaninɛ kɛte: ‹Kɔkwɛ we n'kichi m'bé! Neoha ateka olamana na binywa byɔbɛ, wemaninɛ nɛnɛ nebaba n'to n'komakachu, minɛ nebakoha bishi byanyi na okembolá byandasaôná. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Yolo yaé ushim'beɛ boya bomɔna bwanyi n'ta banki? Atambe haosuela wanyi nenabobangilɛ bwahobotana!› <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ohwa, leya ɔlɔ lyesambelɛ baya bebɛlɛ haya kɛte: ‹Koko n'kichi n'sapakwɛ bobɔ bomɔna, mom'hɛ koya minɛ kwe na umi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bɔ na on'kanina kɛte: ‹N'lɔmbɔchi, atambe kokɔ kwesele na bomɔná umi!› <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Kɛ na obakǎ kɛte: ‹Nan'kanina kɛte n'to minɛ kwe na eto nǎ kwehɛwa engɛ́. Ela, koya minɛ kushi na eto, ata hiya hinɛ hyakele nǎhyɔ hyesapiwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Eyǎka lea ɔlɔ lyakɛ lyekaninɛ kɛte: ‹Tomango twanyi, twɛnɛ tushibɛlɛ bɛnja nɛnɛ oba ɔlɔ lyabɔ, mochwɛ nǎtɔ hanɔ na motohakɛ hɔka hanɔ nɛnɛ m'omɔna.› »<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwa kingela Yɛlusalɛma na onyɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yɔa 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yɛso hakehulɛ otɔkɔmá bîya, kwekelelelɛ na lwɛndɔ lwakɛ lwa ohɛla Yɛlusalɛma, m'oba hambɛlɛ ha eoto bato. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Kwehǐlɛ hɔka na mboka kya Bɛtɛfagɛ na kya Bɛtania, lǒbe lwa aɔnɔ a Mizɛituni. Kwehililɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ babele, na kwebakaninɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />«Kewakwɛ m'mboka kyɛnɛ kye hambɛlɛ hɛnyu. Hamwehiya obɔ, mwebanga mwǎna kwa ponda kwem'hambwɛ, minɛ kushinatɛta n'to kɛkɛsɛ. N'sulakwɛ, mochwɛ́ nakɛ hanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nambɔ n'to kwam'bocha kɛte yolo yaé mwan'sula, n'kǎkwɛ kɛte: ‹Ɔlɔ kohom'bɛnja.› »<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Baya balɔmbwɛ bɛnɛ behililwɛ bekělɛ. Bebangilɛ byɔka biya byɛnɛ Yɛso kwebasambelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Habebɛlɛ osula koya mwǎna kwa ponda, bɛnɛ nǎkɛ bebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Yolo yaé mohosula koya mwǎna kwa ponda?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bɔ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ nǎ minɛ kohom'bɛnja.»<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Na byabekělɛ na koya mwǎna kwa ponda wa Yɛso. Ohwa, bekandilɛ ngobɔ́ chabɔ hakolo ha keya ponda, na on'chinya Yɛso hakolo hakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ kwěle n'lwɛndɔ, bato bekelelelɛ m'okanda ngobɔ chabɔ n'tela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayola mɛngɔ ma osangelecha m'hɛla, bebɛlɛ on'kandela ngobɔ n'tela wa on'nyɛmya. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yɛso hakehǐlɛ hɔka na mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma, m'osala aɔnɔ a Mizɛituni, balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ na sasɔ na otola otɔna Abɛcha wa lete leolo, yolo ya bikake byɔsɛ byabemɔninɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bebɛlɛ okya m'okana kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Kohalelwɛ Ɔlɔ kohochwa o chǐna lya Abɛcha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Talala lyebɛ hakolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">na Abɛcha kotɔnywɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka zabole 118.26</char></note>!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Haya, m'eya eoto ya bato mwebɛlɛ bamwɛ Bafalisayɔ* bɛnɛ ben'sambelɛ Yɛso kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, kaninaka balɔmbwɛ* bɔbɛ bashamɛ pi!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ela Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Nan'sambela, nǎmbɔ baba bahoshama pi, mawɛ nǎ mehunya maté!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso koholela yolo ya Yɛlusalɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yɛso hakehǐlɛ hɔka na mboka kya Yɛlusalema, hakekemɔninɛ, kwekelelelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Nǎmbɔ wenamaninɛ lenɔ byɛnɛ byenaoha talala! Ela ibibiswɛ o manɔ mɛngɔ, ushinabimɔ̂na! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ebalɔ masuku mechwa mɛnɛ tomango tɔbɛ tweongoloa yolo tolwɛ bita nɔ̌bɛ. Na mɛngɔ ma twekubaa loba lwa olekonga hɔka nɔ̌bɛ, tweohindilicha ngobe chɔsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Twěotɔkya hamwɛ̂chi na bato bɔbɛ. Bashishika ata lewɛ hakolo ha lengɛ, yolo ushimaninɛ mɛngɔ menɛ Abɛcha kwechǔlɛ wa wele oohɔnya.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwabenga bakuchi sɛsɛ kya Abɛcha*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yɔa 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekingelɛ n'sɛsɛ kya Abɛcha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛsɛ kya Abɛcha: hanɔ kyebɛlɛ eba ya lobonga mwɛnɛ bebɛlɛ okola bito bya otangela Abɛcha. Eyaka i bashi Bayola nǎ bebɛlɛ otɔnɛna Abɛcha haya. </char></note>*. Hakehǐlɛ n̂'ya, kwetolilɛ obenga baya bakuchi, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />m'obakanina kɛte: «Byebikɔliwɛ n'ta Lokɔlɔ Lohaha kɛte: ‹Sɛsɛ kyǎnyi kyěba sɛsɛ kya losabɔ.› Ela bɛnywɛ mwahokebea oba m'haɔ kwa bɛ̌bi!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka Isaya 56. 7; Yɛlɛmia 7.11</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Masuku mɔsɛ,Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmya n'sɛsɛ kya Abɛcha*. Ela, bahɛla ba bibole*, na nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ*hamwɛ̂chi na mahika, bebɛlɛ oɛba ndela kya om'hakya. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ela bashiɔshishɛ, ebalɔ bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ om'holecha wa yǒma yɛ̌nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Boɔmɛ bwa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lomwɛ lusuku, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ n'sɛsɛ kya Abɛcha*. N̂'ya kwebɛlɛ osɔmya bato Mwanɔ kosɔka. Hɔka haya, bahɛla ba bibole* na nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ* na mahika ma Bayola betɔbɔɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Otokaninɛ, wehoeta bibi byɔsɛ o ruhusa lwa nanyi? Aɔ i nanyi kwa oha bobo boɔmɛ bwa obieta?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Nɛnɛ lwanyi nem'bocha emwɛ enywa. Nganinakwɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Boɔmɛ bwa Yɔana bwa ochunda bato, bwehuminɛ wa Abɛcha aɔ o bato?»<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Obibyɔ, baya bato betolilɛ osambelana kɛte: «Nambɔ twahon'kǎ kɛte bwehuminɛ wa Abɛcha, kɛ lwakɛ kwetobocha kɛte: ‹Yolo yaé mushim'washishɛ?› <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Eyǎka twahon'kǎ kɛte bwahuma o bato, bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ behanɔ betohaka wa mawɛ. Ebalɔ bɔsɛ bebamanɛ bibɛnju kɛte Yɔana kwebɛlɛ n'languchi* kwa Abɛcha.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Nǎ ben'kailɛ kɛte: «Tushibamǎnɛ boya boɔmɛ́ bwa Yɔana bwehuminɛ hé.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yɛso kɛlwakɛ kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Na nɛnɛ nishin'kanina nehoeta bibi o boɔmɛ́ bwa nanyi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya baunyi babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwetɛlilɛ bato ê eta kɛte: «Webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to minɛ kweuninɛ lobala lwakɛ lwa mizabibu*. Koya n'to kwehɛlɛ bamwɛ bato loya lobala yolo babɛ olobola eba ya n'kembo mɛngɔ mabeba okembola. Ohwa, kwekělɛ ebalɔ ya kɔ mɛngɔ malǎhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Mɛngɔ ma n'kembo hamehǐlɛ, koya n'to kwehililɛ komwɛ hawǐngi habakichi bakɛ okya o baya balimi, yolo bam'hɛ yakɛ eba o koya n'kembo. Ela baya baunyi bem'hulilɛ na om'benga mabɔ̂ hɔlɔmbwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Koya minɛ lobala kwehililɛ eyaka kongɛ n'kichi. Ela kɛ lwakɛ baya baunyi bem'hulilɛ na on'toatoa, na om'benga mabɔ̂ hɔlɔmbwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Kwehililɛ eyaka kongɛ n'kichi kwa botato. Kɛlwakɛ, bem'bɔngolɛ na on'tɛla habamba ha lobala. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Obibyɔ, koya minɛ lobala kwelangilɛ kɛte: ‹Hanɔ naetɛ é? Nehila mwananyi kwandebabɛnja. Hamwɛ bem'holecha kɛnyikɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ela mɛngɔ mɛnɛ baya baunyi bem'mɔninɛ, betolilɛ okaninana kɛte: ‹Koya ate na m'hyanyi kwa lonɔ lobala! Tom'hakɛ, yolo toleshikalelɛ nǎlɔ.› <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ohwa, ben'tɛlilɛ habamba ha loya lobala, naom'haka.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Na Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ baya bato kɛte: ‹‹Obibyɔ, baya baunyi minɛ lobala kweeta nabɔ wé? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Kwechwa na obachimya na kwêha bangɛ baunyi loya lobala.» Bato lwabeholechɛ biya, bekaninɛ kɛte: «Bikɔkɔ nɛhɛ bîya bishitohǐlɛ ata hanɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ela, Yɛso kwebalɔlilɛ na obakanina kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">«Lolo Lokɔlɔ Lohaha lohobɛnja okana é:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Lewɛ lyɛnɛ bakubahi beɛminɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">nǎ lyesele lewɛ leolo lya n'sele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Zabuli 118.22</char></note>!›<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Obibyɔ, n'to kɛkɛsɛ kwekula o leya lewɛ, kweotoa bihende bihende</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:18">na koya minɛ kwalyekula, lyen'yuwa.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* na bahɛla ba bebole* bebɛnjichɛ om'wata Yɛso m'mɔka maya mɛngɔ, yolo bemaninɛ okana kwetɔkɔmɛ eya eta yolo yabɔ. Ela bebɛlɛ na bɔ̌ba bwa eoto ya bato. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Baya bahɛla ba Bayola betolilɛ om'heba Yɛso. Bem'hililɛ bato bɛnɛ belebîlɛ oba basɔka hambɛlɛ ha Abɛcha, yolo bam'bochɛ binywa bya om'wata. Beitilɛ biya, ebalo bebɛnjichɛ on'tambola m'mabɔ̂ ma bahɛla ba ebalɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olepa n'lambo wa Aisaliya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Baya bato ban'kaninɛ kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, bɛswɛ twebamǎnɛ kɛte byawebakana na osɔmya i bya kěnɛ. Eyǎka twebamanɛ kɛte ushibabakola bato, ela webasɔmya bato ndela kya kěnɛ kyebabɛnja Abɛcha. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Obinɔ, otokaninɛ nambɔ M'benda* kweto i kokanɛ olepa n'lámbo wa Aisaliya* bibɛnju aɔ nǎngo!»<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ela Yɛso kwemaninɛ kɛte behobɛnja on'tɛkɛla binywa, kwebakaninɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Mbɔnyakwɛ bomwɛ bomɔná. » Ohwa, kwebabuchichɛ kɛte: «O bobo bomɔná we yɛnyi ya nanyi na chǐna lya nanyi?» Ben'kailɛ kɛte: «I bya Aisaliya*.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Nǎ Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Obibyɔ, mobɛ om'ha Aisaliya* byɛnɛ byelěngyɛ oba byakɛ, na Abɛcha byɛnɛ byelěngyɛ oba byakɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Baya bato behulilwɛ enywa ya om'wata nayɔ ombɛlɛ wa bato. Ela bekakelwɛ wɛ̌nɛ na okaa wakɛ na beshaminɛ pi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohotɔkɔma yolo ya ukuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ohwa, bamwɛ Basalokayɔ*bechǔlɛ we Yɛso. Bɔ na baya bɛnɛ bebaɛma kɛte babú bekuka. Ben'kaninɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«N'lɔmbɔchi, Musa kwekɔlilɛ n'ta ndɔ kyɛto okana nambɔ n'to kwawa kushim'botɛ, byelěngyɛ n'shiwabɔ kohyanɛ́ koya m'achana n'shikwa, yolo kobotelɛ n'shiwabɔ minɛ kwebulɛ bǎna. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Obibyɔ, webɛlɛ baboswa njwe. M'boswa kwa n'tangí kwekɔndilɛ , ela kwebulɛ kushibutɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Kwa bobele kwehyaninɛ koya n'shikwa, ela kɛ lwakɛ kwe bulɛ kushibutilɛ nǎkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Na byebɛlɛ byɔka biya wa n'bɔswa kwa botato. Na bɔsɛ njwe bebulɛ bashibotelɛ ata mwǎna komwɛ̂chi. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Oesula, koya n'shikwa lwakɛ kwebulɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Obibyɔ, lusuku lwɛnɛ babu bekuka, koya n'shikwa kweba m'achi kwa nanyi? Yolo bɔsɛ njwe ben'kɔndilɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «M'enɔ ebalɔ, balomyana bebakɔnda na bǎchana na bebakɔnjwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ela, baya bɛnɛ Abɛcha kwemɔna okana belěngyɛ okukiwa, yolo bakingelɛ m'Boɔlɔ* bwɛnɛ bwechwa, bashǐkɔnda aɔ okɔnjwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bashiwa eyǎka. Obibyɔ, beba nɛhɛ bakɛnji*. Bɔ nǎ bǎna ba Abɛcha, yolo Abɛcha kwabakukya. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa kwemɔnyinyɛ hololo okana babu bekuka. Kwetɔkɔmɛ yolo ya bîya, hɛnɛ mikɔlɔ kyakɛ kweokana yolo ya kunji lyeholama. Haya, kwabocha Ɔlɔ kɛte: ‹Abɛcha kwa Ibulaimu, Abɛcha kwa Isaka, eyǎka Abɛcha kwa Yakɔbɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka ohuma 3.2, 6</char></note>.› » <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka kɛte: «Abɛcha, kwebabá Abɛcha kwa baya bɛnɛ be pɔ, ela kushibâbá Abɛcha kwa babú. Yolo bɔsɛ be pɔ wekele.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />chimwɛ nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ* chekaninɛ kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, wakana bibɛnju!» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Na haya, bashitɔndilɛ eyǎka om'bocha bingɛ binywa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilishito na Laole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ bato kɛte: «Yolo yaě bato behokana kɛte Kilishito* i Mwǎna kwa Laole? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Laole kɛ mǐnɛ kwatɔkɔmɛ n'ta etabɔ ya Sabole kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‹Ɔlɔ Abɛcha kwekaninɛ Ɔlɔ lyanyi kɛte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">"Chamaka olomɛ wanyi,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mpaka mɛngɔ mandebea tomango tɔbɛ ose wa makolo mɔbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka Zabole 110. 1</char></note>." ›<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />«Obǐnɔ, nambɔ Laole kwabochichɛ Kilishito* oba Ɔlɔ lyakɛ, iwé koko Kilishito* kwenaba eyǎka Mwǎna kwa Laole?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">olehɛnga na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ beleom'holecha Yɛso, kwekaninɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Mobɛ olehɛnga na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ*. Yolo chɔ chebabɛnja onyata chechichwálɛ ngobɔ chilǎhuchilahu. Na chebabɛnja otanyiwa waonyɛ̌mu o bibu bya bato bɛ̌ngi. Eyǎka chebabɛnja ochama m'bisuba bya bitangi n'shinagɔgi*, na o m'onda. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Chɛbasapa wa bwɛ̌ngɛ bǎchana bashikwa byɔsɛ byabele nǎbyɔ. Eyǎka chebasabá Abɛcha mɛngɔ malǎhu, yolo chelemɔnyɛ oba cha kěnɛ ombɛlɛ wa bato. Obibyɔ bɔnyibɔ behɛwa ateka oheta bângɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Lotange lwa n'shikwa mbuchu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yɛso hakebɛlɛ n'lobonga, kwelɔlilɛ wa obangelecha, kwemɔninɛ mbɔna byɛnɛ byachebɛlɛ otangela lotange lwabɔ n'ta etanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Kwemɔninɛ eyǎka m'achana n'shikwa mbuchu minɛ kwetangelɛ tofalanga tobele twɛnɛ tushinakola eto. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Obibyɔ, Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Ne hon'sambela kěnɛ, koko m'achana n'shikwa mbuchu nǎ kwatangela bomɔna bwǐngi oheta bato bɔsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ebalɔ bangɛ bɔsɛ batangela makoko ma bomɔna bwabɔ, ela koko m'achana n'shikwa mbuchu, kwatangela bomɔná bɔsɛ bwa mwɛkɔ kwakɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohokana yolo ya otɔkiwa wa lobonga lwa Yɛlusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bǎmwɛ bato bebɛlɛ okɔmbɔla yolo lobonga lwa Yɛlusalema. Bebɛlɛ okana kɛte i kikubaiwɛ bisɔka wa mawɛ mabɛnju hamwɛ̂chi na bito bibɛnju byɛnɛ bato betangelɛ wa Abɛcha. Ela Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Bibyɔ byɔsɛ byamwehomɔna, mechwa masuku mɛnɛ ushi lewɛ lyeshikala hakolo ha lêngɛ, byɔsɛ byetɔkiwa.» <figure style="fig" alt="Le temple de Jérusalem" file="LB00250b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="21.6">Lobonga lwa Yɛlusalɛma</figure><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Binywa byɛnɛ byechwa hambɛlɛ ha masuku esula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Nǎ baya bato bem'buchichɛ Yɛso kɛte: «N'lɔmbɔchi, biya byɔsɛ byhiya mɛngɔ naké? Na i abande naké emɔnya kɛte byahohiya?<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yɛso kwebakailɛ kɛte: «Shamakwɛ lwɛngɛ lolomɛ, yolo mushibikiwɛ! Ebalɔ bato bɛ̌ngi bechwa n'chǐna lyanyi. Bebaokana kɛte bɔ nǎ Kilishito! Na okana kɛte mɛngɔ mesele hɔka. Ela bɛnywɛ, mushibalamɛ! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Hamwebaoholecha myanɔ kya bita na aloke, mushibɛotekela. Ebalɔ byelěngyɛ biya byetangɛ ohiya, ela maya mɛngɔ esula měba mashinahiya.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwesambelɛ kɛte: «Elongɔ yeholana ná êngɛ. Na boɔlɔ bweholana ná bôngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Ebalɔ yɔsɛ weba etetecha eolo, na weba asɛnga na bisumi(épidemie) o bibu bǐngi. Na hakolo hehuma tobande twa okakecha na twa oha bato bɔ̌ba wɛ̌nɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Ela hambɛlɛ ha biya byɔ̂sɛ ohiya, bem'hamba na ben'subya. Na om'hicha otɔtɔla n'ta mashinagɔgi na ben'tɛla n'kolé. Mwehichiwa hambɛlɛ ha maɔlɔ na bahɛla, yolo yanyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Keyá kyeba ndela kya omɔnya bolɛhɔ bwɛnyu yolo yanyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Obibyɔ , byamwelɛ̌ngyɛ omana na bibi: mushibɛ oletɛnja hambɛlɛ, okana mwetɔkɔma ě. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Yolo nɛnɛ mǐnɛ nǎ nem'ha binywa bya lwɛnyi byaotɔkɔma byɛnɛ ata tomango twɛnyu tushiɔsha ohanya aɔ okaa byamwekana. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Ata bibushi byɛnyu na elɔngɔ yɛnyu na makɛnda mɛnyu ben'tambola hambɛlɛ ha bahɛla. Na bamwɛ hawǐngi hɛnyu behɛwa ateka a lubu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bato bɔse bem'ɔnywa yolo yanyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ela ata binɔ hushi ata lochuli lomwɛ̂chi lwa miswɛ kyɛ̌nyu lwechimina. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Mobeoɔmya mitema kwɛ̌nyu, yolo n'kekyɔ ndela nǎ mwehɔnya mwɛkɔ kwɛnyu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kweholangola otɔkiwa wa mboka kya Yɛlusalɛmu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyaka kɛte: «Mɛngɔ mamwemɔna mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma kechongoloiwɛ ná bilusha, manakwɛ kɛte, mɛngɔ , ma otɔkiwa wakyɔ mahohiya. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Obibyɔ M'mamɔ mɛngo, baya béba Yulɛya basenenɛ o toɔnɔ. Na baya béba m'mboka Yɛlusalɛma bahumɛ́ mɔ. Na baya bebá obitola bashisuelɛ eyǎka o mboka.<verse eid="LUK 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />«Ebalɔ maya masuku, meba masuku mɛnɛ Abɛcha kwêha bato ateka, yolo biya byɔsɛ byekɔliwɛ m'Mikɔlɔ Kehaha byewelelɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Ɔsɛa 9.7</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Maya masuku, weba kɛnɛ o bǎchana benamakumɔ na baya bɛnɛ beokɔkya! Yolo wêbá masoso maolo m'ebalɔ, na songo cha Abɛcha chechwa o ee elɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bamwɛ bato behakwa ná panga na bangɛ okuhiwa bacha m'bilɔngɔ byɔsɛ. Na mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma kyematelwa na bato ba bingɛ bilɔngɔ, ná byewelela mɛngɔ mabɔ ohuma.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ochwa wa Mwǎna kwa N'to</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Yɛso kwekelelelɛ okana kɛte: «Abande emɔnɛa n'ta chǒba na n'ta mwɛ̌chi na n'ta tombalambala. Ná m'enɔ ebalɔ bato beba na bɔ̌ba na masoso, yolo ya ebelelɔ ya n'naka na ya mabembe m'echiba. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bato bewa ebai na bɔ̌ba m'oɛmba binywa byehiya m'ebalɔ. Ebalɔ byɔsɛ byɛnɛ bye na boɔmɛ ha hakolo byetekechwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Ohwa, bemɔná nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to m'ochwa n'ta lisu ná boɔmɛ na butukufu*bwǐngi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ biya binywa byetolá uhiya kimanakwɛ na kinunakwɛ miswɛ, ebalɔ mɛngɔ ma ohɔna wɛnyu mesele hɔ̂ka.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eta ya n'te kwa n'tini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ohwa bîya, Yɛso kwebatɛlilɛ bato ee etá kɛte: «M'bɛlɔla n'te kwa n'tini na kengɛ mite kyɔsɛ! <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Hamwebamɔna byǎnyi bya n'tini byesele otɔmbɛla, manakwɛ kɛte etɛlɔ ebɛnju yesele hɔka. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Byɔka bîya, hamwemɔna biya bikɔkɔ byesele oetea, manakwɛ kɛte Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwesele hɔka. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Kěnɛ nehon'sambela, kɛte bibi binywa byewelela mɛngɔ mɛnɛ bamwɛ hawǐngi ha bato ba enɔ elɔngɔ bashinawa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Kolo na ebalɔ byeheta, ela binywa byanyi bishiheta ata hinɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ohɛmba osuela wa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ eyǎka kɛte: «Shamakwɛ lwɛngɛ lolomɛ! Yolo mitema kyɛ̌nu kishinyɛmɛnywɛ ka na mionda na bɔ̌lwa. Na moshiletɛnjɛ yolo ya mwɛkɔ kwɛnyu. Nambɔ bishi bîya, loya lusuku lwa osuela wa Kilishito* lwehiya wa on'tulumunya, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />nɛhɛ biya kɔchi lyebahyoa. Yolo loya lusuku lwe hiyá o bato bɔsɛ ba ebalɔ wa otulumunya. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Obibyɔ, mobɛ mɛ̌sɔ, mobɛ osaba Abɛcha mɛngɔ mɔsɛ. Nambɔ mwaeta biya, mweba ná oɔma wa oepuka biya byɔsɛ byɛnɛ byehiya, na okimanɛ hambɛlɛ hanɛ nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />N'chǒba, Yɛso kwebɛlɛ osɔmya bato n'ta Lobonga*. Ela busuku kwebɛlɛ okya obeta o aɔnɔ a Mizɛituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Bato bɔsɛ bebɛlɛ okya o lobonga m'ɛshi kɔsɛ, yolo bam'holechɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">M'hungɔ kwa om'haka Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yɔa 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Halweǐlɛ lusuku lwa m'monda kwa mikatɛ kishikibiiwɛ n'shimi*, kôbuchiwa Pasaka*lwebɛlɛ hɔka, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />bahɛla ba bibole* na nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ* betolilɛ oɛba ndela kya om'hakya Yɛso, ela bebɛlɛ na bɔ̌ba bwa bato.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yola kwakitabowa otambola Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Nǎ Ehengele kwen'kingelɛ Yola, minɛ kwebɛlɛ buchiwa Ishikaliyɔti. Koko Yola kwebɛlɛ komwɛ hawǐngi ha bakikiwa* umi na babele ba Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Koya Yola kwekělɛ oholechanya na bahɛla ba bibole* na bahɛla ba bilusha bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ ohɛmba lobonga, yolo ya ndela kya kebatambolela Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Besɛ̌lɛlɛ wɛ̌nɛ, na ben'kaninɛ kɛte bem'ha bomɔná. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yola kwekitabowɛ, na kwetolilɛ oɛba mɛngɔ mabɛnju maken'tambola Yɛso wabele, bila bato omana.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kweholɔngya elewa ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yɔa 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Lusuku lwa m'monda kwa mikatɛ kishikibiiwɛ n'shimi* lwehǐlɛ. Loya lusuku nǎ lusuku lwɛnɛ bebɛlɛ ohaka bǎna ba miɔɔ, yolo ya m'onda kwa pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yɛso kwehililɛ Pɛtɛlɔ na Yɔana na obakanina kɛte: «M'bɛ̌kya otolɔngɛcha elewa ya Pasaka*.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Wabɛnja tokyɛ olɔngɛcha eya elewa ohe?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Kɛ kɛte: «Holechakwɛ: mɛngɔ mamwehiya m'mboka, mwebanga komwɛ̌ n'lomyana kwe n'tɛtɛ n'tɔndɔ kwa mǎte, môn'lamɛ m'paka o sɛsɛ kyakekingela. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Na mon'kaninɛ koya minɛ keya sɛsɛ kɛte: ‹N'lɔmbɔchi kwabocha i ohé we yomba yakelela elewa ya m'monda kwa Pasaka hamwêchi na balɔmbwɛ bakɛ.› <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Kɛ kwěm'mɔnya yomba eolo ya hakolo ya elɔngiwɛ. N̂'ya nǎ mwamwelɔngɛcha elewa ya asaka!» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Baya balɔmbwɛ* bekělɛ o keya mboka. Oya, bebangilɛ bito byɔsɛ bilɔngiwɛ byɛnɛ byebasambelɛ Yɛso. Nǎ byabelɔngichɛ elewá ya Pasaka*.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elewa oɛngɛlɛcha ya Ɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kɔ 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Hamehǐlɛ mɛngɔ ma oya, Yeso kweshaminɛ hamwɛ̂chi ná bakikiwa* bakɛ umi na babelɛ oya elewa. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «Nabɛnja wɛ̌nɛ oya ê elewa ya Pasaka hamwɛchi nɛ̌nyu, hambɛlɛ ha nɛnɛ ososoa! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Yolo nehon'sambelá kěnɛ okana nishǐya eyaka ya pasaka, m'paka lusuku lwandeya n'ta Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha*.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ohwa haya, Yɛso kwetɛtilɛ esɛngɔ ya livai, kwen'tɔninɛ Abɛcha, na okana kɛte: «Kohakwɛ ee esɛngɔ, mokabanyanyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Yolo nan'kanina, nishǐnywa eyaka livai*, m'paka mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha* bwehiya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekuhilɛ n'katɛ na otɔna Abɛcha, ohwa otɔna Abɛcha, kwenɔkilɛ koya n'katɛ na okabanya o balɔmbwɛ bakɛ. Na okaná kɛte: «Konɔ nǎ m'bele kwanyi kwɛnɛ kwatambolwa yolo yɛnyu. Mobeoeta binɔ wa okɛngɛlɛcha.»<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Mɛngɔ mabehulɛ oya, Yɛso kwekuhilɛ esɛngɔ na obakanina kɛte: «Enɔ esɛngɔ i alakɔ ahya* a Abɛcha, ohetela mashí manyi mamwakeá yolo yɛnyu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ela molɔlɛ! Koya minɛ kwetambola, nǎ nehoya nǎkɛ hamwɛ̂chi. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Kěnɛ nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nelewela olamana na byekaninɛ Abɛcha. Ela in'shicha wa koya minɛ kwetambola.» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Nǎ betolilɛ obochana bɔka wabɔka kɛte i nanyi hawǐngi habɔ minɛ kwenaeta biya.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus mange la nourriture de pâques avec ses apôtres" file="WA03910b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.23">Yɛso kwehoya elewa ya pasaka hamwɛ̂chi na bakikiwa* bakɛ</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pǎ cha ba Yɛso yolo ya bohɛla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Ohwa, hawingi ha balɔmbwɛ ba Yɛso we huminɛ pǎ kɛte, i nanyi nǎ m'hɛla hawǐngi habɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Maɔlɔ ma bilɔngɔ mebakimanina bato babɔ wa oɔma. Na baya bɛnɛ be na boɔmɛ hakolo ha bato, bebalebocha "Basɔka"  <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ela bɛnywɛ mushibɛ oeta biya. Koya minɛ kwe m'hɛla hawǐngi hɛnyu, kolebeɛ nɛhɛ kɛ nǎ mwanyuwɛ. Na minɛ kohokimanina bangɛ kolebeɛ nɛhɛ kɛ nǎ n'kichi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Obibyɔ, i nanyi minɛ kwe m'hɛla oheta minǎkɛ hawingi ha banɔ babele? i koya minɛ kwen'shamɛ m'oya aɔ i koya kohom'ha? Atambɛ i koya minɛ kwen'chamɛ m'oya elewa! Ela Ata biya, nɛnɛ nee hawǐngi hɛnyu nɛhɛ n'kichi.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Bɛnywɛ nǎ mwaihya ochama nanyi mɛngɔ mɔsɛ ma bikinjwa byanyi, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Obibyɔ, nam'ha Boɔlɔ*, nɛhɛ byenɛ tata kwebopɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Obibyɔ mwêya na onywa hamwɛchi nǎnyi m'Boɔlɔ bwanyi, eyaka bɛnywɛ nǎ mwechama m'bilemba bya boɔlɔ na mweha ateka biya bilɔngɔ umi na bibele bya Ishilaɛli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohokana kɛte Pɛtɛlɔ kwem'hanya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yɔa 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yɛso kwekaninɛ Shimɔ Pɛtɛlɔ kɛte: «Shimɔ,Shimɔ! Holechaka! Ehengele kwem'hɛwɛ loosa lwa om'ota, nɛhɛ byɛnɛ byebaota nganɔ, yolo kon'tɔndɛ <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ela nǎsaba yolo yɔbɛ, yolo washa lyɔbɛ wandele lishihongowɛ. Na mɛngɔ mawesuwelela, ohɛ bashiwɛnyu n'tema.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Pɛtɛlɔ kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, nahwa olelɔngya wa okya nɔ̌bɛ n'kolé na ata owa nɔ̌bɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yɛso lwakɛ kɛte: «Pɛtɛlɔ, naokanina, lenɔ, hambɛlɛ ha akɔngɔ otoka, wepanya nyɛndɔ chitato, okana ushingiti.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olelɔngya yolo ya masoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ohwa Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ kɛte: «Mɛngɔ mandem'hililɛ, bila bomɔná na bila ahwaba na bila mikalabanda, mweholilwɛ eto?» Ben'kailɛ kɛte: «Nǎngo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Nǎ Yɛso kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Ela wa binɔ, koya minɛ kwe na hibomɔná kokohɛ, byɔka bîya koya minɛ kwe na ahwaba, na koya minɛ kushi na selete kokochɛ ngobɔ chakɛ, yolo kolekolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Yolo, nan'kanina: byelěngyɛ bibi binywa byepiilɛ, byɛnɛ byebâba bikɔliwɛ m'Mikɔlɔ Kehaha kɛte: ‹Kwěbaliwɛ hamwɛchi na bilomɛ pamba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmaka Isaya 53.12</char></note>.› Yolo, biya byekɔliwɛ yolo yanyi, byesele hɔka na ohiya oesula.»<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Balɔmbwɛ bakɛ ben'kaninɛ kɛte: «Ɔlɔ, lɔlaka hanɔ twe na panga chibele.» Kwebakaninɛ: «Bibi binywa byahulɛ hahɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohosaba o aɔnɔ a Mizɛituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yɛso kwehuminɛ haya, na kwehɛlilɛ o aɔnɔ a Mizɛituni nɛhɛ kɔlɔbɛchi kyǎkɛ. Balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ ben'laminɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Mɛngɔ makehǐlɛ ha eya ibu, kwekaninɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ kɛte: «Sabakwɛ Abɛcha yolo mushikingelɛ m'bikinjwa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ohwa, kweshikanɛ nabɔ olahu hinɛ wa olaha wa n'to otɛla lewɛ. Kwebungilɛ machú hasé, na kwetolilɛ osaba Abɛcha kɛte: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Tata, nambɔ webɛnja, opunyinyɛ ée esɛngɔ ya masoso olahu nanyi! Ata bînɔ ushibɛ obɛnja wanyi, ela byawebɛnja nǎ byabɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:42">[ <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ohwa n'kɛnji kwechǔlɛ ohumá hakolo yolo ya om'ɔmya n'tema. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yɛso kwebɛlɛ n'ta anyɔtɛla hɛ̌nɛ, kwekelelelɛ osaba Abɛcha na oɔma wɛnɛ, yǒta yɛnɛ yɛbɛlɛ om'uma yɛbɛlɛ nɛhɛ matata ma mashí mebɛlɛ okwa hasé.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ohwa osaba, kwesuwelɛ ha ibu hɛnɛ yebɛlɛ balɔmbwɛ* bakɛ. Kwebabangilɛ babetɛ, yolo beiminywɛ ná onyɔngɔtɛla. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Yolo ya é mwabeta? Byowakwɛ na mosabɛ Abɛcha, yolo mushikingelɛ m'bikinjwa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwawaswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yɔa 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ Yɛso kwebɛlɛ kwele otɔkɔma, eoto ya bato yetɔbɔɛ. Yola, komwɛ kwa bakikiwa umi na babele nǎ kwebalɔmbɔlɛ. Kwasɛninɛ hɔka na Yɛso, yolo ya on'yambelela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ela Yɛso kwem'bochichɛ kɛte: «Yola! We, watambola nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to m'oyambelela?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Balɔmbwɛ bakɛ habemɔninɛ byɛnɛ byehobɛnja oetea, bem'buchichɛ: «Ɔlɔ, twenabachuta na selete chɛto?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na komwɛ hawǐngi habɔ hɔka haya, kwealilɛ n'kichi kwa ebolɛ m'hɛla leto lya olomɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ela Yɛso kwekaninɛ kɛte: «Lɛakwɛ bibyɔ.» Kweuminɛ litó lya koya n'to, na kwem'hɔnyinyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwekaninɛ bahɛla ba bibole, na bahɛla ba bilusha bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ ohɛmba lobonga, na baongo ba Bayola bɛnɛ bechǔlɛ om'wata kɛte: ‹‹Yolo yaé mwanjula na maselete na toté nɛhɛ nɛnɛ nee elomɛ pamba?  <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Masuku mɔsɛ nibɛlɛ nǎnyi n'lobonga, na mushimbwatilɛ. Ela manɔ nǎ mɛngɔ mɛnyu, eyǎka nǎ mɛngɔ ma boɔmɛ bwa n'tɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɛtɛlɔ kwam'hanya Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yɔa 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ohwa, baya bato bem'watilɛ Yɛso. Bekělɛ nakɛ o sɛsɛ kya m'hɛla kwa bibolɛ *. Pɛtɛlɔ kwebɛlɛ on'lama wa kɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ahya ebɛlɛ alamiwɛ hawǐngi ha lakala lya m'hɛla kwa bibole*, Pɛtɛlɔ kweshaminɛ m'ohɔta ahya hamwɛchi nǎbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Komwɛ hawǐngi ha bakichi bǎchana hakem'mɔninɛ pɛtɛlɔ kwen'shamɛ hɔka na ahya, kwen'lɔlilɛ wɛ̌nɛ na okana: «Koko n'to lwakɛ kwebɛlɛ hamwɛchi yɛso.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ela Pɛtɛlɔ kweɛminɛ na okana kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ m'achana! Nɛnɛ nishikiti koko n'to!»<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Mɛngɔ manɛ oheta, kongɛ n'to kwem'mɔninɛ Pɛtɛlɔ, na kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ wee komwɛ kwǎbɔ ka!» Ela Pɛtɛlɔ kwekailɛ: «Nǎngo! Nɛnɛ nishi komwɛ kwǎbɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ohwa oheta olanga saa kemwɛchi, kongɛ n'to kwehyelelɛ Pɛtɛlɔ kɛte: «Chikelwɛ koko n'to kwebɛlɛ hamwɛchi na yɛso ka, ebalɔ kɛ lwakɛ i n'to kwa Galilaya!» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ela Pɛtɛlɔ kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Ee Kɔkwɛ! Nishikiti yɛnɛ ohobɛnja otɔkɔma!» Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kwebɛlɛ kwele otɔkɔma biya, hɔka haya akɔgɔ nôtoka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Hɔka haya, Ɔlɔ kwekalowɛ, na on'lɔla Pɛtɛlɔ ebangabanga. Nǎ Pɛtɛlɔ kwehɛngɛlɛchɛ biya byɛnɛ Ɔlɔ kwen'kaninɛ kɛte: «Lenɔ, hambɛlɛ ha akɔngo otoka, wêba wesele m'pǎnyɛ nyɛndɔ chitato.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Nǎ hɔka haya Pɛtɛlɔ kwehuminɛ haya, na kwetolilɛ olela wɛ̌nɛ wa anyɔngɔtɛla.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bato ban'towa Yɛso na om'hola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Baya bato bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ ohɛmba Yɛso, bebɛlɛ on'sɛa na om'hola. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bem'ahambilɛ mɛ̌sɔ, na om'bocha kɛte: «I nanyi minɛ kweohola? Langolaka tomɔnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ben'tɔkɔmɛ bingɛ binywa bǐngi bya on'toa.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso hambɛlɛ ha makoko ma Bayaole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yɔa 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ahehǐlɛ ham'mɛshi kɔsɛ, makoko* ma Bayola na bahɛla ba bibole* na nɔmbɔchi cha ndɔ* besombelɛ. Bechulɛ na Yɛso hambɛlɛ ha makoko* mabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bɔ nôm'bocha kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ Mashiya*? Otokaninɛ!» Kɛlwakɛ kɛte: «Nambɔ nan'kanina, mushimbwasha, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ata nambɔ naom'bocha enywa eto, mushingaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ela hɔka hanɔ, Nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nekya oshama olomɛ wa Abɛcha kwe na boɔmɛ́.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bɔsɛ bem'buchichɛ kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ Mwǎna kwa Abɛcha?» Kwebakailɛ: «Bɛnywɛ nǎ mwakana.»<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ohwa, bekaninɛ bɔka wa bɔka kɛte: «Tushilěngyɛ oɛba angɛ alɛhɔ yolo ya koko n'to! Ebalɔ bɛswɛ bɛ̌nɛ twaholecha binywa byakeotɔkɔma.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yɛso kohotɔtɔla hambɛlɛ ha Pilatɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yɔa 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ohwa bîya, bɔsɛ besambanɛ o makoko ma Bayola bekimanɛ na om'hicha Yɛso hambɛlɛ ha Pilatɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Haya betolilɛ on'shitaki Yɛso m'okana kɛte: «Koko n'to twam'banga kohosɔsɛla bato ba elɔngɔ yɛto yolo bahanyɛ bahɛla, m'okana bashilepɛ n'lambo wa Aisalia. Eyǎka koholebocha kɛte kɛ nǎ Ɔlɔ, Kilishito. »<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilatɔ kwem'buchichɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ Ɔlɔ lya Bayola?» Yɛso kwen'kailɛ: «Kɔkwɛ nǎ kwǎkana!» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilatɔ kwesambelɛ bahɛla ba bibole* na eya eoto ya bato kɛte: «Nɛnɛ nishiomɔna ata ebalɔ emwɛ̌chi enaeta koko n'to kohɛwɛ ateka.»<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ela baya bato be hindilichɛ okana kɛte: «Koko n'to m'masɔmɔ makɛ, kohosɔsɛla bato bahanyɛ bahɛla ba ebalɔ yɔsɛ ya Yulɛa. Kwetolilɛ Galilaya na lenɔ kwǎhiya nalɔ hanɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahichiwa wa Hɛlɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilatɔ hakeholechɛ bîya, kwebuchichɛ bato kɛte: «We, koko n'to i N'galilaya?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ben'kailɛ kɛte: «Ae, i n'to kwa Galilaya.» Hɛlɔdɛ nǎ kwebɛlɛ ɔlɔ lya Galilaya. M'maya masuku Hɛlɔlɛ kwebɛlɛ Yɛlusalɛma. Nǎ Pilatɔ kwehichichɛ Yɛso wakele.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Hɛlɔlɛ kwewasilwɛ na sasɔ wɛ̌nɛ hakemɔninɛ Yɛso. Masuku mɛ̌ngi kwebɛlɛ bɛnja om'mɔna. Yolo kwebɛlɛ holecha bato behotɔkɔma myanɔ kyǎkɛ. Eyǎka, kwebɛlɛ bɛnja omɔna Yɛso kohoeta bikake. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Obibyɔ, Hɛlɔlɛ kwem'buchichɛ Yɛso binywa bǐngi, ela Yɛso kushikailɛ enywa. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bahɛla ba bibole* na nɔmbɔchi cha Ndɔ*, bɛnɛ bebɛlɛ haya betɔkɔmɛ wa buhuchi m'oshitaki Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hɛlɔlɛ na bilusha byakɛ, bebɛlɛ on'sɛa na om'ɛcha, na on'chuya ngobɔ kebɛnju wɛ̌nɛ. Ohwa ben'suechɛ wa Pilatɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Hɛlɔlɛ na Pilatɔ bebɛlɛ babakanɛ haya hambɛlɛ. Ela tango loya lusuku bekaloɛ oba makɛnda.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwahɛwa ateka a lubu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yɔa 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Ohwa bîya, Pilatɔ kwesambanyɛ bahɛla ba bibole na baɔngo ba Bayola hamwɛchi na bato, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kwebakaninɛ bînɔ: «Mwachwa na konɔ n'to wanyi m'okana kɛte kwaba osɔsɛla bato bahanyɛ bahɛla. Bînɔ holechiwɛ! Ohwa otɔtɔbɔla ee enywa hambɛlɛ hɛnyu, nasamɔna ebalɔ ya kɛ ohɛwa ateka, olamana na mashitaki mɛnyu yolo yakɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ata Hɛlɔlɛ lwakɛ kushim'mɔnɛ emwɛ ebalɔ, na yolo kwan'suecha wanyi. Koko n'to kosaeta bomwɛ bobé bwelěngyɛ kowɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Yolo ya bîya, nem'hocha tote, ohwa nen'lɛa. » [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />O mionda kyɔsɛ kya Pasaka*, Pilatɔ kwebɛlɛ sulila bato komwɛ m'hambwa.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ela bɔsɛ hamwɛ̂chi beitilɛ yɔka okana kɛte: «Hakyaka koko n'to na otosulilɛ Balaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Koya Balaba kwebɛlɛ n'tɛlwɛ n'ta kole, ebalɔ kweitilɛ aloke na ohanya bahɛla ba Balɔma, eyǎka kwehakilɛ n'to.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilatɔ kwebɛlɛ obɛnja on'sula Yɛso, obîya kwetɔkɔmɛ eyǎka na bato. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ela bɔsɛ beitilɛ eyǎka yɔka okana kɛte: «M'beakɛ on'salaba, m'beakɛ on'salaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pitatɔ kwebakaninɛ lwɛndɔ lwa botato kɛte: «Kwaeta bobé nake? Nishiomɔna bobé wakele bwelěngyɛ kohakwɛ. Obibyɔ, něm'hocha tote, ohwa, nên'sula.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ela bato behemanɛ oeta yɔka yǒlo, kɛte Yɛso kobeewɛ ka on'salaba. Oesula, mate mabɔ mem'himinɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Nǎ Pilatɔ kweetelɛ baya bato byabebɛnjichɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Ohwa, Kwebasulilɛ Balaba, ata okana kwehanyinyɛ bahɛla ba elɔma na ohaka n'to, nǎ Pilatɔ kwebahɛlɛ Yɛso bam'etɛ byabehobɛnja.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwabewa on'salaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yɔa 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Bilusha habyebɛlɛ okya na Yɛso o ibu ya om'bea o n'salaba, be sambanɛ na komwɛ n'to kohobuchiwa Shimɔni kwa mboka kya Kulɛnɛ. Koya Shimɔni kwebɛlɛ huma omabala. Bem'watilɛ na on'suya koya n'salaba, kokotɛ̌tɛ unyuma wa Yɛso.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Eoto ya bato yebɛlɛ on'lama Yɛso. M'eya eoto mwebɛlɛ bǎchana bebɛlɛ on'lela wɛ̌nɛ na oɔmbɔlɛza. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yɛso kwebakaloelɛ na obakanina kɛte: «Ee bam'ma ba Yɛlusalema! Mushindelelɛ nɛnɛ! Ela molelelelɛ bɛnywɛ bɛ̌nɛ ná bǎna bɛnyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ebalɔ mɛngɔ mesele hɔka, mɛnɛ bato bekana kɛte: ‹Komba o bǎchana bikomba bashibabota na bashibakɔkya!› <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />M'mamɔ masuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">bato betola okanina toɔnɔ kɛte: ‹Totokǔlɛ›</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">na byolokolo kɛte: ‹byetochǐɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Ɔsɛa 10.8</char></note>!› <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ebalɔ, nǎmbɔ bato beongeta bînɔ, nɛnɛ minɛ nee nɛhɛ n'te kwa kobese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:31">byebá we o bɛnywɛ be nɛhɛ mite kya kikumu?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Webɛlɛ eyǎka bilomɛ pamba bibelɛ byɛnɛ byekuhilwɛ yolo byebiwɛ on'salaba hamwɛchi na Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Habehǐlɛ ha ibu yeobuchiwa: «Abɔmbɔ», bilusha byem'biilɛ Yɛso on'salaba hamwɛchi na biya bilomɛ pamba bibele, komwɛ lǒbe lwakɛ lwa olomɛ lwa Yɛso, kongɛ lǒbe lwakɛ lwa oachi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Ohwa, Yɛso kwe kaninɛ kɛte: «Tata, obalɛ̌lɛlɛ, ebalɔ bashiomana byabehoeta!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Ohwa, biya bilusha byêtilɛ bosɔbɔchi wa okabanya ngobɔ kya Yɛso.  <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bato bebɛlɛ bakimanɛ haya m'olɔla. Bahɛla ba Bayola bebɛlɛ on'sɛa Yɛso okana kɛte: «Kwebɛlɛ ohɔnya bângɛ, obinɔ kolehɔnyɛ kɛ mǐnɛ, nambɔ kɛnyikɛ nǎ Kilishito*, minɛ Abɛcha kwesɔbɔlɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Bilusha lwabyɔ byetolilɛ on'sɛa Yɛso. Byen'kelelɛ yolo byen'nyoshɛ livai lya lekǎku. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />byebɛlɛ okana kɛte: «Nǎmbɔ kokwɛ nǎ ɔlɔ lya bayola, lehɔnyakɛ kɔkwɛ mǐnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />byɔka bîya hakolo ha n'swɛ kwa Yɛso, webɛlɛ obiiwɛ hilobaɔ hyɛnɛ bekɔlilɛ hakolo hahyo kɛte: «Koko nǎ ɔlɔ lya Bayola.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Komwɛ hawingi ha biya bilomɛ pamba bibele byɛnɛ byebiiwɛ on'salaba, kwetolilɛ on'toa Yɛso kɛte: «Atambɛ kɔkwɛ nǎ kilishitu*! Obibyɔ, olehɔnyɛ kokwɛ minɛ na otohɔnyɛ lwɛto!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ela koya kongɛ kɛ kwen'kɔwɛlɛ minǎkɛ okana kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ ushi na bɔ̌ba bwa Abɛcha ata nǎmbɔ wahɛwa ateka a lubu hamwɛ̌chi na koko n'to? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Wɛto bɛswɛ i kěnɛ, ebalɔ twelěngyɛ ohɛwa akɔɛlɔ a bikɔkɔ byɛto. Ela koko n'to kɛs kwasaeta bomwɛ bobé.»<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Hanyuma ha eya elomɛ pamba okanina minǎkɛ biya, yekaninɛ Yɛso kɛte: «Ee Yɛso! Okɛngɛlɛchɛ hawechwa nɛhɛ Ɔlɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yɛso kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Kěnɛ naosambela, lyɔka lênɔ wohochama hamwɛchi nǎnyi Palalisɔ*.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwǎwa o n'salaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yɔa 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />Mɛngɔ mebɛlɛ olanga saa n'toba cha chǒba, chǒba lyechiminɛ na n'tɔ kwekingelɛ ebalɔ yɔsɛ na byehǐlɛ saa lyahabola, na ngobɔ kyɛnɛ kyebɛlɛ kyehambwɛ n'lobonga* kye kyekuliyɛ hawǐgi biba bibele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.44-45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keya ngobɔ kyebɛlɛ okabanya Ibu Ehaha na Ibu Ehaha ya Ehaha ya lobonga*. Bahɛla ba bibole, bɔ bɛ̌nɛ ka nǎ bebɛlɛ oheta keya ngobɔ wa osambana na Abɛcha. Obibyɔ, Abɛcha kwekulilɛ keya ngobɔ wa omɔnya kɛte kwabǎlwa kwenan'sɛnɛna. Sɔmakwɛ Ohuma 26.31-33; Baɛbulania 10.19-22.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yɛso kwekabilɛ wa lete leolo kɛte: «Tata, nabea n'tema kwanyi m'mabɔ̂ mɔbɛ.» Hakehule otɔkɔma biya, kwealilɛ n'tema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Sabole 31.6</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />M'maya mɛngɔ, koya m'hɛla kwa bilusha hakemɔninɛ biya byeeteɛ, kwetɔninɛ Abɛcha okana: «Chikelwɛ koko n'to kwebɛlɛ kwa kěnɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Bato bɔsɛ bɛnɛ bechulɛ omɔna biya bikɔkɔ byêteɛ, behɔmbɔlɔɛ bɔsɛ wabɔ m'okya nalekɔmba o byǎle wa anyɔngɔtɛla. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Makɛnda ma Yɛso na baya bǎchana ben'laminɛ ohuma Galilaya bebɛlɛ bakimanɛ wa kɔ m'olɔla byɛnɛ byebɛlɛ oetea.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwachiiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yɔa 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Webɛlɛ komwɛ n'to kwebɛlɛ obuchiwa Yosofo kwa mboka kya Alimatayɔ, mébalɔ ya Yolɛa. Koya Yosofo kwebɛlɛ n'to n'sɔka eyǎka kwa kěnɛ. Kwebɛlɛ ohɛmba ochwa wa Boɔlɔ bwa Abɛcha. Ayaka kwebɛlɛ komwɛ kwa makoko maolo ma Bayola*. Ela kɛ kushiholechanyɛ na bɛnǎkɛ m'm'hungɔ kwa ohaka Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Koya Yosofo kwekělɛ wa Pilatɔ, osaba etomba kwa Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ohwa, kwekosachichɛ ohuma o n'salaba, kwekobungilɛ n'ta sanda, na okobea n'ta echwatɛ yebɛlɛ ebatiwɛ n'ta lwana. Eya echwate ishibɛlɛ nachǐwa n'to. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Loya lusuku, lwebɛlɛ lusuku lwa matanɔ. Na Sabatɔ* kyesebɛle hɔka.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Baya bǎchana bɛnɛ bechule na Yɛso ohuma Galilaya, bebɛlɛ olama Yosofo, yolo bakyɛ omɔna eya echwate na byabebea m'mbele kwa Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ohwa, besuelɛ osɛsɛ olɔngya mauta na mwambɔ kwa obɔnga m'bele kwa Yɛso. Lusuku lwa Sabatɔ belehɔchichɛ byabyele bikanɛ m'benda.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Okuka wa Yɛso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yɔa 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Lusuku lwa inga ham'mɛshi kɔsɛ, baya bǎchana beɛlɛlɛ o echwate, bebatɛtɛ mauta na mwambɔ kwabelɔngichɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bebangilɛ lewɛ lyebɛlɛ libǐwɛ o n'changɔ kwa echwate lye lebongoloshiwɛ habamba. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ela habekingelɛ n'ta mwa echwate, bashimɔninɛ m'bele kwa Ɔlɔ Yɛso. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Eya eto ebakakechɛ wɛ̌nɛ. Habebɛlɛ beleokakelwa, hɔka haya bemɔninɛ bato babele bachwalɛ ngobɔ chihaha wɛ̌nɛ, bebɛlɛ bakimanɛ hɔka nǎbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Obibyɔ baya bǎchana bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba, bekinyiɛ byɛnyi byabɔ hasé. Ela baya bato bebakaninɛ kɛte: «Yolo ya é mwehoɛbala m'babu koya minɛ kwe na mwɛkɔ?  <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Kushi eyǎka hanɔ, kwahokuka! Moɛngɛlɛchɛ biya byaken'kaninɛ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kwebɛlɛ kwěle Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Atambɛ kwekaninɛ kɛte: ‹Nɛnɛ Mwǎna kwa N'to nelěngyɛ otambolwa o bato babe, na bɔnyibɔ besosola o n'salaba, ela masuku matato hanyuma ha owa wanyi, nekuka.› »<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Haya, baya bǎchana beɛngɛlɛchɛ binywa byɛnɛ Yɛso kwebasambelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Behuminɛ o eya echwate, bekělɛ okanina bakikiwa ba Yɛso umi na komwɛ̂chi na bǎngɛ bato bɔsɛ koya mwanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Bǎchana bɛnɛ betɔkɔmɛ koya mwanɔ nǎ banɔ: Malia kwa mboka kya Magilalɛnɛ na Yɔanɛ na Malia n'nakɛ kwa Yakɔbɔ na bǎngɛ bǎchana. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ela bakikiwa belangilɛ kɛte byabebɛlɛ tɔkɔma baya bǎchana, bibɛlɛ bya bonɛnɛ, na bashibawashishɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ela Pɛtɛlɔ kɛ kwechuilɛ, na okya abelɔ mpaka o eya echwate. Hakehǐlɛ ɔ, kwekinamɛ na olengamina n'ta, kwemɔninɛ sanda ka bonɛnɛ, lyɛnɛ lyebɛlɛ libungiwɛ m'bele kwa Yɛso. Ohwa kwesuwelɛ o sɛsɛ m'okakelwa yolo ya binywa byɛnɛ byêteɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwatɔbɔɛla balɔmbwɛ bakɛ babelɛ n'tɛla kya Ɛmau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lɔka loya lusuku, balɔmbwɛ babele ba Yɛso bebɛlɛ okya o mboka kyebɛlɛ buchiwa Ɛmau. Keya mboka kyebɛlɛ olanga o bilɔmɛtɛlɛ umi na kemwɛchi na mboka keolo kya Yɛlusalɛma. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bebɛlɛ okya na tɔkɔma yolo ya biya binywa byɔsɛ byêteɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Mɛngɔ mabebɛlɛ bele otɔkɔma, na obochana, Yɛso kɛ mǐnɛ kwebatɔbɔɛlɛ na onyata nabɔ hamwɛchi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bem'mɔninɛ, ela mɛ̌sɔ mabɔ mechibilwɛ bashim'mǎnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Mohokya natɔkɔma yolo ya ě?» Bekimanɛ wa anyɔngɔtɛla. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Komwɛ hawǐngi habɔ chǐna lyakɛ Kelɛɔpa kwen'kailɛ kɛte: «Kɔkwɛ ka nǎ n'to kwa Yɛlusalɛma kushim'mǎnɛ byɛnɛ byahetea m'manɔ mabele?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Kɛlwakɛ kwen'kailɛ: «I binywa naké?» Ben'kailɛ kɛte: «Twehotɔkɔma yolo ya binywa byɛnɛ byem'hǐlɛ Yɛso kwa Nazalɛti! Koko Yɛso kwebɛlɛ n'languchi* m'olo. Eyǎka kwemɔnyinyɛ boɔmɛ bwakɛ o binywa byakɛ na o bikake byakɛ ombɛlɛ wa Abɛcha na ombɛlɛ wa bato bɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />«Bahɛla ba bibole* na baongo bɛto ben'tambolɛ yolo kohɛwɛ ateka a owa. Ohwa, bem'beilɛ o n'salaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Twebɛlɛ outakela okana kɛnyikɛ nǎ kwenahɔnyinyɛ Ishilaɛli. Ela, lenɔ nǎ lusuku lwa botato tango biya binywa byaeteɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Eyǎka, bamwɛ bǎchana ba eoto yɛto betokakechɛ. Baya bǎchana beyɛlɛlɛ ham'mɛshi kɔsɛ o echwate, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ela bashibangilɛ m'bele kwakɛ. Besuwelɛ na otokanina mwanɔ kɛte bakɛnji* bebahuminɛ na bebakaninɛ kɛte Yɛso kwemwɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Ohwa, bamwɛ hawǐngi hɛto bekělɛ o echwate na bebangilɛ byɛnɛ baya bǎchana bekaninɛ. Bɔ lwabɔ, bashimɔninɛ m'bele kwakɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Nǎ Yɛso kwekaninɛ baya balɔmbwɛ kɛte: «Bɛnywɛ bato bashi na lwɛ̌nyi, mitema kyɛ̌nyu kye bushitɔ wa owasha abelɔ biya byɛnɛ ŋanguchi* cha Abɛcha chekaninɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />byabalěngyɛ Kilishito kohetele manɔ masoso yolo kokingela n'ta butukufu bwakɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ohwa, kwebakaninɛ binywa byɛnɛ ibikɔliwɛ yolo yakɛ n'ta Mikɔlɔ Kehaha. Kwetolelɛ o bitabɔ bya Musa, mpaka o bitabɔ bya ŋanguchi* chɔsɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Mɛngɔ mabebɛlɛ hɔka na keya mboka kyabebɛlɛ okya, Yɛso kweitilɛ nɛhɛ kohokelelela na lwɛndɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ela ben'tɛndɛlɛlɛ kɛte: «Ebombo enɔ: nǎngo okya eyǎka, busuku bwesele hɔka.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">Obibyɔ, kwekingelɛ n'sɛsɛ na ochama nabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Mɛngɔ mabebɛlɛ hasé m'oya, Yɛso kwekuhilɛ n'katɛ na oha Abɛcha buswachi, ohwa kwenɔkilɛ koya n'katɛ na obakabanyinya. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Hɔka haya mɛ̌sɔ mabɔ mesuliyɛ na bem'maninɛ, ela Yɛso kwechiminɛ o mɛ̌sɔ mabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Betolilɛ okaninana kɛte: «Mitema kyɛto kyaba na sasɔ mɛngɔ mɛnɛ kwǎba otokanina n'tela na ototɔtɔbɔlɛla Mikɔlɔ Kehaha.»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Hɔka haya, baya balɔmbwɛ babele bechuilɛ na osuwela Yɛlusalɛma. Bebangilɛ baya bakikiwa* umi na komwɛchi ba Yɛso na bangɛ baeoto yabɔ basambanɛ hamwɛchi. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Baya bɛnɛ besambanɛ bekaninɛ baya balɔmbwɛ babele kɛte: «Kěnɛ, Ɔlɔ kwakuka! Ata Shimɔni Kwam'mɔna!»<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Nǎ baya balɔmbwɛ babele bebakaninɛ byɔsɛ byɛnɛ byebahǐlɛ n'tela, na byɛnɛ bem'maninɛ Yɛso mɛngɔ makenɔkilɛ n'katɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwatɔbɔɛla balɔmbwɛ bakɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yɔa 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bkk 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Mɛngɔ mɛnɛ baya balɔmbwɛ babelɛ bebɛlɛ bele obakanina, hɔka haya Yeso kɛ mǐnɛ kwetɔbɔɛ hawǐngi habɔ. Kwebasambelɛ kɛte: «Mobɛ na talala!»<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Baya balɔmbwɛ bɔsɛ betulumuɛ na bewasilwɛ na bɔ̌ba bwɛ̌nɛ, yolo belangilɛ okana bamɔná m'ishi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ela Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Lwɛ̌nyi lwan'chongoloa yolo yaé? Yolo ya é mwena matoba m'mitema kyɛnyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Molɔlɛ masanda manyi na makolo manyi, i nɛnɛ konɔ kěnɛ! Mombabatɛ na mombɔnɛ, yolo m'ishi kushibaba na m'bele na mauta. Ela nɛnɛ mwambɔna nee nǎbyɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɛso kwekaninɛ bîya yolo balɔmbwɛ* bamɔnɛ mihunya kya misomale m'masanda makɛ na makolo makɛ. Kwebɛnjichɛ bawashɛ kěnɛ kɛte nǎ kɛ</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ohwa okana biya, Yɛso kwebamɔnyinyɛ masanda na makolo makɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Baya balɔmbwɛ bebɛlɛ bashinawashá yolo ya sasɔ na okakelwa wabɔ. Obibyɔ,Yɛso kwebabuchichɛ kɛte: «Mwe na emwɛ eto ya oya hanɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bem'hɛlɛ ehende ya swé ya echɛ̌lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Kwěkuhilɛ na kwělelɛ hambɛlɛ habɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ohwa, kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Mɛngɔ mandebɛlɛ nele hamwɛchi nɛ̌nyu, n'sambelɛ kɛte: ‹Binywa byɛnɛ byekɔliwɛ yolo yanyi n'ta m'benda* kwa Musa , na n'ta bitabɔ bya ŋanguchi na n'ta Saboli, byelěngyɛ owelela byɔsɛ.› »<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Nǎ Yɛso kwebasulilɛ lwɛ̌nyi lwabɔ yolo batɔtɔbɔlɛ Mikɔlɔ Kehaha. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Eyǎka kwebakaninɛ kɛte: «Byebikɔliwɛ okana: Byelěngyɛ Kilishito* kososoɛ na masuku matato hanyuma ha owa wakɛ kokukɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Isaya 53; Hɔsɛa 6.2</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Na ohetela chǐna lyakɛ, nǎ bekanina bato bɔsɛ kɛte balekiluchɛ na ohuma m'bobé bwabɔ, yolo balɛɛlɛlwɛ. Na bîya byetolelɛ Yɛlusalɛma. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Bɛnywɛ nǎ tolɛhɔ twa bibi binywa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na nɛnɛ nem'hilila koya minɛ Tata kwen'lakilɛ. Ela bɛnywɛ, motangɛ ochama m'mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma m'paka mɛngɔ mamwehɛwa boɔmɛ́ ohuma hakolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmakwɛ Bikɔkɔ bya bakikiwa 1.4-5</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛso kwǎhɛla hakolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bkk 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ohwa, Yɛso bechuilɛ na balɔmbwɛ* m'mboka kya Yɛlusalɛma, na okya nǎbɔ hɔka na mboka kya Bɛtania. Habehǐlɛ haya kwetondolɛ mabɔ̂ makɛ hakolo, na obahalela. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Mɛngɔ makebɛlɛ kwele obahalela, kwebashikilɛ, na kwekuhilwɛ hakolo. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus va au ciel" file="WA03935b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="24.51">Yɛso kwakuhiwa hakolo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Bɔlwabɔ, ben'nyɛmbɛtɛlɛ. Ohwa, besuwelɛ Yɛlusalɛma m'osɛ̌lɛla wɛ̌nɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Masuku mɔsɛ bebɛlɛ n'ta lobongá* m'on'tɔna Abɛcha.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>